<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CH" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">2 Heleuhha</para>
  <para style="toc1">Heleuhha Laisiukwak Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Heleuhha Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Hel.</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Chronicles</para>
  <para style="mt">Heleuhha Laisiukwak Kenabe</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Heleuhha kenabe de David hegwangria ha rau jüja pet. Pesau 1-9 ga Solomon hegwang tingdau kerecaki ketei ha raugai. Pesau 10-36 ga hegwangram ngkangbe Judah rasam gade Jerusalem kengkap nah minadung de Babylon ga hebaang tuiteutet kecu ha raugai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide, Heleuhha keraibe nzwa, mina Tinggwang de ngngwa kelungzai de nlangtu lie eh liagai. Keraube hegwangme ha keraudau pa penui Tinggwang dade lungsang kecu gade mdetgai. Keraube kemau gwangpeidung hegwangketei ha rau zette gai, dede hegwang keyimedung hegwang ketei ha au rau mteiki gai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Solomon hegwangketei (1:1-9:31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Judah gwangpeidung (10:1-36:14)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jerusalem teikau kedi (36:15-23)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CH 1" />
  <para style="s">Solomon maci kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 1:1" />Hegwangpei David napei Solomon de pe kedih teingkieng beu, nah RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang pecu ngngwala nah pecu tei ngkieng süt beu. <verse eid="2CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 1:2" />Solomon Israelme pelane de, pecang nah pehai reugwamuibedung, nah tutiakmedung, nah Israel pelane ga kedihme leune, nah kelak peumedung dage marang gai. <verse eid="2CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 1:3" />Cine Solomon nah pecu ngngwa kela hemaabe pelane Gibeon namdi ga kebam reca ni ga miedi, cika Tinggwang kebam paiki de kebamne, RAMPAUBE kilabe Moses, hetaideu gade tei kelude. <verse eid="2CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 1:4" />Dede David Tinggwang Samkakbung de Kiriath Jearim namceu gade pa cide ziemne heni mteipwa kebam gage pwa nghang gailu, kedanemene pa cide ziemne Jerusalem ga paiki ge teipwa kebam ne. <verse eid="2CH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 1:5" />Ci rünne mene, hetageu recabam Hur capei Uri napei Bezalel ne tei kelude RAMPAUBE kebam paiki dwa ga kebam ne; Solomon nah mina ngkwa kebamme cika miedi. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa hegwa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">hetageu recabam Hur capei, Uri napei ne tei kelude, pa RAMPAUBE kebam paiki dwa gage kaidi </char> aika<char style="fqa">pa </char> de kecude David de rangbam. </note> <verse eid="2CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 1:6" />Solomon hetageu recabam ga RAMPAUBE dwa ga nghanglu, RAMPAUBE kebam paiki, nah keru recadung cang ge cikage reca tei gaibeu.<verse eid="2CH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 1:7" />Cipau ziude Tinggwang Solomon de peu pecu ngaugai nah pe dage keteu, “Ncu peu daipai peu neu labi kie lulo!” <verse eid="2CH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 1:8" />Solomon Tinggwang dage rangdi, “Nang a pei David dage samkakkelu kesamsang kedi liagai da, nah pe bam ga acu peu hegwang tei luda. <verse eid="2CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 1:9" />Cu, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, a pei David dage nang sampet kelude teicang beulo, kedanemene nang acu kideu ga mina rebui nzwa peikap kelak kieege reu hegwang tei kelune. <verse eid="2CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 1:10" />Cu acu kemteu nah maci peulo, iciude Ih mina aidungde puisau teilu kerane, kedanemene n minadung kekiee kebamde de caune teulu laino?” <verse eid="2CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 1:11" />Tinggwang Solomon dage ranggai, “Aide n mlung ga kebam, nah nang maheidung, mabam mede ketwa, mede ncu kengkaume keringria, mede nang ring tielu kera kie kemakne, dede nkatei ziemne nang kemteu nah maci kie, iciu eh nang, Ih ncu penui reu hegwang tei kebam a minadung de teulu kerane, nah Ih ainzwa tei beuzie. <verse eid="2CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 1:12" />Ih cu ncu kemteu nah maci peu zie. Ih ncu mahei, mabam, nah hetwa de peu zie, ndwa hegwangmedung mige de bam kemak, nah ncai migede de ngau gai kelak ge.” <verse eid="2CH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 1:13" />Cine Solomon Gibeon ga kebam reca ni gade Jerusalem ga gwanglu, RAMPAUBE kebam paiki dwa gade; pa Israel reu hegwang teidi.<verse eid="2CH 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 1:14" />Solomon bagidung nah hekwen keteume de hekwalu, nah pa bagidung 1,400 nah hekwen keteume cang kereiehkena pa bagi namdidung ga kaipwa kebamdung bam, nah hegwangpei taiga, Jerusalem gage kainzeu pwa bam. <verse eid="2CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 1:15" />Hegwangpei rangkanggeu nah kecak teingkiee pwa Jerusalem ga tangtsukangdung nzwadi, nah pa cedar tsing teingkiee pwa caimün bangdung hangdeu kehenah ga kebamdung nzwadi. <verse eid="2CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 1:16" />Solomon ziemne Egypt nah Kue gade hekwendung teukegwang, pe lila keteime pemi ge taklwe Kue gade cidungde luilu. <verse eid="2CH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 1:17" />Penui Egypt gade rangkanggeu shekel hai herok le bagi ket nah hekwen ge shekel 150 le teugwang lu. Penui cidungde Hittime nah Aramme gwangpeidung dage de langgai beula.<verse eid="2CH 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kerecaki teikera ketelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 2:1" />Cu Solomon RAMPAUBE zi ziemne kerecaki ge tei kera nah pe hegwangram ziemne hegwangki ge tei kera riem lu. <verse eid="2CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 2:2" />Solomon mina cang riakhena de maniadung pwa kera, nah mina cang riakheset de lamlwatudung ga tangtsu pang kerane, nah mina 3,600 de penuide rengei kerane nlum beudi. <verse eid="2CH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 2:3" />Solomon Tyre gwangpei Hiram dage sam ge langgai eh ranggai, “Nang a pei David dage ketei nzwa, pecu lungh kerane ki ge tei kera cedar lwadung langkegai nzwa, acu ngngwa cinzwa tei beulo. <verse eid="2CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 2:4" />Pielo, Ih a Tinggwang RAMPAUBE zi ziemne kerecaki ge teizie, cide pe ziemne heni kemci ge zie, pe dwaga marim kehenguidung rugai kerane, Tinggwang de recakebeu tangku de kai kerane, nah tingcang nah tinghegi keru recadung ziemne, Sabbath benai nah Keici Ngyidung ziemne, nah RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang hengyi tingdau ziemne. Aide kelungta Israelme ziemne. <verse eid="2CH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 2:5" />Ih tei kerabe ki de disüt zie, kedanemene anui Tinggwang au hera kedadung swa diki lu. <verse eid="2CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 2:6" />Dede cau Tinggwang kerecaki ge teilu buino? Kedanemene tingkideu pelane nah tinggim kecangde pecu mrak gailak lu? Pecu ki ge teibeu kera Ih cauno, pe dwaga ratakdung rugaibeu kera gwale? <verse eid="2CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 2:7" />Cine acu kecak, rangkanggeu, hetageu, hegeu, nah gieremang, kegie, nah mamai kenzai, ta tei kecime gede langgai beulo, tsing gage ketsamtsam teilu kebui keci gede. Pa Judah deukui pelane nah Jerusalem namdi ga ada kebam matei kecime, a pei David ne kepeudung de de ngngwa bam zie. <verse eid="2CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 2:8" />Acu Lebanon gade cedar, cypress, nah algum bangdung de si eh langgailo, kedanemene Lebanon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lebanon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lebanon de naimiak kepetle Mediterranean reukung tingpeule Palestine ga lamlwatu gede rangbam Lei. 92:12; 104:16</char></note> ga n kilamedung dainzwa tsing dang labi ci kecu Ih cibam kecune. Ainie, a kilamedung n kilamedung de ngngwa bam zie, <verse eid="2CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 2:9" />a ziemne tsing kekiee ge mteilu kerane, kedanemene Ih ki teilai kebamde disüt, nah miswakegah ge zielu. <verse eid="2CH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 2:10" />Pielo, Ih n kilamedung de tsing dang keramedung, wheat cors cang ngkai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cors cang ngkai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">4,400 kiloliter</char></note>, barley cors cang ngkai, zau baths cang ngkai, nah maca baths cang ngkai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Baths cang ngkai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">420 kiloliter</char></note> peu zie.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiudung kesa ga, </char><char style="fqa">wheat cors cang ngkai ketyeipok ziemne, de eh rau pwa bam </char> </note><verse eid="2CH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 2:11" />Pecai Tyre gwangpei Hiram, kerau gade sam keligai, cide pa Solomon dage langgai: “RAMPAUBE pe minadung de ku kecune, pa ncu pwa penui reu hegwang tei luda.” <verse eid="2CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 2:12" />Pecaide, Hiram rangdi, “RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, tinggim nah kideu tei kegaibe de twa lu, pa David hegwangpei de kemteu napei ge peuda, kemriak nah kecikecet le puih eh, pa RAMPAUBE ziemne kerecaki ge nah pekatei ziemne hegwangki ge tei zie. <verse eid="2CH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 2:13" />Cu Ih heciem teikeci pei ge Huram-Abi de langgaila, pa au kecikecet le kepuih pei ge. <verse eid="2CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 2:14" />Pa au Dan leuhme napuime puige napei. Pe pei Tyre deudi gade kegwangme ge. Pa au kecak, rangkanggeu, hetageu, hegeu, tangtsu, nah tsing, nah gieremang, kenzai nah mamai kegie, nah langcimpai, teu heta tei kecime ge. Pa au mamie keheri ta keheibede tei nah perehi keheibe ketei gade heciem cilie. Peu heni ge pe ziemne n ta teikecime nah a mpaupei n pei David, ta keteime kakga mteibeu lulo. <verse eid="2CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 2:15" />Cine cu, wheat nah barley, maca nah zau, a mpaupei rang kebamde, aidungde pecu peu pe kilamedung dage langgai lu. <verse eid="2CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 2:16" />Anui nang tsing teumaikesia kieege Lebanon gade tsing bi beuzie. Anui cide kangkecüt lwe Joppa ga jaaidi gade n dage punggwang beuzie, nah nang cide Jerusalem ga pung nghanglu zie.”<verse eid="2CH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 2:17" />Solomon Israel deu ga kebam sangme pelane de peigai, pe pei David, penuide kepei nzwa eh. Penui mina 153,600 peilu. <verse eid="2CH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 2:18" />Pa penui mina cang riakhena de mapwa kera, mina cang riakheset de peu lamlwatudung ga tangtsu pang kera, nah 3,600 de peu mina de matei lu kera rengei kerane nlum beudi.<verse eid="2CH 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CH 3" />
  <para style="s">Solomon kerecaki ketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 3:1" />Pecai Solomon Moriah Deutu ga Jerusalem gage RAMPAUBE ki tei cuhdi, RAMPAUBE pe pei David de peu pecu ngaukegai ga. Pa David ne riempwa kebam heni de mteilu, Jebusme pei Ornan hecaipung gage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:47">Bat. 7:47</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 3:2" />Pa kei nabe kei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kei nabe kei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kei nabe kei de Ziv de msiak lu. Aipau Jewme kei de au kei mdai sum dau ge mdeu la</char></note> langnane benai tei cuhdi, pa hegwang teikelu mmi mdaibe kum. <verse eid="2CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 3:3" />Cu pe bangdwabe petie pedi Tinggwang ki ziemne Solomon dwa kecu aidungde da. Ndaa cubit ndet kelade nzui eh petie cai cubit riakherok,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit riakherok </char><char style="ft" closed="false">metre 27.6 da </char></note> nah pedi cai cubit ngkai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit ngkai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">metre 9.2 da. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 3:4" />Ki dwaga kebam kigu de petie cubit ngkai, ki pedi de nzwakap. Pehu de cubit ngkai, nah Solomon pelungki de kecak kemci le kamlu. <verse eid="2CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 3:5" />Pa cypress tsing le kibung kedide zu teilu, cide pa kecak kemci le kemailu, nah pa cide gage palm bangdung nah hegeuria rehidung teigai. <verse eid="2CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 3:6" />Pa ki de tangtsu pemi kehungbe le tei hezuyi lu; kecak au Parvaim cuikui gade teugwang. <verse eid="2CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 3:7" />Pa hesumdung, kikamtsiadung, tangdeudung, nah kikamdung de kecak le kemai lu; pa tangdeudung gage cherubim mie teigailu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cherubim de au kecak pe hesiu tei eh mamie tei pwa bam kecu kena cide Tinggwang kengkieng nah pa bam kecu de keulia kebam ge</char><char style="ft" closed="false" /></note><verse eid="2CH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 3:8" />Pa heni mcitube de teilu. Cide petie ki di ge, cubit ngkai, nah pedi de cubit ngkai. Pa cide kecak kemci, talent hai herok<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Talent hai herok </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilogram 20400 da.</char></note> mi ge le kemailu. <verse eid="2CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 3:9" />Gojaldung perüt kecak shekels riakngei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">shekels riakngei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">gram 570</char></note>. Pa kibung nreube dungde kecak le kemai lu.<verse eid="2CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 3:10" />Pa heni mcitube ziemne cherubim mie kena teilu; hebaciem keyime ci kenade kecak le kemai lu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">cherubim mie tsing le tei kelu kena, de eh bam</char> </note> <verse eid="2CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 3:11" />Cherubim hesiudung pelane ncüt ge petie cubit ngkai; cherub ket hesiu cai petie cubit mengei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit mengei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2.3 metres</char></note>, kibung tangdeu ga pet cang; pe hesiu kedade de cubit mengei, cherub kedabe hesiu tungcang. <verse eid="2CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 3:12" />Cherub kedabe hesiu de cai cubit mengei, kibung tangdeu ga pet cang; pe hesiu kedade de cubit mengei, cherub keraibe hesiu de tungcang ge. <verse eid="2CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 3:13" />Cherubim aipau kenade hesiudung pelane ge cubit ngkai nzang petlu. Cherubim penai pi ga saplu, penai zu kibung sum lambie nreulwe. <verse eid="2CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 3:14" />Pa kehezupai kemjai, gieremang, nah mamai kegie nah langcimpai keyibe le teilu, nah pa cide gage cherubim rehi teilu.<verse eid="2CH 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 3:15" />Solomon ki dwaga ziemne tsiapum kena gede teilu, kena nade pehu cubit camrei-mengei;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit camrei-mengei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">52.5 feet mede 16.5 metre </char></note> cide kena peureu ga kebam peukang de pehu cubit mengei ge. <verse eid="2CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 3:16" />Pa tsiapum kenade ziemne hegeuriadung teilu nah cide hetsia kena peureu gage kailu; pa kuraletsi haige de teilu delwe hegeuriadung gage keu gailu. <verse eid="2CH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 3:17" />Pa kerecaki dwa gage tsiapum kena sumlu, ket zetle bie nah kedabe hile bie; pa zetle kebam tsiapum de de Jakin lie qulu, nah hile kebam tsiapum de de Boaz lie qulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jakin pekie ‘Tinggwang ne ndeu gai,’ Boaz pekie ‘Tinggwang au ngkieng.’</char></note><verse eid="2CH 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CH 4" />
  <para style="s">Kerecaki lungnia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 4:1" />Cipaureu de Hegwangpei Solomon hetageu gu recabam ge teilu; petie cai cubit ngkai, nah pedi cai cubit ngkai. Pe hu cai cubit kerei. <verse eid="2CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 4:2" />Pa hetageu duibau kenggwa ge de teilu, petu penggwa cubit kerei. Pehu cubit mengei, nah duibau twagwa kecu cubit camrei. <verse eid="2CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 4:3" />Duibau mungleu twagwa kebam de kangga hetumseu miedung bam, cubit kerei ge, duibau de tei kecudau duibau cide ncüt eh kedeu keluge. <verse eid="2CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 4:4" />Mabung kedi “Jaaidi” de eh qu kelude de ketumseu kereiehkena reu gage kailu, kecum tingtünle pie bam, nah kecum naimiak kenlütle pie bam, kecum tingbangle pie bam, nah kecum naimiak kepetle pie bam. “Jaaidi” de penui reu gage kai pwa bam, nah penui caile pelane de pelung lambie bam. <verse eid="2CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 4:5" />“Jaaidi” de au badeu siu ge, nah cide mungleu au hepiak mungleu nzwa teilu, teizuine pa kebam nzwa. “Jaaidi” de dui baths cangcum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Baths cangcum </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Litre 60,000 </char></note> bam lula. <verse eid="2CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 4:6" />Pa mahui kerane duibung kerei de teilu; pa mengei tingbangle ge kailu, nah mengei tingtünle; keru reca tei kerane teu kecudung cidung gade huila. Duibung kedi “Jaaidi” de qu kelade cai cingkumedung penuide hui kemci ga teula.<verse eid="2CH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 4:7" />Pa kecak mitaubungbam kerei, cidungde tei lulo kebeu rehi gade teilu; pa cidungde kerecaki gage kailu, zetle bie ge mengei, nah hile bie ge mengei. <verse eid="2CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 4:8" />Pa mabam kerei teilu delwe kerecaki gage cidungde kailu, zetle bie ge mengei, nah hile bie ge mengei. Pa kecak kwak haige teilu. <verse eid="2CH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 4:9" />Pecaide pa cingkumedung kigu ge teilu, nah tutiakbam kedi ge nah tutiakbam ziemne kikamdung nah kikam cidungde hetageu le kemai lu. <verse eid="2CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 4:10" />Pa duibung “Jaaidi” de qu kelade tingbangle nreu eh kerecaki naimiak kepetle tu gage kailu. <verse eid="2CH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 4:11" />Huram lidung, peitwakdung, nah hekwakdung teilu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CH 4:11">Iciu eh Huram hegeuta ketei mpaube Tinggwang ki ga Hegwangpei Solomon ziemne heta tei kecude tei canglu: <verse eid="2CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 4:12" />tsiapum kenade, makwak-kenzwa peukang tsiapum kenade peu ga kebamde, nah tsiapum kenade peu ga makwak-kenzwa peukang kena kebamde gum kerane hegeuria pwa kenzeu kenade. <verse eid="2CH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 4:13" />Pa hegeuria pwa kenzeu kenade ziemne kuraletsi hai mdai teilu: kuraletsi ria na hegeuria ket ziemne makwak-kenzwa peukang kena de tsiapum peu ga kebamde gum kerane. <verse eid="2CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 4:14" />Pa kedungbam de nah duibungdung kedungbam gage kaikera de teilu; <verse eid="2CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 4:15" />duibau ge nah cide kangga ketumseu kereiehkena, <verse eid="2CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 4:16" />lidung, peitwakdung, hetei litia de, nah ma keda niadung pelane Huram-Abi Hegwangpei Solomon ziemne, RAMPAUBE ki ziemne hetageu kemci le teilu. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga</char><char style="fqa">heteih litia</char> de mene <char style="fqa">kwakdung </char> de eh bam. </note> <verse eid="2CH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 4:17" />Hegwangpei cidungde Jordan langkam gade teilu, Succoth penai Zarethan namceudung kakga lidei deu gade. <verse eid="2CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 4:18" />Cinzwa eh Solomon li aidung pelane kiee süt eh teilu; kesang, hetageu perüt daikieege bi cicang gailak di.<verse eid="2CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 4:19" />Solomon Tinggwang ki ga kebam mania pelane teilu, kecak recabam de de, nah Tinggwang de reca kebeu tangku kai kera kekaibamdung de; <verse eid="2CH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 4:20" />mitaubung bamdung nah pe mitaubung, helungle kibung dwaga mtau kerane tei kelude—aidungde kecak kemcile teilu; <verse eid="2CH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 4:21" />nah mapadung, mitaubungdung, nah kensieptiedung, kecak gu, kecak kemcibe. <verse eid="2CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 4:22" />Mitaubung tei kemmüttiedung, lidung, hepiaktiadung, nah kehengui kerunet dungde de si eh pelane kecak kemcile teilu. Kilung kenlüt ga cai, kilung heni mcitu ga kelüt kikamdung nah kerecaki kenlüt kikamdung decai, kecak le teikap lu.<verse eid="2CH 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 5:1" />RAMPAUBE kerecaki ziemne hegwangpei Solomon heta pelane teicang keludau, Solomon, pe pei David heta aide ziemne kaitsam kenzeu maniadung de pwa nlütlu, rangkanggeu, kecak, nah maniadung leune de si eh, pa cidungde Tinggwang ki mabam kibungdung gage kaidi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Heg 7:51</char></note><verse eid="2CH 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samkakbung kerecaki ga teugwang kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 5:2" />Pecai Solomon Israel hangkiamedung, heleuhdung peumedung pelane, nah Israelme kelak muiteumedung de Jerusalem gage qu hekwalu, David nam, cide Zion, gade RAMPAUBE samkakbung de teugwanglu kerane. <verse eid="2CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 5:3" />Israel gu muiteume pelane hengyi ga hegwangpei dwaga gwang ngkwalu, cide kei hena bekei.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev 23:34-43</char></note> <verse eid="2CH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 5:4" />Israel hangkiame leune gwanglu, nah Levime samkakbung de pwa cuhlu. <verse eid="2CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 5:5" />Penui samkakbung de, RAMPAUBE kebam paiki, nah paiki ga kebam manya kemci pelane pwa nghang lu. Cingkume Levi leuhmedung ma aidungde pwa nghang lu. <verse eid="2CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 5:6" />Hegwangpei Solomon nah ngkwa kebam Israelme pelane samkakbung dwaga gwang ngkwa lu, meurün nah hetumseu peikap gai kelak ratak teigai eh. <verse eid="2CH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 5:7" />Cingkumedung RAMPAUBE samkakbung de pebam gage pwa gwanggai lu, kilung helungbe bung ga, heni mcitube ga, cherubim hesiu kangga ge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:6">1 Heg. 8:6</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 8:7">7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 5:8" />Kedanemene cherubim penai hesiudung de samkakbung reu gage siulim kelune, nah cidungde ne samkakbung nah cide kepwa tiedung de gumlu. <verse eid="2CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 5:9" />Kepwa tie kenade tiezu kecune petündung de helungbe bung heni mcitube dwa gade ngaula, dede kepwa tie kenade hegwale de ngau lama. Kepwa tie kenade henai kecang de bam. <verse eid="2CH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 5:10" />Israelme Egypt gade tetkempet dau, RAMPAUBE Israelme de ngngwa samkak keludau, Moses ne Horeb <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Horeb </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinai lamlwatu</char></note>gade tangtsukwak kena kai kenzeude gwale samkakbung ga magede bam ma.<verse eid="2CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 5:11" />Cingkumedung heni kemci gade cidau tetmpetlu. Cingkume kebam pelane penuide maa mzidung nzwa swa mene, RAMPAUBE dade penuide teimci lu. <verse eid="2CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 5:12" />Levime lei keteimedung de, penui pelane, Asaph, Heman, Jeduthun de si, nah penui napeidung nah sinamedung, langcimpai teulu delwe ntwaidung, leibungdung, nah lyredung, kwa eh recabam kepetlebie tu ga saplu. Penuide nzang eh cingkume 120 telui kwabam. <verse eid="2CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 5:13" />Cidau ting telui kekwame nah lei keteime leitei ngkwa bam, kwa ge tei eh RAMPAUBE de twa nah hetwa peulu kerane. Penui teluidung nah ntwaidung nah leinet kedadung teu eh kwahu sahgai delwe penui RAMPAUBE de twadi. Penui lei teigai, “Kedanemene pa au yilie, pe samkak kelu kelungta bamla kecune.” Pecai kerecaki, RAMPAUBE kerecaki cide hemwa ne puidi. <verse eid="2CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 5:14" />Cingkumedung hemwa ziemne sap eh hegwa tei luta di, RAMPAUBE gu kendu pe kerecaki pui kedine.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keu. 15:8, Tet. 40:35</char></note><verse eid="2CH 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CH 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 6:1" />Pecai Hegwangpei Solomon kekie tei, “RAMPAUBE au muiting kecu ga lungh zie lie pa rang lie, <verse eid="2CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 6:2" />Dede Ih ncu ki kedi ge teibeu dida, n ziemne heni ge kelungta lunghla kera.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:13">Lei. 132:13</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 132:14">14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 6:3" />Pecai Israel ngqwa pelane sap kebam dau, hegwangpei nreu tegwa gai eh Israel ngqwa pelane de samlam beu.<verse eid="2CH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 6:4" />Pa rangdi, “Peu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, de twa lulo, a pei David dage marang kegaibe, nah cide pekatei pe bale teicang kebeu da, ainzwa ranggai, <verse eid="2CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 6:5" />Tinggwang Solomon dage ranggai, ‘Ih a minadung de Egypt deu gade ngngwa mpet kelube nai gade, peu a zi cika bamlu kerane Ih Israel leuh pelane gade, namdi ket de kedet luma ki ge tei kerane. Mede peu a mina Israelme reu kedi tei kerane Ih migede de kedet luma. <verse eid="2CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 6:6" />Ciuliede, Ih Jerusalem de kedet lu, iciu eh a zi cika bamlu kerane, nah Ih David de a mina Israel reu kedi tei kera kedetlu.’ <verse eid="2CH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 6:7" />RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang zi ziemne kerecaki ge teikera cu a pei David mlung ga ladi. <verse eid="2CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 6:8" />Dede RAMPAUBE a pei David dage rangdi, ‘N mlung ga a zi ziemne kerecaki ge tei kera la dida, n mlung ga kela cide nang tei hemi delie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:18">1 Heg. 8:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 6:9" />Dede, nang ki cide tei kerabe ma; meliene, n na, n pum gade kegwangbe, ne a zi ziemne ki cide teibeu zie.’ <verse eid="2CH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 6:10" />RAMPAUBE pa rang kegaide heta teilu, Ih a pei David bam ga cuhlu de kecune, nah Ih Israel hegwangbam ga bamlu de kecune, RAMPAUBE rang kebeu nzwa. Ih Israel Tinggwang RAMPAUBE zi ziemne kerecaki cide tei luda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:12">1 Heg. 2:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 6:11" />Ih Kerecaki gage samkakbung de kai luda, cika RAMPAUBE samkak kelude bamla, pa cide Israelme de ngngwa teilu.”<verse eid="2CH 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomon teikemci kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 6:12" />Solomon au RAMPAUBE recabam dwaga Israel ngkwa kebam pelane dwa ga saplu delwe pe ba hwa lwe kekie tei. <verse eid="2CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 6:13" />Pa au hetageu bamde teilu, petie cubit mengei, pedi cubit mengei, nah pehu cubit kecum. Pa cide kigu sum gage kaidi. Pa cide reuga saplu nah Israelme ngkwa kebam pelane dwaga keumie lu, nah iciu eh pa pe ba kena tinggimdung lebie ge kekie tei eh hetwa gai. <verse eid="2CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 6:14" />Pa kiegai, “RAMPAUBO, Israel Tinggwang, tinggimdung mede kideu ga nang kenzwa Tinggwang gah, n kilame penui mlung pelane teu eh n dwaga tet kelame de samkak kelu nah keku bammui kela de de kainzeu kelabe; <verse eid="2CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 6:15" />Nang au n kilabe a pei David dage, nang n sampet kebeude kainzeu luda. Yeo, nang n muile rang da, nah cide n bale teicang luda, henai teicang kelu nzwa. <verse eid="2CH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 6:16" />Cu cine, RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, n kilabe a pei David dage nang sampet kelude teicang lulo, nang, ‘Nnui a dwaga Israel hegwangbam ga mina bam kera gah dilak, nnui leuhmedung a zai ga tet sünne lucai, nnui a dwaga tet eh kegwang nzwa,’ de eh kerang de. <verse eid="2CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 6:17" />Cine cu, RAMPAUBO, Israel Tinggwang, peu n sam de teicang gailo, nang n kilabe David dage rang kegai nzwa.<verse eid="2CH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 6:18" />Dede Tinggwang kideu ga minadung de ngngwa lungh zieni? Pielo, kideu pelane nah tinggim de ncu mrak daulak—Ih teikelu kerecaki aide daikenzwa gede ceu ziebi! <verse eid="2CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 6:19" />Dede keherei liede n kilabe kekie aide nah pe luneu de herüt peulo, RAMPAUBO a Tinggwang; n kilabe sah nah kie kelade kingnei gailo. <verse eid="2CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 6:20" />Tingmui tingba n miak kerecaki ailambie piegai beulo, nang n zi kainzeu zielie sampet kebeube heni ga. Nang n kilabe kekie kingnei gai beulo heni aide ga nreu gwang kie kegai de. <verse eid="2CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 6:21" />Cine n kilabe nah n mina Israelme kekie de kingnei gailo anui heni ailam nreu eh kie kegai dau. Yeo, nang lungh kebam ni gade kingnei gailo, tinggimdung gade; nah nang kingnei lu de, kemaugi beulo.<verse eid="2CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 6:22" />Magade mige pe kidabe dage kemau teigai nah sampet gai cai, nah pa gwang eh kerecaki aika n recabam dwa gade sampet gai cai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet 22:7-12 nah Pum 5:11-13</char></note> <verse eid="2CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 6:23" />Tinggimdung gade kingneilu delwe heta tei gailo. N kilame de tiak gailo, kemaube de mmau eh pe peu gage pa tei kedide teugwang gailo. Kenzeube de mau malie ndu gailo nah pe masang ria gade peu beulo.<verse eid="2CH 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 6:24" />N mina Israelme penui n dage kemau teigai kedine ngauraume ne penuide ngam kedidau, penui n da cailigwang dailu eh, n zi qu, kie nah kerecaki aikade n dwade penui maugi beulo kie cai, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2Heg. 19:14-19</char></note> <verse eid="2CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 6:25" />iciucai tinggimdung gade penui kwa kingnei gailo, n mina Israelme maugi beulo; nang penuide nah penui paume de peukela deu de ga penuide ngngwa cailigwang dai beulo.<verse eid="2CH 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 6:26" />Tingkamdung ngkui kedi dau nah minadung n dage kemau teigai kedine tingrui gah kedi dau, penui heni ailambie nreu kie, n zi qu, nah nang penuide teikeherei kegaidau penui mau gade nreu lucai— <verse eid="2CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 6:27" />iciucai RAMPAUBO, tinggim gade kingneilu delwe n kilamedung nah n mina Israelme maugi beulo, nang penui tet maikesia lampui keyi gage saulia kegai dau. N deu gage tingrui langgai lo, nang n minadung de gumlu kera kepeu deu de gage.<verse eid="2CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 6:28" />Hangdeube ga herakum, mede rapia gwang cai, mede mei pereugi, mede tangriemdung nah tambeibedung mei ngkap dicai; mede penui ngauraumedung penui deu ga namdidung kiriekidung gwaketang cai, mede cika rapia mede keteeikenei gede bam cai, <verse eid="2CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 6:29" />nah mige ne mede n mina Israelme pelane ne kekiedung nah lu keneudung kiegai cai—ket ket kecu rapia nah lungrei pe mlung gade cilu eh pa pe ba kena kerecaki lambie hwacuh gai. <verse eid="2CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 6:30" />Ciucai Tinggim, nang lungh kebam ni gade kingnei gailo; kemaugi beulo, nah mina leune de pe teilung zai rehi gade ziehi peulo; nang au pe mlung cibam, kedanemene nang nah nang rünne minadung mlung cibam lu. <verse eid="2CH 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 6:31" />Aide teilu penuide peu ncu hinglu kerane, iciu eh penui n lampuidung ga tet eh nang anui paumedung de pwa kepeube deu ga penui lungh lamui lu kerane.<verse eid="2CH 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 6:32" />Sangmedung nnui Israel ga si kemakmedung, dede cauge—n zi kedi de ziemne, n ba kengkieng de ziemne, nah n ba hwapwa kebamde ziemne—gwang eh kerecaki ailambie ge kiegai cai, <verse eid="2CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 6:33" />ciciude tinggim gade kingnei gailo, nang lungh kebam ni gade, nah sangme n dade kie kelade pelane tei beulo, iciu eh kideu ga mina pelane n zi ci luzie delwe ncu hing luzie, n mina Israelme nzwa eh, nah Ih kerecaki aide tei kelude au n zi gade qukelu penui ci luzie.<verse eid="2CH 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 6:34" />Magade n minadung penui ngauraume de hereu tei kera kepet dau, nang keheibe lampui gade penuide langgai liede, nah penui nang ne kedetkelu namdi aide nah Ih n zi ziemne teikelu kerecaki lambie nreu eh n dade kie cai. <verse eid="2CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 6:35" />Iciucai tinggimdung gade penui kekie kwa kingnei gailo, penui kie kelade, delwe penuide ngha gailo.<verse eid="2CH 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 6:36" />Penui n dage kemau teigai dicai—kedanemene migede kemau teila kemak gah lu—nah nang penuide n rata dicai nah penuide ngauraume ba gage kaibeu dicai, iciu eh ngauraume penuide hebaangme tei eh penuide penui deu ga ngngwa mie dicai, kemdei ga mede kenna ga liede.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 28:36-37 </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 6:37" />Nah penui penuide langgi kedi deu ga lungh kela penui ci lucai, nah penui helung nreu lwe penui hebaangme teikela deu gade n kengha kie cai. Penui, ‘Anui teimau süt dida nah kemau tei dida. Anui zai nlien dida,’ de eh rang cai. <verse eid="2CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2CH 6:38" />Penui hebaang tei kebam deu, penuide hebaangme tei kera penui teu tet kedi gade penui mlung nah penui keringria pelane teu eh penui n da nreugwang lucai, nah nang penui paume de kepeu, penui deu lambie, nah nang kedetkelu namdi lambie, nah Ih n zi ziemne teikelu ki lambie penui nreu eh kie cai. <verse eid="2CH 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2CH 6:39" />Iciucai tinggimdung gade kingnei gailo, nang lungh kebam ni gade, penui kekie nah penui kie keladung, nah penuide ngha gailo. N minadung, n dage kemau teigai kedimedung maugi beulo.<verse eid="2CH 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2CH 6:40" />Cu, a Tinggwang, Ih n da kiela, n miak mrak lulo, nah heni aikade kie kegai kekiedung de kingnei gailo. <verse eid="2CH 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2CH 6:41" />Cu cine cuhlu, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, n kemtak ni ga, nang nah n samkakbung kengkieng de. N cingkumedung de peu, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, kelikelu le bah lulo, nah peu nda samsang kelamedung de n keyi de ga penui suiyi lulo. <verse eid="2CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="2CH 6:42" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, nang ne keniak kelu hegwangpei zu de peu n dade nreutet diso. N kilabe David dade kesamsang samkakkelu ta de n lung gage kainzeu lulo.”<verse eid="2CH 6:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CH 7" />
  <para style="s">Kerecaki teikemci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 7:1" />Cu Hegwangpei Solomon kekie teicang dige, tinggim gade mi cak mie delwe keru recadung nah ratakdung rudi, nah RAMPAUBE kebaa le kerecaki puidi. <verse eid="2CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 7:2" />Cingkumedung RAMPAUBE ki ga lüt gailak di, kedanemene pe kebaa le pe ki pui kedine. <verse eid="2CH 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 7:3" />Israelme mina pelane mi cak mie kecu nah RAMPAUBE kebaa kerecaki reuga kebam ngau luge, penui hangdeu ga, tangtsu kam kenzeu reuga penui zudung keumielu delwe RAMPAUBE de reca nah hetwa peugai. Penui ranggai, “Pa au yilie, kedanemene pe samkakkelu samsang de kelungta bam mui lalu.”<verse eid="2CH 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 7:4" />Cine hegwangpei nah mina pelane RAMPAUBE de ratakdung peugai. <verse eid="2CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 7:5" />Hegwangpei Solomon ketumseu cang ngkai-kena nah meurün nah hemeudung 120,000 ratak ge teigai. Iciu eh hegwangpei nah mina pelane ngngwa Tinggwang kerecaki teimci gai. <verse eid="2CH 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 7:6" />Cingkumedung, penuide ramsiak kebeu nidung ga saplu; penuide ncwa eh Levime de saplu delwe hegwangpei David ne mtei kebeu leinetdung pwa lei tei eh RAMPAUBE de ketwa peu, “Kedanemene pe samkakkelu kesamsang au kelungta bammui kelane.” Cingkume pelane penui dwaga teluidung kwagai, nah Israelme pelane saplu. <verse eid="2CH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 7:7" />Solomon RAMPAUBE kerecaki dwa ga kigu sum de teimci lu. Cikage pa keru recadung nah kekangbau recadung ca rugai, kedanemene pa teikelu hetageu recabam de keru recadung, mei recadung, nah macadung ziemne nrum zu kedine.<verse eid="2CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 7:8" />Cine Solomon cidau lang henane paiki ngyi bamlu nah Israelme pelane pecu ngngwa, baudi kedi ge ngkwalu, Lebo Hamath gade Egypt reuceuna ga kecang. <verse eid="2CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 7:9" />Lang heset ne benai penui baudi bam sünne lu, kedanemene penui recabam de teikemci tingbazie lang henane teu kedine, nah lang hena hengyi kedine. <verse eid="2CH 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 7:10" />Kei hena bekei zie ngkai-kecum benai, Solomon au minadung de penui mlung suiyile kepui tei eh penui kidung gage lang gaidi kedanemene Rampaube David, Solomon, nah pe mina Israel dage pe zaikeyi pwalia kegaine.<verse eid="2CH 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">RAMPAUBE Solomon depeu ngaukegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 7:11" />Cinzwa eh Solomon RAMPAUBE ki nah pekatei pe ki teicanglu. RAMPAUBE ki nah pekatei pe ki ga tei kera Solomon riem kelude, pa tei hemi süt eh teilu. <verse eid="2CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 7:12" />Matie mene RAMPAUBE tingmui Solomon de peu pecu ngaugai eh pe dage rangdi, “Ih n kekie siulu da, nah Ih heni aide a ziemne ratak ki ge tei kerane kedet luda. <verse eid="2CH 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 7:13" />Magade Ih tinggimdung ngkuidi iciu eh cika tingrui gadi lulo beu, mede Ih tangriem de kideube tyeilu kerane aja kaicai, mede Ih a minadung dage mateei langgai cai, <verse eid="2CH 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 7:14" />magade a zi gade qukelu a minadung, penuide tei henah, kie, acu peei, nah penui kemau tei kela gade nreulu cai, Ih tinggim gade siu luzie, nah penui mau gibeu zie, nah penui deu teingkei beu zie. <verse eid="2CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 7:15" />Cu a miak mrak luzie nah heni aikade kekie tei kegaidung a kwen siulu zie. <verse eid="2CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 7:16" />Kedanemene Ih cu ki aide kedetlu eh teimci luda iciu eh peu a zi cika bammui lu kerane. A miak nah a mlung tingba ramsangne cika bammui zie. <verse eid="2CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 7:17" />Nang, n pei David nzwa a dwaga tetla lu cai, Ih ncu teilo kebeu leune teimzai lucai nah a zaidung nah a ajadung kaizeu lu cai, <verse eid="2CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 7:18" />iciucai Ih n hegwangram hegwangbam de teucuh beu zie, Ih n pei David de ngngwa samkakkelu ga rang kenzeu nzwa, Ih, ‘N leuhme ge madaude Israel ga hegwang teita dilak,’ de eh kerang de.<verse eid="2CH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 7:19" />Dede nnui nreu tet dicai, nah a zaidung Ih nnuide pwa kepeu ajadung gidi cai, nah nnui mie hera kedadung de reca eh cidungde dwa keumie cai, <verse eid="2CH 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 7:20" />Iciucai Ih penuide pwa kepeu a hangdeu gade keugi dizie. Ki aide Ih a zi ziemne teimci kelude Ih a dwa gade keugi dizie, nah Ih cide teu sam kerang ge nah mina pelane kakga henui ge tei dizie. <verse eid="2CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 7:21" />Cu kerecaki aide piage mlang süt bam de, mina cide kahkegwang leune de keheu dizie nah rata kwa rang dizie. Penui keteu zie, ‘Daitei RAMPAUBE hangdeu aide nah kerecaki aide gage aiciu teigai dino?’ <verse eid="2CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 7:22" />Kedame sam keli zie, ‘Kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE, penui Tinggwang, pa penui paume de Egypt deu gade ngngwa mpet kebeube de gi kedine, nah penui hera kedadung de luulu eh cidungde dwa keumie nah cidungde de reca kedine. Ciziemne RAMPAUBE kekap aidungde pelane penui reu gage teugwang gai beuda.’”<verse eid="2CH 7:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CH 8" />
  <para style="s">Solomon ta kedadung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 8:1" />Hegwangpei Solomon RAMPAUBE ki nah pekatei pe ki ketei mmi ngkai cang gwang dige, <verse eid="2CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 8:2" />Solomon Tyre gwangpei Hiram pecu kepeu namceudung de retak dailu, delwe pa cidungde ga peu Israelme de lunghlu.<verse eid="2CH 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 8:3" />Solomon Hamathzobah namceu de gwaketang nah cide ngamlu. <verse eid="2CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 8:4" />Pa hetaideu gage Tadmor namceu, nah Hamath cuikui gage hema kehebau namdidung pelane teilu. <verse eid="2CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 8:5" />Pa Beth Horon Nreube nah Beth Horon Ngkangbe namdidung de, riekelu namdidung, kiriekidung, heriekidung nah hegeuriadung de si eh teilu. <verse eid="2CH 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 8:6" />Pa Baalath namdi nah pa gumkelu ga hema kehebau namdidung pelane, nah pe bagidung ziemne namdidung pelane nah pe hekwen kepungme ziemne namdidung teilu, nah pa Jerusalem ga, Lebanon ga, nah pe hegwang kangga kebam deudung leune ga pe renga ziemne pa tei keneu leune teilu.<verse eid="2CH 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 8:7" />Minadung bang pwa kebam Hittime, Amorme, Perizzitme, Hivime, nah Jebusme, Israelme kemakmedung ziemne cai, <verse eid="2CH 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 8:8" />penui leuhmedung penui cai hangdeu ga bang kenzeumedung, Israelme ngkapdi kemakmedung—Solomon penuide teu eh kemei ta keteimedung teidi, henai kecangde penui cinzwa eh la. <verse eid="2CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 8:9" />Ciciude, Solomon au Israelme de teu eh kemei ta keteimedung tei dima. Meliene, penui au pe reugwamedung, pe muibedung, pe kedimedung, nah pe bagi maadung muibedung nah pe hekwen keteume teidi. <verse eid="2CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 8:10" />Aidungde hegwangpei Solomon gu kedi kemlangme minadung de keteume, penui mina 250, penui au heta keteimedung de pie rengei la.<verse eid="2CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 8:11" />Solomon David namdi gade Pharaoh napui de pe ziemne tei kelu ki gage ngngwa gwang gailu, pa pekatei peda rangdi, “A nau Israel gwangpei David ki ga lungh kerabe ma, kedanemene RAMPAUBE samkakbung gwangkelu leune ga au mci lu.”<verse eid="2CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 8:12" />Pecai Solomon au kigu dwaga pa teipwa kebam pe recabam gage RAMPAUBE dage keru recadung teigai beu. <verse eid="2CH 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 8:13" />Pa tingnairamsang tei maikesia de nzwa ratakdung teigai; pa cidungde reca teigai beula, Moses zai ga kebam nzwa, Sabbath tingbadung ga, kei kehecidung, nah tingkum ramsang tei kela hengyi piacum ga: Tsehi kaikemak Tangku Ngyi, Mtakkakdung Ngyi, nah Paikidung Ngyi.<verse eid="2CH 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 8:14" />Pe pei David sam kaikebeu de mnei eh, Solomon cingkumedung de penui ta ga hemaa mzilu, nah Levimedung de penui sapdung gage, Tinggwang de twa nah cingkumedung dwaga hegwatei kerane, tingnairamsang tei maikesia nzwa. Pa kirieki kekwamedung de de penui mzidung rehi gade herieki leune ziemne relang beudi, kedanemene David, Tinggwang minabe, aide de teilo rangdiak kebeune. <verse eid="2CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 8:15" />Maniakibungdung mede cingkumedung nah levimedung dage hegwangpei ajadung kai kebeude gade mina aidungde penui ta teita dima.<verse eid="2CH 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 8:16" />Aide nzwa eh RAMPAUBE ki bangdwa teicuh kecu ting gade cide teicanglu kemaktane Solomon ne heta tei lulo kebeude tei canglu. RAMPAUBE ki de tei canglu.<verse eid="2CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 8:17" />Pecai Solomon Ezion Geber nah pecai Elath namceu ga Edom deudi, duikung ga miedi. <verse eid="2CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 8:18" />Hiram pe dage pegu kedimedung ne aja teu eh, mina jaaidi zai kecimedung de si eh liemdung langgai, nah Solomon kilamedung de ngngwa eh penui Ophir deudi ga miedi nah penui cikade kecak 450 talents<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">450 talents </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilogram cang riakngrei swa kiee</char></note> keulu delwe Hegwangpei Solomon da cide teugwang beu.<verse eid="2CH 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CH 9" />
  <para style="s">Sheba gwangpui Solomon da kemie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 9:1" />Sheba gu Hegwangpui Solomon ha keyi siu luge, pa keheteu kecokdung keu pecu kedei kerane Jerusalem ga gwanglu. Pa maadi gede nzang eh gwang, utdung de peu mosala, kecak kekiee, nah tangtsu pemi kehungbe kekiee gele hepüt teilwe. Pa Solomon da gwang luge, pa pelung ga kebam pelane pe dage ranggai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1">1 Heg. 10:1</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 10:2">2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 9:2" />Solomon pa keteukegai pelane pecu samli peugai, Solomon ziemne magede teipa zu kedi gah; pa samli peugai kemak kette gah. <verse eid="2CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 9:3" />Sheba gu gwangpui Solomon maci nah hegwangki pa tei kenzeu de ngaulu ge, <verse eid="2CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 9:4" />pe taktyeibam ga ketyeipok, pe kilame bamdung, pe kilame tadung nah penui painidung, nah pe piak kepwame nah penui painidung, nah pa RAMPAUBE ki ga recadung tei kegai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Makecime kangge samtie </char><char style="fqa">keru recadung pa tei kegaide </char> de kecude, <char style="fqa">pa cu keru</char> de lubui lie rangla. </note>, pa pe swagah di. <verse eid="2CH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 9:5" />Pa hegwangpei dage rangdi, “Ih a deu gade n samdung nah n maci ha siu kelude kesang da. <verse eid="2CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 9:6" />Ih aika gwang kemaktane au Ih siu kecude nlum ma, nah cu au a miak le ngau luda. N maci nah mabam pempie ge ha acu ranglia ma. Nang au Ih n ha kedi siukelu nreu swade diki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:7">1 Heg. 10:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 9:7" />N minadung samlam daikenzwa ge pung no, nah n dwaga sap muibam kela n kilamedung daikenzwa ge samlam pung no, penui n macisam siu bam kelane. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiudung ga, </char><char style="fqa">N naudung daikenzwa ge samlam pung no </char> 1 Heg 10:8 ga nzwa kerabe lie eh. </note> <verse eid="2CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 9:8" />N Tinggwang RAMPAUBE de peu samlam punglu, pe suiyi nda ngau kelune, ncu pe hegwangbam gage kai kebeube, n Tinggwang RAMPAUBE ziemne hegwangpei teilu kerane. Kedanemene n Tinggwang Israel de ku kecune, penuide peu kelungta bam muilu kerane, pa ncu penui reu hegwangpei tei beuda, ncu peu kenzeube nah kesangbe gade kengkieng teu kerane!”<verse eid="2CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 9:9" />Pa hegwangpei de kecak 120 talents <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">120 talents </char><char style="ft" closed="false">4000 kilogram</char></note>nah mosaladung nah pemi kehung tangtsu kekieege peu. Sheba gwangpui ne hegwangpei Solomon de mosaladung kepeu aikenzwa madaude pecu peu dai ma. <verse eid="2CH 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 9:10" />Hiram kilamedung nah Solomon kilamedung, Ophir gade kecak, algum tsing nah pemikehung tangtsu de si eh teugwang. <verse eid="2CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 9:11" />Algum tsing le hegwangpei RAMPAUBE kerecaki nah pe ki takswadung teilu, leiketeime ziemne de leibungdung nah lyredung de. Judah cuikui deu ga tsing aide kenzwabe madaude pedwa ngau ma. <verse eid="2CH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 9:12" />Hegwangpei Solomon Sheba gwangpui de pa lukeneu leune peu nah pa kie kela leune; pa hegwangpei da teu kegwang swa kiee eh pecu peugai. Cine pa nah pe kilame tetdi nah pe deu ga cailigwangdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:13">1 Heg. 10:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomon kendu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 9:13" />Mmi ramsang kum Solomon kecak perüt 666 talents<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">666 talents </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ton 25 kieege</char></note> ge ngau lula. <verse eid="2CH 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 9:14" />Aide heliketeime nah helila teikelame heraha teugwang kecu si lama. Arabia ga hegwangmedung leune nah deudi ga deuceudidung de kecak nah rangkanggeu Solomon de teugwang beu. <verse eid="2CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 9:15" />Hegwangpei Solomon kecak kedeu kelube pwa hegeudung kedi haina teilu. Cide ket ga kecak shekels hai herok<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Shekels hai herok </char><char style="ft" closed="false">6.8 kilograms</char></note> lütdi. <verse eid="2CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 9:16" />Kecak kedeukelube teu hegeudung hai cum de si eh teilu. Hegeu ket ga kecak minas kecum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Minas kecum </char><char style="ft" closed="false">3.8 kilograms</char></note> le teilu; hegwangpei cidung de Lebanon hegung hegwangki gage kaidi. <verse eid="2CH 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 9:17" />Pecai hegwangpei hepwa ngeu lepwa hegwangbam kedi ge teilu nah cide kecak mcitube le teu kemailu. <verse eid="2CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 9:18" />Hegwangbam ga hang kecu pidwakdung herok bam nah cikage pidau bam gede dwa pwabam. Hegwangbam tu ramcau ga ba takbam bam, petu ramcau ga hingho mie kena saplwe. <verse eid="2CH 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 9:19" />Hingho kereiehkena pidwakdung ga sap, pidwak herok lule ailam ramcau ga. Hegwangbam cikenzwa keda hegwangram ga gah. <verse eid="2CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 9:20" />Hegwangpei Solomon pwa kesak piakdung leune kecak, nah Lebanon hegung gwangki ga pwa kesak piakdung pelane de kecak kemci le teilu. Kette rangkanggeu le tei ma, kedanemene Solomon tingdau rangkanggeu au makeyibe lie cet lama kecune. <verse eid="2CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 9:21" />Hegwangpei Solomon jaaidi ga duidi ga kemie liemdung maa ge bam, Hiram ga maa de si eh. Mmi kecum ramsang gade piage liemdung kecak, rangkanggeu, nah hepwangeu, hengadung nah ziangbeidung de si eh pung gwangla.<verse eid="2CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 9:22" />Cine Hegwangpei Solomon au kideu ga hegwangdung pelane swade mahei nah maci de kieeki. <verse eid="2CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 9:23" />Tinggwang pe mlung gage kai kebeude pe maci de kingnei kera ziemne, kideu ga hegwangdung pelane Solomon da gwangla. <verse eid="2CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 9:24" />Pecu peei kegwangme heraha, rangkanggeu nah kecak lidung, paihenidung, hereunet, nah mosaladung, hekwendung nah gadadung de si eh mmi ramsang kum teugwang beula. <verse eid="2CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 9:25" />Solomon au hekwen kidung nah bagidung cang mdai bam, nah hekwen keteume cang kereiehkena, cide pe bagi namdidung nah Jerusalem ga pe dage kainzeu la. <verse eid="2CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 9:26" />Pa Euphrates Reuki gade Philistinme deu kecang, nah Egypt deurai ga kecang hegwangme pelane reu kedi teigwang. <verse eid="2CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 9:27" />Hegwangpei Jerusalem ga rangkanggeu, hangdeu ga tangtsukang kieege bam. Pa cedar tsing teingkiee pwa hangdeu kehenahdung ga caimünbang kieege teilu. <verse eid="2CH 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 9:28" />Penui Solomon ziemne Egypt nah kideu pelane gade hekwendung teugwang beu.<verse eid="2CH 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomon tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 9:29" />Solomon ha kedadung, raitu gade gwang kamtu kecang, Caihakecibe Nathan hakwak, Shiloh ga Ahijah caihakecisam, nah caihakecibe Iddo kengaudung ga (Nebat napei Jeroboam hegwang ketei ha si eh) raupwala meni? <verse eid="2CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 9:30" />Solomon au Jerusalem gade Israelme pelane reu mmi riakdai ge hegwang teigwang. <verse eid="2CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 9:31" />Solomon pe paume nzwa tsaidi nah minadung pecu pe pei David namdi gage kungdi. Rehoboam, pe napei, pe bam leu eh hegwang teidi.<verse eid="2CH 9:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CH 10" />
  <para style="s">Israel Rehoboam de renia kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 10:1" />Rehoboam au Shechem namdi ga miedi, kedanemene Israel tingpeule cuikui mina pelane pecu peu hegwang teilu kerane Shechem ga gwang kelane. <verse eid="2CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 10:2" />Nebat napei Jeroboam aide siu luge pa Egypt gade caili di (kedanemene pa Egypt ga kebamne, pa cika hegwangpei Solomon dade pak kelane).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Heg. 11:26-40</char></note> <verse eid="2CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 10:3" />Cine penui langgai eh pecu qu, ge Jeroboam nah Israelme pelane gwanglu; penui Jeroboam de mpau eh rangdi, <verse eid="2CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 10:4" />“N pei ne anui ngwanggai tei rüt dida. Cu ciziemne, n pei ta kehung de teimca dilo, nah pa anui reu gage kekai ngwanggai kerüt de teimca dilo, iciude anui n gwatei luzie.” <verse eid="2CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 10:5" />Hegwangpei Rehoboam penui dage, “Lang cumne cai a da gwang dailu,” de eh ranggai. Cine penui tetdi.<verse eid="2CH 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 10:6" />Hegwangpei Rehoboam au pe pei Solomon ringbam keladau pe dwaga sapbam kelame kecingmedung de keteugai, pa rangdi, “Mina aidungde sam keli kerane nnui acu dai sam ledeubeu laino?” <verse eid="2CH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 10:7" />Penui pe dage ranggai, “Magade nang mina aidung dade yi nah penui suiyi tei lucai, nah penui dage sam keyidung rang lucai, penui n kilame tei lamui luzie.” <verse eid="2CH 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 10:8" />Dede Rehoboam kecingme keledeusam rang kegaide cikemak nzwadi, nah pa rehangme pe dwaga pecu nzang kelame de keteudi. <verse eid="2CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 10:9" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui acu daipai keledeusam peu laino, iciude minadung a da gwang ‘N pei anui reuga ge ngwanggai dwak kegaide teimca dilo’?” de rang kelame de samli peulu kerane. <verse eid="2CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 10:10" />Rehoboam de ngngwa lunghcuh kelube peina de pe dage rangdi, “N pei Solomon penui ngwanggai teinrüt dilie dede nang cide teimca beu maisia lie rang kelame de nang ainzwa rangbeu maisia. Aide nang penuide rangbeu maisia, ‘A zurang keceuna de de a pei kia swade siuki lie. <verse eid="2CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 10:11" />Cu cine, a pei ne nnui ngwanggai püt kerüt gele teinrüt beu liede, Ih nnui ngwanggai gage kaisi beuzie. Apei tsingrang le nnuide saja peu, dede Ih au heruingapuidung le nnuide saja peu zie.’”<verse eid="2CH 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 10:12" />Cine Jeroboam nah mina pelane hegwangpei, “Lang cumne benai a da cailigwang lu,” de eh rang kegai nzwa, lang cumne benai hegwangpei Rehoboam da gwanglu. <verse eid="2CH 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 10:13" />Kecingmedung keledeusam de mlaidi eh Rehoboam penui dage pe sam siasüt gai. <verse eid="2CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 10:14" />Pa rehangmedung keledeusam de mzui eh penui dage samrang, “A pei nnui ngwanggai kerüt peugai, dede Ih cide gage kaisi beuzie. A pei nnuide tsingrang le saja peu, dede Ih nnuide heruingapuidung teu saja peu zie.”<verse eid="2CH 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 10:15" />Cine hegwangpei mina sam kingnei tadi, cide tei kegaide Tinggwang lungning kedine, iciu eh RAMPAUBE pe sam Shiloh namdi caihakecibe Ahijah ne Nebat napei Jeroboam dage rang kegaide teicanglu kerane.<verse eid="2CH 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 10:16" />Israelme pelane hegwangpei penui sam kingnei takedi ngau luge, minadung pe samkeli eh rangdi, “David da anui qwa daipai bam no? Jesse napei da anui mabam bam meda! Israelme nnui ketket kecu pe paiki riep ga cailigwang cu. Cu au nkatei n ki rengeilu cu, David.” Cine Israelme pelane penui paiki ga cailigwang di. <verse eid="2CH 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 10:17" />Dede Israelme Judah namdidung ga lungh kebamme ziemne au, Rehoboam penui reu hegwang teidi. <verse eid="2CH 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 10:18" />Pecai Hegwangpei Rehoboam Adoniram de langgai, pa au mikemei tei eh heta keteime reu kedibe, dede Israelme tangtsu le pecu sam tsetdi. Hegwangpei Rehoboam pe bagi teu eh Jerusalem gage zette pak gaidi. <verse eid="2CH 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 10:19" />Cine Israelme henai kecang de David kelak de ngngwa renia eh lala.<verse eid="2CH 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CH 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 11:1" />Rehoboam Jerusalem ga gwang luge, pa Judah nah Benjamin kelak gade, mipeina reugwame kedet kelu 180,000 de qu hekwalu, Israel de ngngwa regi kerane, Rehoboam gwangram teucuh dailu kerane. <verse eid="2CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 11:2" />Dede Tinggwang minabe caihakecibe Shemaiah da RAMPAUBE sam gwang, rang eh, <verse eid="2CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 11:3" />“Solomon napei Rehoboam, Judah gwangpei dage, nah Israelme pelane Judah nah Benjamin leuh pelane dage rangbeulo, <verse eid="2CH 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 11:4" />‘RAMPAUBE aide rangla, “Nang n sinamedung de gwaketang mede hereu tei kerabe ma. Mina leune pe ki ga cailigwang di maisia, Ih ne aide teigai kecune.”’” Cine penui RAMPAUBE samzai teilu nah Jeroboam de gwaketang zielie kela gade cailigwang di.<verse eid="2CH 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rehoboam Judah teikentip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 11:5" />Rehoboam Jerusalem ga lunghdi, nah nsiulu kerane, Judah ga riekelu namdidung teilu. <verse eid="2CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 11:6" />Pa Bethlehem, Etam, Tekoa, <verse eid="2CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 11:7" />Beth, Zur, Soko, Adullam, <verse eid="2CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 11:8" />Gath, Mareshah, Ziph, <verse eid="2CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 11:9" />Adoraim, Lachish, Azekah, <verse eid="2CH 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 11:10" />Zorah, Aijalon, nah Hebron teilu. Aidungde Judah penai Benjamin ga riekelu namdidung. <verse eid="2CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 11:11" />Pa kudadung de teingkieng lu delwe cidung gage muiteume kai, ketyeipok, maca, nah zaudung de si eh hekwalu. <verse eid="2CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 11:12" />Pa namdidung pelane gage hegeudung, nah hengeidung kailu nah cidungde teingkieng sütlu. Cine Judah penai Benjamin pegu teidi.<verse eid="2CH 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 11:13" />Israel ga kebam pelane cingkumedung nah Levimedung penui deu gade peda miedi. <verse eid="2CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 11:14" />Judah nah Jerusalem ga gwang kerane Levimedung kekiee ge penui gu namceudung nah tseheideudung pütdi, kedanemene Israel hegwangpei Jeroboam nah pe namedung penuide gwagi kedine, iciu eh penui RAMPAUBE ziemne cingku tadung tei gailak di. <verse eid="2CH 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 11:15" />Jeroboam reca nidung nah pa ne tei kelu hemeu nah hetumna miedung ziemne cingkumedung de kedetlu. <verse eid="2CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 11:16" />Israel leuhdung pelane gade minadung Levime caisui gwanglu, Israel Tinggwang, RAMPAUBE de peei kerane penui mlung kai kelumedung; penui Jerusalem ga RAMPAUBE, penui peinamedung Tinggwang dage ratak teibeu kerane gwanglu. <verse eid="2CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 11:17" />Cine penui Judah gwangram teingkienglu nah Solomon napei Jeroboam de mmi kecum ge teingkieng beu, nah penui mmi kecum ziemne hegwangpei David penai hegwangpei Solomon lampui ga tetlu.<verse eid="2CH 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rehoboam kelak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 11:18" />Rehoboam pa Mahalath de penau lu, pe pei au David napei Jerimoth, nah pe pui au Abihail, pa Eliab napui nah Jesse tsapui. <verse eid="2CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 11:19" />Pa pecu mipeinadung mnabeu: Jeush, Shemariah, nah Zaham. <verse eid="2CH 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 11:20" />Mahalath cai, Rehoboam Maacah de luulu, Absalom napui; pa pecu Abijah, Attai, Ziza, nah Shelomith penuide mnabeu. <verse eid="2CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 11:21" />Rehoboam au Maacah de hungla, Absalom napui de, penau kedadung pelane nah pe nauseupuidung swade (pa pe nau kereieheset teilu nah nauseupui riakherok, nah pe na mipei ngkaieheset nah pe napui riakherok lunghlu). <verse eid="2CH 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 11:22" />Rehoboam Maacah napei Abijah de ditube tei kera kedetlu, pe sinamedung kakgade muiteube; pa pecu peu hegwang tei kera cetla. <verse eid="2CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 11:23" />Rehoboam mriak eh hegwangtei; pa pe napeidung pelane de Judah nah Benjamin deu ga riekelu namdi pelane gage teizang gai. Pa penuide de ketyeipok kekiee penuide peu nah penui ziemne henau kekiee ge peeibeu.<verse eid="2CH 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CH 12" />
  <para style="s">Shishak Jerusalem kegwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 12:1" />Rehoboam hegwang ngkieng petlu nah pa ngkieng luge, Judah ga pelane de RAMPAUBE zai de gidi, nah pecu ngngwa eh Israelme pelane de cide gidi. <verse eid="2CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 12:2" />Hegwangpei Rehoboam hegwang teikelu mmi mengei bekum, Egypt gwangpei, Shishak, Jerusalem de ngngwa renia di, kedanemene minadung RAMPAUBE dade masang luta kedine. <verse eid="2CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 12:3" />Pa bagidung cangge eh haina nah hekwen keteume cang riakherok de ngngwa gwang. Egypt gade reugwame peeikap gai kelak pecu ngngwa gwang: Libyame, Sukkimme, Cushme. <verse eid="2CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 12:4" />Shishak Judah da kebam riekelu namdidung tuilwe Jerusalem ga gwanglu. <verse eid="2CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 12:5" />Cu Caihakecibe Shemaiah au Rehoboam nah Shishak ziemne Jerusalem ga gwang ngkwa kebamme Judah muiteumedung da gwanglu. Shemaiah penui dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ainzwa rangla: Nnui acu püt dida, cine Ih de nnuide Shishak ba gage kaibeu dida.” <verse eid="2CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 12:6" />Pecai Israel gwangnadung nah hegwangpei penuide tei henah lwe rangdi, “RAMPAUBE au masang lie.” <verse eid="2CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 12:7" />Judah ga minadung penuikatei de tei henah kelu RAMPAUBE ngaulu ge, RAMPAUBE sam Shemaiah da gwang rang eh, “Penui au penuide tei henah luda. Ih penuide ngkap dilak; Ih penui kangge de au keli beuzie, nah Shishak ba teu eh a rata Jerusalem gage rui gailak lie. <verse eid="2CH 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 12:8" />Dede, penui au pegu kilamedung dizie, iciu eh penui a gwa ketei nah deudi kedame gwangpei gwa ketei dainzwa bi cilu zie.”<verse eid="2CH 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 12:9" />Cine Shishak, Egypt gwangpei Jerusalem de ngngwa renia delwe RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga mabamdung keu tetdi, nah hegwangpei ki ga mabamdung de. Pa maleune keu teu kapdi; pa Solomon ne teikelu kecak geudung de keteudi. <verse eid="2CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 12:10" />Hegwangpei Rehoboam cidung keleu gage hetageu gu geudung tei gailu delwe cidungde kekwame muibedung ba gage nlum gaidi, penui au hegwangpei ki kikamdung kekwame. <verse eid="2CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 12:11" />Hegwangpei RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga kelüt dau, kekwamedung cidungde pungla; pecai penui cidungde kekwaki gage teu cailigwang dai dila. <verse eid="2CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 12:12" />Rehoboam pecu tei henah luge, RAMPAUBE rata pe dade nreu di, iciu eh pecu ngkapzing de melu kerane; cipaureu de, Judah ga makeyi kesa ngaulu kera lareu.<verse eid="2CH 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 12:13" />Cine Hegwangpei Rehoboam Jerusalem ga pe hegwang teingkienglu, iciu eh pa hegwang teigwang. Rehoboam hegwang teicuh keludau, pa mmi riakdai-ket di, nah pa Jerusalem ga mmi kereiehena ge hegwangtei, Israel leuh pelane gade RAMPAUBE ne kedetkelu namdi dega, iciu eh pa cikage pezi kailu kerane. Pe pui zi au Naamah Ammonme pui. <verse eid="2CH 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 12:14" />Rehoboam kemau teidi, kedanemene pa au pe mlung teu RAMPAUBE de peei lu kemakne.<verse eid="2CH 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 12:15" />Judah tingpile hegwangbam gu hegwangpei Rehoboam ha kedadung liecai, raitu gade gwang kamtu kecang, cidungde caihakecibe Shemaiah laisiukwak nah caihakecibe Iddo keraudung ga la meni, cika paupai hadung nah Rehoboam penai Israel tingpeule hegwangbam ga hegwangpei Jeroboam kakga hereu tei jüja kegwang ha dungde sibam meni? <verse eid="2CH 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 12:16" />Rehoboam pe paumedung nzwa tsaidi nah David namdi gage kungdi; pe napei Abijah pe bam leu eh hegwang teidi.<verse eid="2CH 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CH 13" />
  <para style="s">Abijah penai Jeroboam keregi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 13:1" />Hegwangpei Jeroboam hegwangtei kelu mmi kereieheset bekum, Abijah Judah reu hegwangtei cuhdi. <verse eid="2CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 13:2" />Pa Jerusalem ga mmi kecum hegwangtei; pe pui zi au Macaiah, Gibeah mepei Uriel napui. Abijah penai Jeroboam kakga hereu teidi. <verse eid="2CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 13:3" />Abijah hereu ga mie kera mina 400,000 kedetlu, reugwamaa ngkieng, kekuu reugwame de ngngwalwe. Jeroboam pecu renia kera mteilu, ngkieng, kekuu reugwame, mina 800,000 de kedetlwe. <verse eid="2CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 13:4" />Abijah Zemaraim Deutu ga saplu, cide Ephraim lamlwatu deudi kideutu ga bam, nah ranggai, “Akwa kingnei gailo, Jeroboam nah Israelme pelane! <verse eid="2CH 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 13:5" />Nnui RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, David nah pe napeidung de ngngwa samkak ge teilwe pecu peu kelunghta Israel reu di kera peu kedi ci meni? <verse eid="2CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 13:6" />Dede Nebat napei Jeroboam, David napei Solomon kilabe, cuhlwe pe mpaube de reniadi. <verse eid="2CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 13:7" />Kemta kaudung, suisam kaudung, peda gwang ngkwalu. Penui Solomon napei Rehoboam de gwang renia, Rehoboam hena nah heta tei cima nah penui dwa sapgai kelak tingdau. <verse eid="2CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 13:8" />Cine nnui cu RAMPAUBE hegwangram David leuhme ba ga kebamde de renia kera riemlu, nnui au reugwamaa kedi ge kecune, nah nnui rabedung tei kerane Jeroboam ne tei kebeu kecak tumnadung bam kecune. <verse eid="2CH 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 13:9" />Dede nnui RAMPAUBE cingkumedung, Aaron leuhme, nah Levimedung de gwa mpet di meni, delwe heleuh kedadung ga lungh kelamedung nzwa, nnui gu cingkumedung kedetlu di meni? Keheibe de, ketumseuna ge nah meurünseu hena pwa ratak tei zielie kegwangbe de peu rabedung kemakbe cingku tei dila.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:11">Jer. 2:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 13:10" />Dede anui au, RAMPAUBE au anui Tinggwang, nah anui au pecu püt dima. Anui da au Aaron leuhme gade cingkumedung bam, RAMPAUBE gwatei eh, nah Levimedung, penui ta tei kebamme. <verse eid="2CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 13:11" />Tingcang nah tinghegi ramsang penui RAMPAUBE ziemne keru recadung nah marim keyi kehengui rula. Penui taktyeibam kemci gage Tinggwang de reca kebeu tangku de mtei beula; penui kecak mitaubam mitaubungdung de si eh penui tinghegi ramsang ru kera ziemne mtei lula. Anui Tinggwang, RAMPAUBE ajadung anui mzai la, dede nnui au pecu püt dida. <verse eid="2CH 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 13:12" />Ainie, Tinggwang au anui mapie la, nah pe cingkumedung au aika lalie telui pwalwe nnuide renia kera qugai kerane. Israelmedung, RAMPAUBE de ngngwa regi so, nnui paumedung Tinggwang de, kedanemene nnui ngkieng gailak lu.”<verse eid="2CH 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 13:13" />Dede Jeroboam penui caile de ketang kera mteilu; pe reugwamaa Judah dwaga la, nah ketang kera maa penui caiga la. <verse eid="2CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 13:14" />Judah nreugwang pie kegai dau, ainie, keregi kecude penui dwaga nah penui caiga de ladi. Penui RAMPAUBE dage sahgai, nah cingkumedung teluidung kwagai. <verse eid="2CH 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 13:15" />Pecai Judahmedung sah gai. Penui sahgai ge, Tinggwang Abijah penai Judah dwa gade Jeroboam nah Israelme pelane de ngamlu. <verse eid="2CH 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 13:16" />Israelme Judahme dwa gade pakdi, nah Tinggwang penuide Judahme ba gage kai beudi. <verse eid="2CH 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 13:17" />Abijah nah pe reugwamaa penuide teitset ngkiee sütdi; Israel kedet kelume 500,000 tsai kaudi. <verse eid="2CH 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 13:18" />Ainzwa eh Israelme de cidau ngamdi; Judahmedung ngkieng lu kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE, penui paumedung Tinggwang de ngngei kelune. <verse eid="2CH 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 13:19" />Abijah Jeroboam de zuimie; pa pe dade namdidung tuilu: Bethel nah Jeshanah nah Ephron nah cidungde twagwapung kebam renamdung. <verse eid="2CH 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 13:20" />Jeroboam madaude Abijah tingdau kengkieng ngau dailu tadi; RAMPAUBE pecu kedeudi, nah pa tsaidi. <verse eid="2CH 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 13:21" />Dede Abijah ngkieng reureu di; pa pe nau kereiehmdai teilu nah pe na mipeina ngkaiehkena nah mipuina kereieherok lunghlu. <verse eid="2CH 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 13:22" />Abijah batadung kedabe, pe zaireli, nah pe samdung caihakecibe Iddo hakwak gage raupwala.<verse eid="2CH 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2CH 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 14:1" />Abijah pe paumedung de ngngwa zipdi, nah penui pecu David namdi gage kungdi. Asa, pe napei, pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu. Pe tingdau hangdeube ga mmi kerei ge nciepniep eh bamlu.<verse eid="2CH 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 14:2" />Asa RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang dwade keyibe nah petaube teilu, <verse eid="2CH 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 14:3" />kedanemene pa sangme recabamdung nah reca nidung keugi kedine. Pa tangtsu tsiadung teikaudi nah Asherah miedung bi ngkaudi. <verse eid="2CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 14:4" />Pa Judahme de RAMPAUBE, penui paumedung Tinggwang de peei lulo aja kaigai, nah hezai nah ajadung de mzai lulo beu. <verse eid="2CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 14:5" />Pa reca nidung nah kehengui recabamdung Judah namdidung pelane gade keu gidi. Pe kangga hegwangram mtakziune bamlu. <verse eid="2CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 14:6" />Pa Judah ga riekelu namdidung teilu, kedanemene kideube ga lungciep bam, nah cipau mmidung ga pa hereu tei ma, RAMPAUBE ne pecu lungciep kepeu ziemne. <verse eid="2CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 14:7" />Asa Judah dage rangdi, “Anui namdi aidungde tei nah cidungde herie tei twagwa digo, nah reneidung, heriekidung, nah kudadung; kideube au anui gu reu kedanemene anui Tinggwang RAMPAUBE de anui peei kelune. Anui pecu peeilu, nah pa anuide lungciep kehei lamde de peuda.” Cine penui cide tei canglu. <verse eid="2CH 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 14:8" />Asa da reugwamaa hegeudung nah hengeidung kepwame bam; Judah gade mina 300,000, nah Benjamin gade mina 280,000 hegeudung kepwame nah lakpi kekapme bam. Aidung pelane kengkiengme.<verse eid="2CH 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 14:9" />Cushme ge Zerah reugwamaa 1,000,000 nah bagidung haicum de ngngwa lwe penuide renia gwang; pa Mareshah ga gwanglu. <verse eid="2CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 14:10" />Pecai Asa pecu redau kera tetpetlu, nah penui Mareshah ga Zephathah Langkam ga reugwa sapdung mteilu. <verse eid="2CH 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 14:11" />Asa pe Tinggwang, RAMPAUBE dage sahgai, nah rangdi, “RAMPAUBO, mige hemaa kekiee de redau eh pe kengkieng gah kedi dau pecu ngha kera migede gah dede nang rünne lie. Anuide nghabeu lo, RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang, kedanemene anui au ncu ngngei bam, nah n zi gade mina aikieege de renia kera anui gwang luda. RAMPAUBO, nang au anui Tinggwang; peu mina de ncu ngam diso.” <verse eid="2CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 14:12" />Cine RAMPAUBE Cushme de Asa nah Judah dwa gade ngamlu; ge Cushme pakdi. <verse eid="2CH 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 14:13" />Asa nah pecu ngngwa kela reugwame penuide Gerar ga zuimie di. Cushme kekiee kau kedine penui cuh dailu tadi, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nah pe reugwame dwa gade penuide ngkap cangsiak kedine. Reugwame hema tuikelu kekiee pungtet di. <verse eid="2CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 14:14" />Reugwame Gerar twagwa kebam renamdung pelane ngkapdi, RAMPAUBE rata cika kelunghme reuga gwang kedine. Reugwame renamdung pelane tuilu, nah hemadung kekiee gede tuilu. <verse eid="2CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 14:15" />Reugwame meurün kekwame paiki bamdung de ngkapdi; penui meurün kekiee ge nah utdung de pungtet di, nah pecai penui Jerusalem ga cailigwang di.<verse eid="2CH 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2CH 15" />
  <para style="s">Asa ma teikemci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 15:1" />Tinggwang Rabe Oded napei Azariah reuga gwanglu. <verse eid="2CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 15:2" />Pa Asa de redau kera mie eh pe dage rangdi, “Akwa kingnei lu, Asa, nah Judah pelane nah Benjamin: RAMPAUBE nnuide ngngwala, nnui pecu ngngwa kela dau. Nnui pecu peei cai, pecu nnui ngau luzie; dede nnui pecu gidi cai, pa nnuide gidi zie. <verse eid="2CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 15:3" />Cu peting ketie ge ziemne, Israel au Tinggwang kesangbe de sita di, cingku keledeu nah hezai de si tadi. <verse eid="2CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 15:4" />Dede penui rei gade penui RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang da nreugwang luge, nah pecu peei luge, penui pecu ngaulu. <verse eid="2CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 15:5" />Cipauting mbeu kelame ziemne lungciep bam lama, mede aika mbeu kegwangme ziemne liede; meliene, keherei süt kecu hangdeu cidung ga kelunghme pelane da bamla. <verse eid="2CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 15:6" />Penuide au pang kecai dila, heleuh ge kedage de renia, nah namdi ge kedage de renia, kedanemene Tinggwang penuide keherei ketsamtsam pelane teugwang teikeherei kegaine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:7">Mat. 24:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 15:7" />Dede ngkieng lu, nah peu n ba de mnei diso, kedanemene n tatei de ziemne ziehi peu zie kecune.”<verse eid="2CH 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 15:8" />Asa, sam aidungde siu luge, caihakecibe Oded caihasamdung de, pa pelung kuu lu eh Judah nah Benjamin deu pelane gade kemneeubedung, nah pa kideutu deudi Ephraim namdidung gade pa tui keludung de gwa gidi, nah pa RAMPAUBE recabam tei dailu, cide RAMPAUBE kerecaki kigu dwaga bamla. <verse eid="2CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 15:9" />Pa Judah nah Benjamin pelane de hekwa lu, nah penuide ngngwa lungh kebamme de, Ephraim nah Manasseh, nah Simeon leuh gade. Kedanemene penui pe Tinggwang RAMPAUBE pecu ngngwa kela ngau keludau Israel gade mina kekiee ge peda gwang kelune. <verse eid="2CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 15:10" />Cine penui Asa hegwang tei kelu mmi kereiehmengei bekum, keicum dau Jerusalem ga gwang ngkwalu. <verse eid="2CH 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 15:11" />Cipaunai penui hematui kelu teugwang kebam gade penui RAMPAUBE dage ratak teigai beu: ketumseu hai hena nah meurün nah hemeudung cang hena. <verse eid="2CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 15:12" />Penui nlüt penui paume Tinggwang, RAMPAUBE de peei kerane penui mlung nah penui keringria pelane teu eh samkak ge teilu. <verse eid="2CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 15:13" />Penui Israel Tinggwang, RAMPAUBE de peei laklie kedime de teitset di kera kesuisamlu, hecing, hena, mipui, mipei liede. <verse eid="2CH 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 15:14" />Penui RAMPAUBE dage teluidung nah tekiidung kwagai nah sah eh sampet gai. <verse eid="2CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 15:15" />Judah pelane samkak cide penui suilu, penui mlung pelane teu sampet kelune, nah penui lung pelane teu Tinggwang de peei gai, nah penui pecu ngaulu. RAMPAUBE penuide twakenggwa pelane dade lungciep peu.<verse eid="2CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 15:16" />Hegwangpei Asa pe pai, Maacah de hegwangpui tei kebam gade keu mpetdi, kedanemene pa Asherah mie keu kemneeu mie ge tei kegaine. Asa kemneeu mie cide bikau mie rüt takcaidi, delwe cide Kidron reuki gade rudi. <verse eid="2CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 15:17" />Dede reca nidung de au Israel gade keumpet dima. Iciu liede, Asa au pe teilungzie pelane lungsang tei eh gwang. <verse eid="2CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 15:18" />Pa rangkanggeu, nah kecak nah lidung pe pei penai heta tei kera teimci keludung de Tinggwang kerecaki ga teu nlütlu. <verse eid="2CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 15:19" />Asa hegwang ketei mmi camreiehmengei kecang au hereu tei ma.<verse eid="2CH 15:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2CH 16" />
  <para style="s">Asa mmi kekamle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 16:1" />Asa hegwang tei kelu mmi camreieherok bekum, Israel gwangpei Baasha pe ta siasüt eh Judahme dage teigai, nah Ramah namceu kwacuhlu, ciu eh pa peu migede de Judah gwangpei Asa deu gade mpet mede nlüt laklie di. <verse eid="2CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 16:2" />Pecai Asa RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga nah hegwang ki maniakibung gade rangkanggeu nah kecak keulwe Damascus ga lungh kebam Aram hegwangpei Ben Hadad dage langgai beudi. Pa rangdi, <verse eid="2CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 16:3" />“Peu anai kakga samkak bam kelube tei lulo, n pei nah a pei penai kakga kebam nzwa eh. Pielo, Ih ncu rangkanggeu nah kecak langgai la delie. Israel gwangpei, Baasha dade n samkak de pütdi lo, iciu lude pa a dade tetdi lu kerane.” <verse eid="2CH 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 16:4" />Ben Hadad hegwangpei Asa sam kingnei lu nah pe reugwame muibedung de Israel namdidung de gwaketang lo eh langgai. Penui Ijon namceudung, Dan, Abel Maim, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Abel Maim de qu kela ni de Abel Beth Maacah de nzwa kap da. 2 Sam. 20:14-15 gade ngu lubui. </char></note> nah taktyei hekwa pwa kebam Naphtali ga namdidung pelane gwaketang. <verse eid="2CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 16:5" />Cipau tingdau Baasha aide siu luge, pa Ramah kwacuh tadi nah pe ta de peu mtakdi. <verse eid="2CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 16:6" />Pecai hegwangpei Asa Judah ga mina pelane de ngngwa teudi. Penui tangtsudung nah tsingdung Ramah ga kebam de, Baasha ne keulwe namdi tei kebam de pung tetdi. Ge hegwangpei Asa cipau ki ketei niadung de keulwe Geba penai Mizpah namdidung de teilu.<verse eid="2CH 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 16:7" />Cipau tingdau caihakecibe Hanani Judah gwangpei, Asa da mie nah pe dage rangdi, “Kedanemene nang RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang de ngngei mene Aram gwangpei de ngngei kedine, Aram gwangpei reugwame n ba gade pak dida. <verse eid="2CH 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 16:8" />Cushmedung nah Libyamedung reugwame kekiee ge nah bagidung nah hekwen kepungme kekiee ge bam meni? Dede, kedanemene nang RAMPAUBE de ngngei kelune, pa ncu penui reu ngkieng kelu peuda. <verse eid="2CH 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 16:9" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE kideu pelane kehei gade ngau bam, ciu eh pecu kenlumme de pe kengkieng peu kerane. Dede nang aipaude gade mie süt eh matei dida. Cu gade au, nang hereu teila di zieda.” <verse eid="2CH 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 16:10" />Pecai Asa caihakecibe de pe rata di; pa pecu hebaangki gage kaidi, kedanemene aide ziemne pa pecu pe rata süt kedine. Cipau tingdau, Asa mina kangge de teikeherei di.<verse eid="2CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 16:11" />Pielo, Asa bata, raitu gade gwang kamtu kecang, ainie, cidungde Judah nah Israel gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala. <verse eid="2CH 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 16:12" />Asa hegwang ketei mmi camreiehekui bekum, Asa pepi ga mateei ge teeidi. Pe mateei sia süt di liede, pa darukecime dade gwale RAMPAUBE dade kengha kie ma. <verse eid="2CH 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 16:13" />Cine Asa pe hegwang ketei mmi riakdaiehket bekum, tsaidi nah pe paume rau tai gage kungdi. <verse eid="2CH 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 16:14" />Penui pecu David namdi ga pa ne pe ziemne pe raubung teipwa kebam gage kungdi. Penui pe paau kung kera kelamlui dau mosala ketsamtsam perim kehengui teu eh, perim kehengui tei kecime ne tei kelube penui pe paau gage kailu. Pecai penui mimang di süt kecu ge pecu herüt peu eh teigai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1Heg. 15:24</char></note><verse eid="2CH 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2CH 17" />
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Jehoshaphat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 17:1" />Asa napei Jehoshaphat pe pei hegwang bam leulu. Jehoshaphat Israel de renia kerane pekatei pecu tei ngkienglu. <verse eid="2CH 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 17:2" />Pa Judah riekelu namdidung pelane gage reugwamedung kailu. Judah deu ga Ephraim namdidung de, pe pei Asa ne tuikeludung gage pa ramzeukidung teilu. <verse eid="2CH 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 17:3" />RAMPAUBE Jehoshaphat de ngngwala kedanemene pa pe pei David puisau keraibedung de ga tetla nah Baaldung de reca la kemakne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa kehegwa laisiudung ga </char><char style="fqa">David de bam </char> nah cudau laisiudung ga magede kai nzeu pwa bam ma. </note> <verse eid="2CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 17:4" />Meliene, pa pe pei Tinggwang de ngngeilu, nah pe ajadung de mzuilu, Israelme zaidung de mzui mene. <verse eid="2CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 17:5" />Cine RAMPAUBE Jehoshaphat de pe ba gage Judah hegwangram reu kengkieng peu beu; nah Judah ga mina pelane Jehoshaphat de rüt eh mta mapeu pwapeu. Cine pa mahei süt di nah mina pecu hetwa peudi. <verse eid="2CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 17:6" />Pa RAMPAUBE zaidung gage pe lung kaidi. Pa nlumkemak reca ni kehudung de nah Judah gade herabepui Asherah mie de keu gidi.<verse eid="2CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 17:7" />Pa hegwang teikelu mmi kecum bekum pe kangga kedimedung, Ben-Hail, Obadiah, Zechariah, Nethanel, nah Micaiah penuide Judah namdidung ga ledeu kerane langgai. <verse eid="2CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 17:8" />Levime aidungde penuide ngngwala; Shemaiah, Nethaniah, Zebadiah, Asahel, Shemiramoth, Jehonathan, Adonijah, Tobijah, nah Tob-Adonijah; nah cingkupei Elishama penai Jehoram de penuide ngngwa mie. <verse eid="2CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 17:9" />Penui RAMPAUBE zai laisiukwak de pwalwe Judah ga ledeu. Penui Judah namdidung pelane ga mie minadung dage cide ledeu.<verse eid="2CH 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 17:10" />Judah taiga kebam hegwangramdung ga RAMPAUBE de kehing bamdi, cide ziemne penui Jehoshaphat de ngngwa hereu tei tadi. <verse eid="2CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 17:11" />Philistinme kangge ne Jehoshaphat de kerüt gade rangkanggeu nah mta mapeu teugwang beu. Arabiame de pecu meuründung 7,700 nah hemeudung 7,700 teugwang beu. <verse eid="2CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 17:12" />Jehoshaphat ngkieng sütdi. Pa Judah ga kudadung nah kaikehekwa namdidung teilu. <verse eid="2CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 17:13" />Peda Judah namdidung ga taktyeidung kekiee ge bam nah reugwame, kengkieng minadung, Jerusalem ga bam. <verse eid="2CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 17:14" />Aidungde penui mzidung penui pautsa rehi gade: Judah pautsa gade Adnah ne reugwame pecang reu muibe nah pa pe kangga reugwame 300,000 gede ngngwala. <verse eid="2CH 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 17:15" />Pe kangga Jehohanan reugwame muibe, nah pecu mina 280,000 ngngwala; <verse eid="2CH 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 17:16" />Pecai Zichri napei Amasiah, delwe pecu reugwame 200,000 ngngwala. Amasiah neungga eh RAMPAUBE gwa teikera tetpetlu. <verse eid="2CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 17:17" />Benjamin pautsa gade reugwame reu kedibe Eliada, pa mina kengkieng kekuu kau ge. Pa reugwame lakpi kepwa nah hegeu kepungme 200,000 ngngwala. <verse eid="2CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 17:18" />Pecai Jehozabad nah pa reugwame 180,000 hereu tei kera mteikelume de ngngwala. <verse eid="2CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 17:19" />Mina aidungde pelane hegwangpei gwa keteime, nah aidungde si eh hegwangpei reugwame kedame de riekelu namdidung Judah cuikui pelane gage kailu.<verse eid="2CH 17:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2CH 18" />
  <para style="s">Jehoshaphat nah Ahab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 18:1" />Cu Judah gwangpei Jehoshaphat mahei sütlu nah hetwa de pung sütlu. Pe kelak gade hangge Israel gwangpei Ahab napui depeu ngngwa lunghlu, ciu eh pa Ahab de ngngwa yilu. <verse eid="2CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 18:2" />Mmi kiee kemakge cai, pa Samaria namdi ga Ahab de dau kera hung. Ahab pe ziemne nah pecu ngngwa kela minadung ziemne meurün nah ketum kekiee ge gilu. Delwe Ahab Jehoshaphat de pecu ngngwa Gilead ga Ramoth namdi de gwaketang kera pe lung teigai. <verse eid="2CH 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 18:3" />Israel gwangpei, Ahab, Judah gwangpei Jehoshaphat dage rangdi, “Nang acu ngngwa Ramoth Gilead namdi ga mie zie mi?” Jehoshaphat pe sam keligai, “Nang mtei lude Ih mtei luda, nah a reugwame n reugwame nzwada. Hereu ga anui ncu ngngwala zie.”<verse eid="2CH 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 18:4" />Jehoshaphat Israel gwangpei dage rangdi, “Kehereide RAMPAUBE sam daige keli ziebi pie rai lugo.” <verse eid="2CH 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 18:5" />Cine Israel gwangpei Ahab caihakecime hai mdai gede qu hekwa ncütlu nah penui dage rangdi, “Anui mie Gilead ga Ramoth namdi de regi ziemi, mi lak no?” Penui keligai, “Gwaketang lu, kedanemene Tinggwang ncu ngkieng kelu peu zie.” <verse eid="2CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 18:6" />Dede Jehoshaphat keteudi, “Anui RAMPAUBE sui keteu kera, caihakecime kedame aika ga deni?” <verse eid="2CH 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 18:7" />Israel gwangpei, Jehoshaphat dage rangdi, “Mi hangge bam si reu anui RAMPAUBE sui keteulu kera, pa Imlah napei Micaiah. Dede Ih pecu ngkau kedanemene pa madaude a ziemne caiha keyi rangbeula melu, dede kesiabe mui lie.” Dede Jehoshaphat rangdi, “Hegwangpei cide rang kerabe ma.” <verse eid="2CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 18:8" />Cine Israel gwangpei kedime gede qulu nah rangdi, “Zette mie Imlah napei Micaiah de ngngwa gwang lulo.” <verse eid="2CH 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 18:9" />Cu Israel gwangpei Ahab penai Judah gwangpei Jehoshaphat penai hegwang paini teu lwe Samaria kirie gwale hecaipung ga penai hegwang bam ga ntum bam, nah caihakecime pelane penai dwa ga caihakeci sam rangbam. <verse eid="2CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 18:10" />Kenaanah napei Zedekiah pa ne hegeu teki ge teilu nah rangdi, “Aide RAMPAUBE rangla: Aide le nang Aramme de ngngwa regi zie penuide ngamlu kemaktane.” <verse eid="2CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 18:11" />Caihakecime pelane caihakeci sam nzwakap eh rangdi, “Ramoth Gilead namdi de gwaketang lu nah ngkienglu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE ncu ngkiengkelu n ba gage peudi delu.”<verse eid="2CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 18:12" />Micaiah de qu zielie mie kedi samgwabe de pe dade rangdi, “Pielo, caihakecime ket tei eh hegwangpei ngkienglu kera caiha rang dida. Peu n sam de penui samdung ga samdau lulo nah ngkienglu kera sam rang lulo.” <verse eid="2CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 18:13" />Dede Micaiah sam keligai, “RAMPAUBE ring kela nzwa, Tinggwang rang kebeube rünne Ih rang zie.” <verse eid="2CH 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 18:14" />Micaiah hegwangpei Ahab da kegwang dau, hegwangpei pe dage rangdi, “Micaiah, anai Ramoth Gilead namdi de renia kera mie zie mi lak no?” Micaiah pecu keligai, “Gwaketang cu nah ngkienglu! Kedanemene cide ngkiengkelu kedi ge zie.” <verse eid="2CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 18:15" />Cidau hegwangpei pe dage rangdi, “Ih ncu pia daikiee ge n sampet RAMPAUBE zi gade a dage kesangbe rünne rang kera ranglai no?” <verse eid="2CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 18:16" />Cine Micaiah rangdi, “Ih Israel pelane, lamlwatudung ga meuründung penuide kekwabe gah eh zangra kela nzwa bam eh ngau, nah RAMPAUBE rangdi, ‘Aidungde au muiteube gah. Peu mina keheibede de pe lung nciep eh pe kilung cailigwanglu.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 9:36, Mark 6:34</char></note> <verse eid="2CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 18:17" />Cine Israel gwangpei Jehoshaphat dage rangdi, “Pa a ziemne caiha kesia gwale keyi rangla melie kecu Ih ncu ranglia meni?” <verse eid="2CH 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 18:18" />Cidau Micaiah rangdi, “Ciziemne nnui pelane RAMPAUBE sam kingnei lulo: Ih RAMPAUBE pe hegwangbam ga ntum kebam ngau, nah tinggim gwame pelane pe hile nah zetle sap bam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9">Dan. 7:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 18:19" />RAMPAUBE keteu, ‘Caune Israel gwangpei Ahab de cwa eh pecu peu Ramoth Gilead namdi ga mie eh kaudi lai?’ Mige madungge rang nah kedame keda dungge rangdi. <verse eid="2CH 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 18:20" />Cidau rabe ge tet pet eh RAMPAUBE dwa ga gwang saplu eh rangdi, ‘Ih ne pecu cwa beuzie.’ RAMPAUBE pe dade keteu eh, ‘Dainzwa eh?’ <verse eid="2CH 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 18:21" />Rabe de sam keligai, ‘Ih mie zie nah Ahab caihakecime pelane mui ga Ih kenret rabe ge dizie.’ RAMPAUBE keli eh, ‘Nang pecu cwalu zie, nah nang ngkienglu zie.’ Cu mie delwe tei cu. <verse eid="2CH 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 18:22" />Cu pie lulo, RAMPAUBE ngu caihakecime aidungde mui gage kenret rabe kaigai dida nah RAMPAUBE n ziemne kesia ge gwang kera sampet dida.”<verse eid="2CH 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 18:23" />Pecai Kenaanah napei Zedekiah Micaiah da hang eh pe bia kepeu, nah rangdi, “RAMPAUBE Rabe nda gwang marang kera a dade dai lambie tet gaidi no?” <verse eid="2CH 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 18:24" />Micaiah keligai, “Pielo, nang kibung dungge helung lebie mbai kera pak nlüt de, nang cipaunai cilu zie.” <verse eid="2CH 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 18:25" />Israel gwangpei kilamedung kangge dade rangdi, “Nnui Micaiah de tuilu delwe pecu namdi gu deuceudi Amon nah hegwangpei napei Joash da ngngwa mie cu. <verse eid="2CH 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 18:26" />Nnui minadung pe dade, ‘Hegwangpei ne ainzwa ranglie de eh ranglu: Aipau peide de hebaangki gage kaidilu nah pecu tangku penai dui ceuna ge gwale peu so, Ih kwak eh cailigwanglu kemaktane.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:10">2 Hel. 16:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 18:27" />Cidau Micaiah hemaabe dage ranggai, “Nang kwak eh cailigwanglu cai, RAMPAUBE a dage marang gai meda.” Delwe pa rang si gai, “Aide kingneilu, nnui mina pelane.”<verse eid="2CH 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahab tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 18:28" />Cine Israel gwangpei Ahab penai Judah gwangpei Jehoshaphat Ramoth Gilead namdi de renia kera miedi. <verse eid="2CH 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 18:29" />Israel gwangpei Jehoshaphat dage ranggai, “Hereu ga kemie dau Ih a rehi teitsam dizie, dede nang au n hegwang paini teulu.” Cine Israel gwangpei pe rehi teitsamlu delwe penui hereu ga miedi. <verse eid="2CH 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 18:30" />Aram gwangpei pe bagidung keteu kedime dage aja kai gai, “Reugwame kenlangme mede nlang kemakme de gwaketang helo. Meliene Israel gwangpei de rünne gwaketang lu.” <verse eid="2CH 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 18:31" />Cidau bagidung keteu kedimedung Jehoshaphat de ngaulu ge penui rangdi, “Cide Israel gwangpei da.” Cine penui pecu gwaketang kera nreu gwang, dede Jehoshaphat sahbak gai nah RAMPAUBE pecu ngha beu. Tinggwang pe dade penuide peu nreu tetdi. <verse eid="2CH 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 18:32" />Pecai bagidung keteu kedimedung pa Israel gwangpei kemak ngau luge, penui pecu gwazui kela gade cailidi. <verse eid="2CH 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 18:33" />Dede mige pe lakpi keu mpet pesuira tei kapgai ge Israel gwangpei Ahab reunet ketamtwak kak gage kapti. Pecai Ahab pe bagi keteube dage rangdi, “Nreu gwanglu nah acu hereu gade pung mpet beulo, kedanemene acu rejamsüt dida.” <verse eid="2CH 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 18:34" />Cipau nai hereu tei ntei sütdi, nah Israel gwangpei Ahab pe bagi reuga tinghegi kecang dungpung bamdi, Aramme de mcwa lwe. Tingnaimiak kenlüt dau, pa tsaidi.<verse eid="2CH 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2CH 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 19:1" />Judah gwangpei Jehoshaphat kwak eh Jerusalem ga pe ki ga cailigwang lu. <verse eid="2CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 19:2" />Pecai caihakecime ge, Hanani napei Jehu, hegwangpei de dau kera tetpet nah hegwangpei Jehoshaphat dage ranggai, “Nang kenlienme de ngha bam zieni? Nang RAMPAUBE de ngkau kelame de ku bam zieni? Aipau ta de tei kedi ziemne, RAMPAUBE rata n reu ga bam dida. <verse eid="2CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 19:3" />Ciciuliede, n da makeyi dungge bam, nang Asherah miedung hangdeu cikade keugidi kecune, nah nang Tinggwang de peei kera n mlung gage kaipwa kebamne.”<verse eid="2CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoshaphat tutiakme kedetkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 19:4" />Jehoshaphat Jerusalem ga lunghdi; nah pa minadung kakga mie dai, Beersheba namdi gade Ephraim kideutu deudi ga kecang nah penuide RAMPAUBE penui paume Tinggwang da ngngwa cailigwang lu. <verse eid="2CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 19:5" />Pa Judah hangdeu leune riekelu namdidung pelane ga, namdi ge cai namdi ge ga, tutiakmedung kaibeu. <verse eid="2CH 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 19:6" />Jehoshaphat tutiakmedung dage ranggai, “Nnui tei maikesia de tei teunelu, kedanemene nnui au mina ziemne hetutiak ma, dede RAMPAUBE ziemne; pa hetuketiak ga nnui de ngngwala. <verse eid="2CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 19:7" />Cu cine, peu RAMPAUBE mie kehing de nnui reu ga bam lu. Nnui hetuketiak dau mriaklu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE, anui Tinggwang da mide kecwa, mede heneuherüt ketei, mede hetauhenim gah.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:11">Rom. 2:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 19:8" />Cipaureude, Jehoshaphat Jerusalem ga Levime nah cingkumedung kangge, nah Israel leuhme ki ga muiteumedung kangge de kedetlu, RAMPAUBE zi gade hetutiak kerane, nah kesamdau lu kera ziemne. Penui Jerusalem ga lungh bam. <verse eid="2CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 19:9" />Pa penuide ainzwa rang eh ranglia beu di, “Nnui RAMPAUBE de herüt peu eh, samsang eh, nah nnui mlung pelane pwa pe ta tei maisia. <verse eid="2CH 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 19:10" />Nnui sinamedung penui namdidung ga lungh kebamme dade kesamlim kecu ge nnuida gwang kecu dau, mide teitset kedine, hezaidung nah ajadung, rau kenzeu zaidung mede kaikebeu zaidung ha ziemne, nnui penuide ranglia lu maisia, iciu eh penui RAMPAUBE dwa gade maudi melu kerane, mecai n da nah n sinamedung da rata gwang dizie. Nnui aide teilu iciulude nnui mau dilak. <verse eid="2CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 19:11" />Pielo, Amariah cingku kedibe ne RAMPAUBE renet zaidung pelane ga nnui reu zie. Judahme leuh muiteube, Ishmael napei Zebadiah, ne hegwang ha pelane reu pie zie. Levime hezai kemzeube tei kemzai ga nnuide kenghabe tei zie. Kuulu nah hezaidung mzailu, nah RAMPAUBE de peu keyime de nzangla lulo.”<verse eid="2CH 19:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2CH 20" />
  <para style="s">Jehoshaphat Moab penai Ammon ngamkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 20:1" />Cipaucia matiemene, Moab nah Ammon ga minadung, nah Meunme kangge de ngngwa si eh Judah gwangpei Jehoshaphat de renia eh hereu tei kera gwang. <verse eid="2CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 20:2" />Cidau samgwame kangge Jehoshaphat da gwang eh ranggai, “Edom deudi gade, hemaa kekieege ncu renia kera Ketsai Jaaidi lulegim de gwangla dida. Pielo, penui Hazezon Tamar ga la dida,” cide au, Engedi. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Nda nah cudau kesa laisiudung ga </char><char style="fqa">Edom</char>, de mene <char style="fqa">Aram </char> de bam. </note> <verse eid="2CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 20:3" />Jehoshaphat ngngidi nah pa RAMPAUBE de peei kera pecu tiaklu. Pa Judah cuikui pelane ga mmwang kera sam kaigai. <verse eid="2CH 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 20:4" />Judahme RAMPAUBE de peei kera Jerusalem ga gwang ncütlu; Judah namdidung leune gade RAMPAUBE de peei kerane gwanglu.<verse eid="2CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 20:5" />Jehoshaphat Judah nah Jerusalemme ngkwa kebam ga saplu, RAMPAUBE ki ga, kigu keheci dwa ga. <verse eid="2CH 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 20:6" />Pa kie sahbak gai, “RAMPAUBE, anui paume Tinggwang, nang tinggim ga Tinggwang meni? Nang ne heleuhdung hegwangram pelane reu di meni? Kengkieng au n baga bam, cine mide ncu renia gailak. <verse eid="2CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 20:7" />Anui Tinggwang, nang ne n minadung Israelme dwa de aipau deu ga kelunghme de gwa gidi, nah Abraham leuhme de kelungta ziemne pwa peu dide meni?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:23">Jas. 2:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 20:8" />Anui paume cika lunghdi nah cika ge ncu kemci nige teibeu n zi ziemne, <verse eid="2CH 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 20:9" />penui ranggai, ‘Magade kengkap anui da gwang cai, hereu, tutiak, mede rapia, mede herakum, anui kerecaki aide dwaga sap zie, nah n dwa ga (kedanemene n zi aipau kerecaki ga kebam ne), nah anui keherei kelu dau n dage kie gai zie, nah nang anui kwa siu luzie delwe anuide keli beuzie.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fqa">Tutiak de mene</char>, <char style="fqa">duinai de bam ndaa nah cudau kwak kesa ga</char>. </note> <verse eid="2CH 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 20:10" />Cu pielo, Ammon, Moab nah Seir Lamlwa minadung aika bam, nang Israelme Egypt deu gade kempet dau penuide peu lüt ma; meliene, Israelme penui dade nreu tetdi nah penuide tei ngkapdi ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 20:14-21 nah Hez. 2:4-19 </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 20:11" />Pielo penui dainzwa anuide hekum peei zeubi; nang ne anuide n deu gum lulo kepeu gade anuide gwa gi kera penui gwangla dida. <verse eid="2CH 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 20:12" />Anui Tinggwang, nang penui tutiak lak ni? Kedanemene anui au reugwame kedi aide anui da gwang kelame dade kengkieng gahlu. Anui daipai tei ziebi ci meda, dede anui au ncu ngngei la.” <verse eid="2CH 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 20:13" />Judahme pelane penui naudung, namedung, nah henamedung de ngngwa lwe RAMPAUBE dwa saplu.<verse eid="2CH 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 20:14" />Cidau minadung kebam maa sum ga, RAMPAUBE rabe Levime ge reu ga gwanglu, pe zi Jahaziel, Zechariah napei, pa Asaph pautsame ge, nah Benaiah, Jeiel, nah Mattaniah tsapei. <verse eid="2CH 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 20:15" />Jahaziel rangdi, “Kingneilu, Judahme pelane nah nnui Jerusalem ga kelunghme, nah hegwangpei Jehoshaphat. RAMPAUBE ainzwa nnui da ranggai, ‘Ngngi so; aipau reugwame kedi de ziemne nnui lung ceu diso, kedanemene hereu aide nnui ne lak, dede Tinggwang ne zie. <verse eid="2CH 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 20:16" />Nnui ncünne penuide renia kera hung bilu. Pielo, penui Ziz lampui tetkah kegwang lede hangla. Nnui penuide Jeruel hetaideu dwaga, langkam penli ga bam eh ngau luzie. <verse eid="2CH 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 20:17" />Nnui aipau hereu dega regi maisia dilak. Judah nah Jerusalem ga minadung, nnui bamga saplu, sap ntiplu, nah RAMPAUBE nnuide kelikebeu pielo. Ngngi mede lunghau diso. Mie penuide ncünne renia cu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnuide ngngwala lu.’” <verse eid="2CH 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 20:18" />Jehoshaphat keumie pezu hangdeu tunglu, nah Judah nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme leune RAMPAUBE dwa ga keumie pecu recadi. <verse eid="2CH 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 20:19" />Levimedung, Kohathme nah Korahme pautsadung, sahbak eh cuh saplu, RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang de twa kera ziemne.<verse eid="2CH 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 20:20" />Pecai benai tingcang nuge penui cuhlu delwe Tekoa hetaideu ga mie. Penui tetpet kecu dau, Jehoshaphat cuhlu eh rangdi, “A kwa kingneilu, Judahmedung, nah nnui Jerusalem ga kelunghmedung! RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de nlumlu, iciude nnuide ngha beuzie. Pe caihakecimedung de nlumlu, nah nnui ngkieng luzie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tekoa ga hetaideu de au hangdeu ketsai ge Tekoa namceu tai ga, cide Jerusalem tingpile gade kilometers 16 kezwa ge.</char></note> <verse eid="2CH 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 20:21" />Pecai hegwangpei Jehoshaphat minadung de ngngwa resiu kelu cai, pa RAMPAUBE da lei tei kegaime de nah pe kemci keyi de ziemne pecu twa kelame de kedetlu, penui reugwame dwa gade tet pet kecudau, ranggai, “RAMPAUBE de hetwa peu lu, kedanemene pe samkakkelu kesamsang de kelunghta bamla.” <verse eid="2CH 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 20:22" />Penui leitei nah pecu twa cuhdi ge, RAMPAUBE minadung de langgai beu eh Ammonme, Moabme, nah Seir Lamlwa ga kelunghme de renia eh gwaketang, Judah de gwaketang kera gwang kelame de. Penuide ngamdi. <verse eid="2CH 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 20:23" />Kedanemene Ammonme nah Moabme Seir Lamlwa ga lungh kebamme de ngngwa regi cuhdi, penuide teitset ciak nah ngkapdi kerane. Penui Seir Lamlwa ga lungh kebamme de teitset ciak dige, penui pelane hangge gede ngngwa regi bamdi.<verse eid="2CH 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 20:24" />Judahme hetaideu ngau kebam ni ga gwang luge, penui reugwame lam piegai. Ainie, penui au tsai dida, hangdeu ga kauzeu bam; migede paklu meda. <verse eid="2CH 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 20:25" />Jehoshaphat nah pe minadung penui dade hema tui kera gwang luge, penui kakga mania gi kenzeu, paiheni nah mania pemi kehungdung ngaulu, cidungde penui pung kap gai kelak ge, penui ziemne keulu. Kiee ham kedine, penui hema tui kelube pwa hekwa eh lang cumne nggwangdi. <verse eid="2CH 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 20:26" />Hema tui kecu lang mdaine benai penui Berakah Langkam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Berakah Langkam </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Samlam Langkam</char></note> ga gwang ngkwalu. Cikade penui RAMPAUBE de twagai, cine cipau ni de zi “Berakah Langkam” de eh henai kecang de qula. <verse eid="2CH 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 20:27" />Pecai penui, Judah nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme pelane, Jehoshaphat ne penuide teuswa eh penui sui yi eh Jerusalem ga cailigwangdi, kedanemene RAMPAUBE peu penuide penui ngauraume reu ngkieng kelu ziemne. <verse eid="2CH 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 20:28" />Penui lyre, leibung, nah teluidung kwa eh Jerusalem ga, nah RAMPAUBE ki ga gwanglu. <verse eid="2CH 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 20:29" />Tinggwang de kehing, twagwa kebam hegwangram leune ga bamdi, RAMPAUBE Israel ngauraume de ngngwa regi kecu penui siu luge. <verse eid="2CH 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 20:30" />Cine Jehoshaphat hegwangram ga kehebwak bam ma, kedanemene pe Tinggwang pecu lule ailam tu leuga lungciep peu.<verse eid="2CH 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoshaphat hegwangketei cangkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 20:31" />Jehoshaphat Judahme reu hegwang tei: Pa hegwang teicuh kecu dau pa au mmi camreiehmengei, nah Jerusalem ga mmi ngkaiehmengei hegwang tei. Pe pui zi cai Azubah, Shilhi napui. <verse eid="2CH 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 20:32" />Pa pe pei Asa nzwa lungh gwang; pa cide gade nreu di ma; pa RAMPAUBE dwade petaube teilu. <verse eid="2CH 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 20:33" />Ciciuliede, nlum kemakme reca nidung au keugidi ma. Minadung cidaude penui paume Tinggwang dage penui lung nreugai luma. <verse eid="2CH 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 20:34" />Jehoshaphat heta tei kegai keda, raitu gade penli kecang, ainie, cidungde Hanani napei Jehu hakwak ga rau nzeu, cidungde Israel gwangdung laisiukwak gage rau pwabam.<verse eid="2CH 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 20:35" />Aipau cai Judah gwangpei, Jehoshaphat, Israel gwangpei Ahaziah, kesiata kekiee keteibe de ngngwa henna teilu. <verse eid="2CH 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 20:36" />Pa pecu ngngwa henna ketei au liem tei lwe Tarshish ga mie kerane. Penai liem Ezion-Geber namceu gade teilu. <verse eid="2CH 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2CH 20:37" />Cidau Mareshah namceu gade kegwangbe Dodavahu napei Eliezer, Jehoshaphat da cairasam rang; pa rangdi, “Kedanemene nang Ahaziah de ngngwa henna tei kedine, RAMPAUBE nang tei kelude ngkapdi da.” Liemdung siadi iciu eh madaude liemtau lu tadi.<verse eid="2CH 20:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2CH 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 21:1" />Pecai Jehoshaphat pe paumedung nzwa tsaidi nah pecu David namdi ga penuide kekung gage kungdi. Pe napei Jehoram pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 21:2" />Jehoshaphat napei Jehoram pe siname mipeina aidungde bam: Azariah, Jehiel, Zechariah, Azariahu, Michael, nah Shephatiah. Penui pelane Israel gwangpei Jehoshaphat napeidung. <verse eid="2CH 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 21:3" />Penui pei penuide rangkanggeu, kecak nah keda ma pemi kehung mapeu kekiee, nah Judah ga riekelu namdidung si eh pwapeu, dede pe hegwangram Jehoram de pwapeudi.<verse eid="2CH 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Jehoram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 21:4" />Cu Jehoram pe pei hegwangram leulu, nah pe hegwangram tei ngkieng luge, pa pe siname peciakne de nah Israel ga muiteume keda ketsamtsam dungde kingtie le bi tsetdi. <verse eid="2CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 21:5" />Jehoram hegwang tei keludau pa mmi camreiehkena di, nah pa Jerusalem ga mmi heset ge hegwang tei. <verse eid="2CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 21:6" />Pa Israel gwangpeidung puisau nzuidi, Ahab kelak tei kedi nzwa, kedanemene pa Ahab napui de pe nau kelune, nah pa RAMPAUBE miakngau gade kemau teidi. <verse eid="2CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 21:7" />Ciciuliede, RAMPAUBE David kelak tei ngkapdi neu tadi, kedanemene pa David da ngngwa samkak kelune; pa pecu nah pe leuhme de hegwang tei jüja kera peu zielie sampet beu kedine.<verse eid="2CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 21:8" />Jehoram hegwang tei kebam tingdau, Edomme Judah kangga kebam gade ngngwa siadi, delwe penuikatei penui reu hegwang ge kedetlu. <verse eid="2CH 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 21:9" />Pecai Jehoram pe reugwa muibedung nah pe bagidung pelane de nzanglwe tetpet. Pa cuh delwe Edomme pecu nah pe bagi muibedung de twagwa kebamme de ngngwa regi kecu dau tingmui dida. <verse eid="2CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 21:10" />Cine henai kecang Edom Judah de ngngwa sia eh pe kangga lungh si tadi. Cipau tingdau Libnah namdi de pe kangga kebamme de ngngwa siadi, kedanemene Jehoram, RAMPAUBE, pe paume Tinggwang de püt kedine.<verse eid="2CH 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 21:11" />Cipau reude, Jehoram Judah lamlwatudung gage nlum kemakme reca nidung de teigai nah pa Jerusalem ga kelunghmedung de peu helipuidung nzwa lunghdi nah pa Judah ga minadung de kemau ga peu ladi. <verse eid="2CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 21:12" />Caihakecibe Elijah laisiu ge Jehoram dage kaigai. Ainzwa rang eh, “Aide RAMPAUBE, n paume David Tinggwang ainzwa ranggai: Nang, n pei Jehoshaphat puisau ga, mede Judah gwangpei, Asa puisau mzui ma, <verse eid="2CH 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 21:13" />dede Israel gwangdung puisau nzuidi nah Judah nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme de, Ahab kilungme ketei nzwa, peu helipui nzwa lunghdi, nah kedanemene nang n sinamedung, n pei kilungme, n swa yiki kecume de teitset kedine, <verse eid="2CH 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 21:14" />cine pielo, RAMPAUBE n minadung, n nau n name da saja kedi ge kaigai zie nah n mabam pelane ngkapdi zie. <verse eid="2CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 21:15" />N raidung ga mateei ge ziemne nang mra süt dizie, cipau mateei de ziemne n raidung sia cangsiak di kemaktane, tingnaige swa tingnaige sia reureu dizie.”<verse eid="2CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 21:16" />Cush taiga kebam Philistinme penai Arabme de RAMPAUBE ne Jehoram de ngngwa regi kera helung teigai beudi. <verse eid="2CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 21:17" />Penui Judah de gwaketang, cide lüt tuilu, delwe hegwangki ga mabam ngaukelu pelane pung tetdi. Penui pe napeidung nah pe naudung dede ngngwa tetdi. Pe da pe napei henatube, Jehoahaz de gwale keda hangge de de kaidiak beu ma.<verse eid="2CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 21:18" />Aidungde pelane cai, RAMPAUBE pecu pe rai gage yi daigai kelak mateei ge kaigai. <verse eid="2CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 21:19" />Cidau mmi kena ge cang kera tingdau, pe mra de ziemne, pe rai siadi, nah mateei cide sia süt kedi ziemne pa tsaidi. Pe minadung pe dwa ga pe paume ziemne tei kegai nzwa penui pecu herüt peu eh mimang gede teigai ma. <verse eid="2CH 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 21:20" />Jehoram mmi camreiehkena dau pa hegwang teilu; pa Jerusalem ga mmi heset ge hegwang tei, nah pa tsai kedi dau migede pecu hei eh hap ma. Penui pecu David namdi gage kungdi, dede hegwangme raudung gage kung ma.<verse eid="2CH 21:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2CH 22" />
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Ahaziah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 22:1" />Jerusalem ga kelunghme, Jehoram napei henatube Ahaziah de peu pe pei mding hegwang teilu, kedanemene mina maa ge Arabme de ngngwa eh ramzeuki ga kegwang dau, pe napei kecingmedung de teitset ciak kedine. Cine Judah gwangpei Jehoram napei Ahaziah ne hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2CH 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 22:2" />Ahaziah mmi ngkaiehkena dige pa hegwang teilu; pa Jerusalem ga mmi ge hegwang tei. Pe pui zi cai Athaliah; pa au Israel gwangpei Omri napui. <verse eid="2CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 22:3" />Pa hegwangpei Ahab kelak puisau de nzuidi kedanemene pe pui Athaliah ne heta kesia ketei gage pecu ledeu gai kebeune. <verse eid="2CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 22:4" />Ahaziah RAMPAUBE miakngau gade kemau teidi, Ahab kelak kesia tei kebam nzwa eh, kedanemene pe pei tsai kedi cai, penui ne pe keledeume tei eh pecu kengkap gage saugai beudi. <verse eid="2CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 22:5" />Pa penui keledeu sam de de nzuidi, pa Israel gwangpei, Ahab napei Joram de ngngwa Aram gwangpei Hazael de Ramoth Gilead namdi gade ngngwa regi kera mie. Aram reugwame ne Joram de tei rejamdi. <verse eid="2CH 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 22:6" />Joram, Ramah gade Aram gwangpei Hazael de ngngwa regi kecudau, penui ne pecu rejam kedi de yilu kerane Jezreel namceu ga cailigwang lu. Cine Judah gwangpei, Jehoram napei Ahaziah, Ahab napei Joram de pie zielie Jezreel ga mie, kedanemene Joram de rejam kedine.<verse eid="2CH 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 22:7" />Tinggwang ne Ahaziah Joram de mie kepie aide teu eh Ahaziah de teingkau lu. Pa gwang kelu dau, pa Jehoram de ngngwa Nimshi napei Jehu de gwaketang kera mie, pa au RAMPAUBE ne Ahab kelak de teingkap kera kedet kelube. <verse eid="2CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 22:8" />Cidau, Jehu Tinggwang tutiak de Ahab kelakdung dage tei kebam dau, pa Judah muiteume nah Ahaziah napei sinamedung Ahaziah gwatei bam eh ngaulu. Iciu eh Jehu penuide teitsetdi. <verse eid="2CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 22:9" />Jehu Ahaziah de peei; penui pecu Samaria ga mbai bam eh ngaulu, pecu Jehu da ngngwa gwang lwe pecu teitsetdi. Ge penui pecu kungdi, kedanemene penui rangdi, “Pa au Jehoshaphat napei, pe pei pe mlung pekiene pwa RAMPAUBE de kepeei kauge.” Cine Ahaziah kelak gade migede hegwangram reu hegwang tei kera kengkieng gahdi.<verse eid="2CH 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Athaliah nah Joash</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 22:10" />Cidau hegwangpei Ahaziah pui Athaliah pe napei tsai kedi ci luge, pa Judah kelak ga hegwangme na pelane de teitset cuhdi. <verse eid="2CH 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 22:11" />Dede hegwangpei napui Jehosheba, ngkim eh Ahaziah napei Joash de hegwang name de teitsetdi lai eh kebamme dade ngngwa teu tetdi. Pa pecu nah pe nkwetpui de zeubung gage kaidi. Ainzwa eh hegwangpei Jehoram napui Jehosheba, cingkupei Jehoiada nau (pa au Ahaziah tipui), pecu Athaliah dade kebailu, iciu eh Athaliah pecu teitset melu kerane. <verse eid="2CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 22:12" />Joash penuide ngngwa, Tinggwang kerecaki ga mmi herok ge mbai bamdi, cidau Athaliah hegwangpui tei eh hangdeu reu kedi tei bamdi.<verse eid="2CH 22:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 23:1" />Mmi hena bekum, cingkupei Jehoiada pe kengkieng keulia eh pa reugwamaa haireu muibedung de ngngwa samkaklu: Jehoram napei Azariah, Jehohanan napei Ishmael, Obed napei Azariah, Adaiah napei Maaseiah nah Zichri napei Elishaphat. <verse eid="2CH 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 23:2" />Penui hang mengei Judah ga mie eh Levime de nah Israel ga pautsa peume de si eh Judah namdi pelane gade hekwalu, nah penui Jerusalem ga gwanglu. <verse eid="2CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 23:3" />Mina hemaa pelane Tinggwang ki gade hegwangpei de ngngwa kesamkak lu. Jehoiada penui dage ranggai, “Pielo, hegwangpei napei hegwang tei zie, RAMPAUBE hegwangpei David leuhme ne zielie rang kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="2CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 23:4" />Nnui aide tei bi maisia: Cingkume nah Levime Sabbath benai mata tei kera kegwangme, penui kecum zige kerecaki riekidung ga kekwame zie. <verse eid="2CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 23:5" />Kecum zige keda cai hegwang ki ga zie, nah kecum zige keda Bangdwa Rieki ga zie. Mina pelane RAMPAUBE ki kigu ga ngkwa luzie. <verse eid="2CH 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 23:6" />Peu migede de RAMPAUBE ki ga lüt lak, cingkume nah Levime heta tei kebamme gwale. Penui au lüt lubui kedanemene penuide tei mcilu delu. Dede mina kedame pelane RAMPAUBE sam mzailu maisia. <verse eid="2CH 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 23:7" />Levime mi hangge ge kecu pe reunetdung pe ba ga pwalwe hegwangpei de petu pelane ga twagwa lu maisia. Hegwangpei kegwang kemie leuga pecu ngngwala lu. Mina keheibe de kerecaki ga lüt cai, pecu peu teitsetdi lu.”<verse eid="2CH 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 23:8" />Cine Levime nah Judah ga minadung pelane cingkupei Jehoiada sam kai kebeu nzwa eh heta teilu. Sabbath benai bata tei kera gwang lai eh kebamme nah sabbath ga heta teicang lwe tet kerame, pe mina hangge gede ngngwalu, kedanemene cingkupei Jehoiada peu migede de tet kemakne. <verse eid="2CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 23:9" />Ge cingkupei Jehoiada reugwamaa muibedung de Hegwangpei David gu hengeidung nah hegeudung keceu kedi Tinggwang ki gage kaipwa kebamdung de teu gwang beu. <verse eid="2CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 23:10" />Jehoiada, kerecaki zetle gade kerecaki hile kecang, reca ni ga nah kerecaki ga, reugwame pelane de peu pe reunet riep pe ba ga pwalwe hegwangpei de twagwalu. <verse eid="2CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 23:11" />Pecai penui hegwangpei napei de ngngwa petlu, pe peu gage hegwangpeurwa kailu delwe samkakkelu zaidung laisiu de pecu peu. Iciu eh penui pecu peu hegwang teilu, nah Jehoiada nah pe napeidung pecu keniaklu. Pecai minadung pelane, “Hegwangpei ring ketiebe teilo,” de eh sahgai.<verse eid="2CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 23:12" />Athaliah mina pakkela nah hegwangpei de ketwa kwa siu luge, pa RAMPAUBE ki ga minadung ngkwa kebam ga gwang, <verse eid="2CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 23:13" />nah Athaliah piegai ge, ainie, hegwangpei keheci kerecaki kimui ga, hegwangme ziemne kaipwa kebam tsiapum pi ga reugwa muibedung nah telui kekwame ne twagwapung kebam ngaulu. Cika lungh kebam mina pelane penui sui yisüt bam nah telui kwabam nah kerecaki ga leiketeime leibungdung kwa eh ketwa lei tei eh teuswa bam. Cidau Athaliah pe paini hietdi delwe sahbak eh cu, “Hegwang de mlai zeu! Hegwang de mlai zeu!” <verse eid="2CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 23:14" />Cidau cingkupei Jehoiada haireu reugwa muibedung, reugwame reu kedimedung de ngngwa mpetlu delwe penui dade rangdi, “Pecu kekwame riadung kak de teu mpetlu, nah keheibe de pecai sui cai, peu pecu kingtie le teitsetdi lu.” Kedanemene cingkupei ainzwa ranggai delu, “Pecu RAMPAUBE ki gade teitset so.” <verse eid="2CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 23:15" />Cine penui pa hegwang ki ga Hekwen Rieki kimui ga lüt kela dau pecu tuilu delwe cikade penui pecu teitsetdi.<verse eid="2CH 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 23:16" />Pecai Jehoiada nah hegwangpei, nah minadung pelane kakga pa de si eh, penui RAMPAUBE mina tei zielie samkaklu. <verse eid="2CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 23:17" />Cine minadung pelane Baal kerecaki ga mie eh cide tei ngkaudi. Penui Baal recabamdung teipangdi nah pe miedung tei takcaidi, delwe cipau recabamdung dwade Baal cingkupei, Mattan de teitsetdi. <verse eid="2CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 23:18" />Jehoiada RAMPAUBE ki pie rengei kerane cingkume kangga kedimedung de kedetlu, cidungde cai Levimedung, David ne RAMPAUBE ki ga heta tei kera nlum kebeume, Moses zai ga raupwa kela nzwa keru recadung RAMPAUBE dage rugai beu kerane, suiyi nah ketwa lei tei eh, David rang kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="2CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 23:19" />Jehoiada RAMPAUBE ki kiriekidung gage kekwame kailu, ciu eh renet gade mcikemakme migede de peu lüt melu kerane. <verse eid="2CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 23:20" />Jehoiada haireu reugwa muibedung, makecime, mina reu deuceudime nah renamme pelane de ngngwalu. Pa hegwangpei de RAMPAUBE ki gade ngngwa nghunglu; minadung Nreule Rieki gade hegwang ki ga lütlu nah hegwangpei de hegwangbam ga peu bamlu. <verse eid="2CH 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 23:21" />Cine minadung pelane penui sui yisüt di, nah namdi de ziune di. Athaliah de penui kingtie le teitsetdi.<verse eid="2CH 23:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Joash kerecaki keretak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 24:1" />Joash mmi hena kedi dau pa hegwang teilu; pa Jerusalem ga mmi riakdai hegwang tei. Pe pui zi cai Zibiah, pa Beersheba namdi mege. <verse eid="2CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 24:2" />Joash cingkupei Jehoiada keringbe ting ga RAMPAUBE miak dwa gade petaube teilu. <verse eid="2CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 24:3" />Jehoiada, hegwangpei ziemne pe nau hangna kedetbeu nah pa pe na mipeinadung nah mipuinadung lunghlu.<verse eid="2CH 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 24:4" />Aipau cai, Joash RAMPAUBE ki retak kera cetlu. <verse eid="2CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 24:5" />Pa cingkumedung nah Levime de qu hekwa ncütlu delwe pa penui dage rangdi, “Mmi kum ramsang Judah namdidung ga mie delwe Israelme pelane dade nnui Tinggwang ki retak kera ziemne rangkang hekwa lulo. Nnui cide cu gade tei ndeu bilu maisia.” Levime kerai dau magede tei ma. <verse eid="2CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 24:6" />Cine hegwangpei, cingkupei kedibe Jehoiada de qulu delwe pe dage keteu, “Nang daitei eh Levime de peu Judah nah Jerusalem gade RAMPAUBE kebam paiki de ziemne Moses RAMPAUBE kilabe, nah Israel hemaabe ne heraha ha lulo kebeu de halu meno?” <verse eid="2CH 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 24:7" />Kedanemene Athaliah mipui kesia pui, caisuime ne Tinggwang ki de tei msiadi delwe RAMPAUBE ki kemci niadung pelane Baaldung de reca kecu ga peu kedine.<verse eid="2CH 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 24:8" />Cine hegwangpei aja kaigai, nah penui hema kengkwabung de teilu delwe cide RAMPAUBE ki hegwale kimui gage kailu. <verse eid="2CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 24:9" />Pecai penui Judah nah Jerusalem leune ga minadung de RAMPAUBE ziemne heraha ha kera Moses Tinggwang kilabe ne hetaideu gade Israelme de tei lulo kebeu de teugwang kera sam kaigai. <verse eid="2CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 24:10" />Muiteume pelane nah minadung pelane penui suiyidi nah heraha rangkang keu gwang hema kengkwabung gage pui kemaktane kailu. <verse eid="2CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 24:11" />Keheidaude Levime ne hema kengkwabung de hegwangpei kedime da punggwang kecu dau, nah penui cika rangkang kekiee kebam ngaukelu dau, hegwangki ga keraube nah cingku kedibe kangga heta tei kebamme gwanglu, hema kengkwabung de tei mtalu, cide keulu, delwe cide pebam gage punggwang gaidai dila. Penui aide tingba ramsangne tei eh, rangkang kekiee ge hekwa bamla. <verse eid="2CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 24:12" />Hegwangpei penai Jehoiada RAMPAUBE ki ga heta ketei kerengeime de rangkang de peu dila. Nah mina aidungde tangtsuta keteime, tsingta keteime delwe hegeu nah hetageuta keteime depeu RAMPAUBE ki, retak kerane penui zie luilu. <verse eid="2CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 24:13" />Cine bata keteime pelane heri süt eh penui ba le retak gwang kera bata tei; nah penui Tinggwang ki de ndaa raitudau rehi nzwa eh teidai lu, nah tei ntiprip lu. <verse eid="2CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 24:14" />Penui retak cang luge, penui rangkang teu tei kebangbe hegwangpei penai Jehoiada de teugwang beudi. Aipau rangkang de RAMPAUBE ki maniadung ziemne keu dila. Lidung pwa ratak tei kera ziemne, kecak nah rangkanggeu le lidung nah hepiaktiadung teilu. Jehoiada ring kebamta penui RAMPAUBE ki ga keru recadung teigai bam muila.<verse eid="2CH 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 24:15" />Jehoiada lungh tie eh hecing süt di, delwe pa tsaidi; pa tsai kecu tingdau mmi 130 di. <verse eid="2CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 24:16" />Penui pecu David namdi ga hegwangme raudung gage kungdi, kedanemene pa Tinggwang nah Tinggwang ki ziemne, nah Israel ga heta keyi tei kegaine.<verse eid="2CH 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joash kenlien</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 24:17" />Cu Jehoiada tsaikedi cai, Judah muiteume gwang eh hegwangpei Joash de herüt peugai. Cidau hegwangpei lung teilu eh pa penui sam kingnei lu. <verse eid="2CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 24:18" />Cine Judah ga mina RAMPAUBE ki, penui paume Tinggwang, de pütdi, nah herabe pui Asherah miedung nah mamiedung de recadi. Penui kemau bata aidungde ziemne RAMPAUBE rata Judah nah Jerusalem reuga gwangdi. <verse eid="2CH 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 24:19" />Dede RAMPAUBE, pa minadung de peu pe da cailigwang dailu kerane caihakecimedung de langgai beu; caihakecimedung minadung kesia zierang teigai, dede penui pe kwa kingnei raudi. <verse eid="2CH 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 24:20" />Tinggwang Rabe cingkupei Jehoiada napei Zechariah de kezeu pwadi; Zechariah minadung pecu ngaulu kebui ga saplwe penui dage ranggai, “Tinggwang aide rangzeu: Nnui daitei RAMPAUBE hezaidung de mzai meno, ciu eh nnui kekap gage tet gaila no? Nnui RAMPAUBE de püt kedine, pa de nnuide püt dida.” <verse eid="2CH 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 24:21" />Dede penui pecu teitset kera ciem riemlu; hegwangpei aja gade, penui RAMPAUBE ki kigu gade Zechariah de tangtsudung le sam. <verse eid="2CH 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 24:22" />Ainzwa eh, hegwangpei Joash, Zechariah pei Jehoiada pe dage keyi bata tei kegaidung de nsungtadi. Meliene, pa Jehoiada napei de teitsetdi. Zechariah tsai mie kecu dau, pa ranggai, “Peu RAMPAUBE de nang tei kegai aide ngau eh ncu saja peu kelube teilu.”<verse eid="2CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 24:23" />Cipau kumde mmi kekam lebie, Aram reugwame Joash de ngngwa regi. Penui Judah nah Jerusalem ga gwanglu; penui mina muiteumedung pelane de teitsetdi, delwe penui dade hema tuih keludung pelane Damascus<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Damascus </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Damascus au Syria namdi gu deuzi cika Syriame hegwangpei lungh</char></note> gwangpei de langgai beudi. <verse eid="2CH 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 24:24" />Aram reugwame kecam nage gwang liede, RAMPAUBE peu penuide Judea reugwa kekiee reu kengkieng pwapeu, kedanemene Judahme RAMPAUBE, penui paume Tinggwang de püt kedine. Ainzwa Aramme de peu hegwangpei Joash de saja peu.<verse eid="2CH 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 24:25" />Aramme caili kedi dau, Joash de rejam msia sütdi. Pe kangga pe kilame ne pecu teitset kera heciem riemlu, kedanemene pa cingkupei, Jehoiada napeidung de daptset kedine. Penui pecu pe zeu gade teitsetdi, nah pa tsaidi; penui pecu David namdi gage kungdi, dede hegwangme raudung gage kung ma. <verse eid="2CH 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 24:26" />Aipau kena de ne pecu teitset kera heciem tei: Zabad, pa Ammonme pui Shimeath napei nah Jehozabad, pa Moabme pui Shimrith napei. <verse eid="2CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 24:27" />Cu Joash napeidung ha, pe ziemne caihasam kemlang kerangdung, nah Tinggwang ki retak kecu de, ainie, cidungde hegwangme Laisiu rangkecaikwak gage raupwa la. Pe napei Amaziah pebam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2CH 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2CH 25" />
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Amaziah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 25:1" />Judah gwangpei Amaziah mmi ngkaiehmengei dau pa hegwang teilu; pa Jerusalem ga mmi ngkaiehekui hegwang tei. Pe pui au Jerusalemme pui ge, pe zi Jehoaddan. <verse eid="2CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 25:2" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade petaube tei, dede lungsang gade tei ma. <verse eid="2CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 25:3" />Amaziah hegwang tei ngkinglu herizi, pa pe pei, hegwangpei de daptset kedi kilame de teitsetdi. <verse eid="2CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 25:4" />Dede pa dapketsetme name de teitsetdi ma, dede hezai ga raupwa kela de nzwa teilu, Moses laisiukwak ga, RAMPAUBE sam kai kebeu de nzwa, “Pe peime pe name ziemne tsai dilak, mede pe name pe peime ziemne tsai dilak. Meliene, mileune de pekatei pe mau ziemne tsai zie.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 24:16</char></note><verse eid="2CH 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 25:5" />Cipaureude, Amaziah Judahme de hekwalu, delwe penui pautsa rehi gade penui maa mzilu, pecang reu nah pehai reu reugwa muibedung kang gage, Judah nah Benjamin leuh pelane de. Pa penuide mmi ngkai nah pe nreule gade peilu, nah hengei nah hegeu pwa kecime hereu tei kera mtei kelumedung kedetkelu minadung pelane ge 300,000 bam kecu ngaulu. <verse eid="2CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 25:6" />Pa Israel gade reugwame mina 100,000 de de rangkanggeu talent haige<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Talent haige </char><char style="ft" closed="false">3400 kilograms</char></note> le hezie luilu. <verse eid="2CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 25:7" />Dede caihakecime ge pe da gwang nah rangdi, “Hegwangpei, peu Israel reugwame de ncu nzang mie so, kedanemene RAMPAUBE Israelme nah Ephraim leuhme migede de ngngwala ma. <verse eid="2CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 25:8" />Dede nang magade mie delwe hereu gade kuu nah ngkieng liede, Tinggwang ngauraume de peu ncu ngam luzie, kedanemene Tinggwang da ngha kera, nah ngamlu kera kengkieng kebamne.” <verse eid="2CH 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 25:9" />Amaziah caihakecibe dage rangdi, “Dede Ih Israel reugwame de talent haige peu kedi de dainzwa lai no?” Caihakecibe keligai, “RAMPAUBE cide swade kiee eh ncu peu lubui.” <verse eid="2CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 25:10" />Cine Amaziah reugwame Ephraim gade pe da kegwangme de teu ntsamdi; pa penuide kilung gage langgai daidi. Cine penui Judah ga minadung de penui rata süt cuhdi, nah penui rata süt eh kilung caili gwangdi. <verse eid="2CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 25:11" />Amaziah pe lung tei ngkuulu eh pe minadung de teuswalu, Mcai Langkam ga mie kerane; cikade pa Edom reugwame mina cang kerei ge de ngamlu. <verse eid="2CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 25:12" />Judah reugwame mina keda cang kerei gede tuilwe teu tetdi. Penui penuide hetia kehu ga ngngwa mielwe cikade penuide kelien gai, iciu eh penui pelane de tei takcaira dedi. <verse eid="2CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 25:13" />Dede Israel reugwame, Amaziah penuide hereu ga pecu ngngwa mie kelakne lang caili kedimedung, Judah namdidung Samaria gade Beth Horon ga kecang gwaketang. Penui mina cang cum gede teitsetdi nah hema kekiee ge tuilu.<verse eid="2CH 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 25:14" />Cu, hegwangpei Amaziah Edomme de gitset lwe cailigwang kelucai, pa Seirme gu rabedung pung gwanglu, delwe cidungde de pe rabe tei kera teilu. Pa cidungde dwa keumie nah cidungde dage marim kehengui rugai. <verse eid="2CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 25:15" />Cine RAMPAUBE Amaziah de pe ratadi. Pa caihakecime de pe dage langgai, pa ranggai, “Nang daitei eh mina rabedung n ba gade pe minadung de keli gai kelak rabedung de de reca lano?” <verse eid="2CH 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 25:16" />Caihakecibe pecu ngngwa mpau kebam dau, hegwangpei pe dage rangdi, “Anui ncu peu hegwangpei de keledeube tei ni? Mtaklu! Dai ziemne ncu teitset lai?” Cidau caihakecibe mtakdi nah rangdi, “Tinggwang ncu ngkapdi kera cet kelu Ih cibam dida kedanemene nang aidungde tei kegaine nah a keledeu sam kingnei kemakne.”<verse eid="2CH 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 25:17" />Cidau Judah gwangpei Amaziah keledeume de ngngwa kempaulu eh Israel gwangpei Jehoash, Jehoahaz napei nah Jehu tsapei dage sam langgai, eh ranggai, “Gwanglu, hereu gade kezumok eh hangge gede redau go.” <verse eid="2CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 25:18" />Dede Israel gwangpei Jehoash Judah gwangpei Amaziah dage samgwame de aipau samgwa gade keligai, “Lebanon ga kebam hetuhum ge Lebanon ga cedar bang ge dage, ‘N napui de peu a napei nau lo’ de eh sam langgai, dede Lebanon ga renaam kaune kahgwang eh hetuhum de dau ngkaudi. <verse eid="2CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 25:19" />Nang ainzwa ranggai da, ‘Pielo, Ih Edom de ngam luda,’ nah nang hegie bam. Nang ngkieng kelu ga hegie lulo, dede kilung ga bamlu, kedanemene nang daitei nkatei n da kekap teugwang gai eh nangde nah Judah de ncu ngngwa kau lai no?”<verse eid="2CH 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 25:20" />Dede Amaziah kingnei tadi, kedanemene aide Tinggwang lungning kedine, ciu eh pa Judahme de penui ngauraume ba gage kailu kerane, kedanemene penui Edomme gu rabedung dade keledeusam peei kedine. <verse eid="2CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 25:21" />Cine Jehoash, Israel gwangpei, gwaketang; pa nah Judah gwangpei, Amaziah, Judahme deu Beth Shemesh namceu gade kezumok eh hangge gede redaulu. <verse eid="2CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 25:22" />Judahme de Israelme ne ngamlu, nah mina leune kilung gage pak gaidi. <verse eid="2CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 25:23" />Israel gwangpei Jehoash, Amaziah Judah gwangpei, Jehoash napei, Ahaziah tsapei de Beth Shemesh gade tuihlu. Pa pecu Jerusalem ga ngngwa gwanglu delwe Jerusalem rieki de tei msiadi, Ephraim Rieki gade Kimiak Rieki kecang, pe mdei cubit hai mdai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit hai mdai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">feet 600</char></note> ge. <verse eid="2CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 25:24" />Pa kecak nah rangkang pelane, hema pelane Tinggwang kerecaki ga Obed Edom leuhme da kebam de, nah hegwangki ga ma pemi kehung dung keulu, nah mina tuikeludung de de ngngwalu, delwe Samaria ga cailigwang di.<verse eid="2CH 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 25:25" />Joash napei Amaziah, Judah gwangpei, Jehoahaz napei Jehoash, Israel gwangpei tsai kedi cai mmi kereiehmengei ge lunghlu. <verse eid="2CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 25:26" />Amaziah tei kegai kedabe dung cai, raitu gade gwang kamtu kecang, ainie, cidungde Judah nah Israel gwangpeime ha laisiukwak gage raupwa bam meni? <verse eid="2CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 25:27" />Cu Amaziah RAMPAUBE caisui kela gade nreu tet kedi gade, penui pe dage heciem kesia teigai kera Jerusalem gade riem cu. Pa Lachish gage pak gaidi, dede penui Lachish namdi ga minadung de pecai langgai delwe pecu cikade teitsetdi. <verse eid="2CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 25:28" />Penui pecu hekwendung reu gage pung cailigwang lu delwe Judah namdi ga pe paume de kekung gage kungdi.<verse eid="2CH 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="2CH 26" />
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Uzziah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 26:1" />Hegwangpei Amaziah tsai kedi cai, Judah ga mina pelane Uzziah, mmi kereieherok kedi gede peu pe pei keleu tei eh hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 26:2" />Pa ne Elath namceu retak dailu nah Judahme de peudi. Pecai hegwangpei pe paume nzwa tsaidi. <verse eid="2CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 26:3" />Uzziah mmi kereieherok dau pa hegwang teilu. Pa Jerusalem ga mmi riakngeiehkena hegwang tei. Pe pui au Jerusalemme pui ge; pe zi cai Jekoliah. <verse eid="2CH 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 26:4" />Pa pelane ga pe pei Amaziah puisau mzui eh RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade petaube teilu. <verse eid="2CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 26:5" />Zechariah tingdau pa Tinggwang gwa tei kera pecu tiaklu, Zechariah pecu Tinggwang de rüt eh lungh kera ledeu beu. Pa RAMPAUBE gwatei kebamtane, Tinggwang pecu samlam beu.<verse eid="2CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 26:6" />Uzziah mie eh Philistinme de ngngwa regi. Pa Gath, Jabneh nah Ashdod namdi kiriedung de tei ngkaudi; pa Ashdod deudi ga nah Philistinme deu gage namdidung teilu. <verse eid="2CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 26:7" />Philistinme, Gurbaal namceu ga lungh kebam Arabme, nah Meunimme de renia kecu ga Tinggwang pecu ngha beu. <verse eid="2CH 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 26:8" />Ammonme Uzziah dage heraha habeu, nah pe kendu keyi mileune ci ladi, Egypt deurai ga kecang de, kedanemene pa ngkieng süt kedine. <verse eid="2CH 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 26:9" />Cipaureude, Uzziah Jerusalem ga Kimiak Rieki, Langkam Rieki, nah kirie ngkoi kebam gage renei kwalu, delwe cidungde tei ntiplu. <verse eid="2CH 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 26:10" />Pa renaamkang gage reketbam teilu nah tekwa kekiee kuilu, kedanemene pa hangdeu kehenadung ga nah langkiedung ga ketumdung kekiee kebamne. Pa heta keta pesui kecune, pe da kideutudung ga nah ma lunghkeyi luhdung ga heta ketamedung nah kubebang kelingmedung bam. <verse eid="2CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 26:11" />Cidungde reude, Uzziah hereu tei kera mina reugwame hemaa tei eh hereu ga kemieme bam, cidungde de penui riak ria gade teu hekwalu, Hananiah kengkieng kang gade keraube Jeiel nah kedibe Maaseiah ne peila, Hananiah cai hegwangpei kangga kedime hangge. <verse eid="2CH 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 26:12" />Pautsa muiteume mina kengkiengme de teuswa kecume riak pelane ge 2,600. <verse eid="2CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 26:13" />Penui kangga reugwame mina 307,500 ge ngkieng süt kecume de ngngwa hereu ketei ga hegwangpei de pe ngauraume dade nghalu kerame bam. <verse eid="2CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 26:14" />Uzziah penui ziemne, reugwame pelane ziemne, hegeudung, hengeidung, hereu peurwa, pumcum, lakpi, nah tangnungtsi mteibeu. <verse eid="2CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 26:15" />Jerusalem ga heciem kecimedung ne riem kebeu netdung de pa teilu, reketbam nah renei gage kai eh lakpitsi nah tangtsu kedidung kap kerane. Pe kendu keyi renam kedei kecang rang gwangdi, kedanemene pecu ngha süt beu nah pa ngkiengsüt kelune.<verse eid="2CH 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 26:16" />Dede hegwangpei Uzziah ngkieng luge, pa ngangdi iciu eh pa masang lu tadi; pa tingnaige RAMPAUBE, pe Tinggwang dage kemau tei gaidi, kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE ki ga kehengui recabam gage kehengui rugai kera lüt kedine.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehengui recabam ga cingkume rünne marim kehengui rula. Tet. 30:1-10, Pum. 16:40; 18:1-7, 1 Hel. 23:13. </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 26:17" />Cingkupei Azariah, nah RAMPAUBE cingkume mina kekuume riakheset pecu ngngwa, pecai sui lüt. <verse eid="2CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 26:18" />Penui hegwangpei Uzziah de kaamdi nah pe dage rangdi, “Uzziah, RAMPAUBE dage kehengui rugai kera n kwa ma, dede cide cingkume kwa, Aaron leuhme, kehengui ru kera ziemne penui de teimci kelume ne zie. Kemci ni gade tetdi, kedanemene nang masang kemakne nah RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ncu samlam beulak.” <verse eid="2CH 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 26:19" />Cidau Uzziah pe rata sütdi. Pa kehengui ru kerane pe ba gage kehengui kerubung de pwalwe bam. Pa cingkume de pe rata kebam dau, RAMPAUBE ki ga cingkume dwa de, kehengui recabam taiga de pe sipie ga kempa petdi. <verse eid="2CH 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 26:20" />Cingkupei kedibe Azariah nah cingkume pelane pecu piegai, nah, ainie, pa pe sipie ga mpadi. Penui cikade pecu zette gwa gidi. Pa kelwa mpet kesang, kedanemene RAMPAUBE pecu teikeherei kedine. <verse eid="2CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 26:21" />Hegwangpei, Uzziah ketsai benai kecang mpa ladi nah pa mpadi kecune pe ki tsam eh lungh di, RAMPAUBE ki ga pecu peu lüt tadi. Pe napei, Jotham, hegwangki reu nah deudi ga minadung reu kedi teidi. <verse eid="2CH 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 26:22" />Amoz napei caihakecibe Isaiah ne Uzziah tei kegwang kedabe, raitu gade gwang kamtu kecang raupwala. <verse eid="2CH 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 26:23" />Iciu eh Uzziah tsaidi; penui pecu pe paume de kekung hegwangme raukie gage kungdi, kedanemene penui rangdi, “Pa au kempame.” Pe napei, Jotham pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2CH 26:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="2CH 27" />
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Jotham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 27:1" />Judah cuikui hegwangpei Jotham mmi ngkaiehmengei dau pa hegwang teilu; pa Jerusalem ga mmi kereieherok ge hegwang tei. Pe pui zi cai Jerushah; pa Zadok napui. <verse eid="2CH 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 27:2" />Ma pelane pa pe pei Uzziah, ne lunghlia kebeude mzai eh, RAMPAUBE miak dwade petaube teilu. Dede pa au RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga lüt kecu teima. Dede minadung kemau tei eh lungh ladi. <verse eid="2CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 27:3" />Pa RAMPAUBE kerecaki nreule kirie de teilu, nah Ophel hangdeutu gage pa kirie kekiee ge tei silu. <verse eid="2CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 27:4" />Cipaureude pa Judah hangdeutu nam ga namdidung teilu, nah hegungdung gage pa hegwangki nah reketbamdung teilu. <verse eid="2CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 27:5" />Pa Ammonme gwangpei de de ngngwa regi nah pa penuide ngamlu. Cipau kum de, Ammonmedung rangkanggeu talent haige<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Talent haige </char><char style="ft" closed="false">3,400 kilogram</char></note>, wheat cangkerei mdet <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cangkerei mdet </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2,200 kiloliter</char></note>ge, barley cangkerei mdet ge pecu pwa peu. Ammonme mmi pekenabe kum nah pekecumbe kum de cinzwa pecu pwa peu. <verse eid="2CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 27:6" />Cine Judah hegwangpei Jotham ngkieng süt lu kedanemene pa ntiprip eh RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang dwa ga tet kegaine. <verse eid="2CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 27:7" />Nah Jotham tei kegwang keda hadung, pe reugwadung, nah pe zaireli pelane, ainie, cidungde Israel nah Judah gwangpeidung laisiukwak gage raupwala. <verse eid="2CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 27:8" />Pa mmi ngkaiehmengei dau hegwang teilu; pa Jerusalem ga mmi kereieherok hegwang tei. <verse eid="2CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 27:9" />Jotham pe paume nzwa tsaidi nah penui pecu David namdi gage kungdi. Pe napei, Ahaz ne pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2CH 27:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="2CH 28" />
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Ahaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 28:1" />Ahaz mmi ngkai dau pa hegwang teilu, nah pa mmi kereieherok ge Jerusalem ga hegwang tei. Pa au pe pau David ketei nzwa, RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade petaube teilu ma. <verse eid="2CH 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 28:2" />Meliene, pa Israel ga hegwangme puisaudung nzuidi; pa Baal miedung hegeule teilu. <verse eid="2CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 28:3" />Cipaureude, pa Ben Hinnom langkam gade marim kehengui rugai nah RAMPAUBE Israelme dwade, heleuh gwagi kedime kemneeu ta tei keladung zai reli eh pe namedung de keru ratak tei gaibeu. <verse eid="2CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 28:4" />Pa nlum kemakme reca nidung, hangdeutudung nah tsingbang kemdiak leune kang gage ratak teigai nah marim kehengui rugai.<verse eid="2CH 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 28:5" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang pecu Aram gwangpei ba gage kaidi. Aramme pecu ngamlu delwe hebaangme maadi kekiee gede pe dade ngngwa tetdi, nah Syria namdi sumbe Damascus ga penuide ngngwa gwanglu. Ahaz de Israel gwangpei ba gage kaibeudi, pa pecu mina kekiee gede tei ketset gade ngamlu. <verse eid="2CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 28:6" />Kedanemene Remaliah napei Pekah Israel gwangpei langnaige gage reugwame mina 120,000 de Judah gade teitsetdi, nah cidungde pelane mina kengkiengme, kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE penui paume Tinggwang de püt kedine. <verse eid="2CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 28:7" />Ephraim gade kegwang kengkieng kau Zicri ne hegwangpei napei Maaseiah, hegwangki ga kedibe Azrikam, nah hegwangpei kangga ditube Elkanah de teitsetdi. <verse eid="2CH 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 28:8" />Israel reugwame mipuidung, pe napeidung nah pe napuidung 200,000 ge de penui kibaume dade tuilu. Penui hema kekieege de tuilu, nah cidungde penui Samaria ga pung cailigwangdi. <verse eid="2CH 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 28:9" />Dede cika RAMPAUBE caihakecime ge bam, pezi cai Oded. Pa reugwame Samaria ga gwang kelame de redau kera tetpet. Pa penui dage rangdi, “Kedanemene RAMPAUBE, nnui paume Tinggwang, Judah de pe rata süt kedine, pa penuide nnui ba gage kaibeu dida. Dede nnui penuide nnui rata süt eh teitset kedi de ziemne pe ha tinggim ga hangcang dida. <verse eid="2CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 28:10" />Cu nnui Judah nah Jerusalem ga mipei nah mipuidung de nnui baang tei kera cetla. Dede RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dage nnui kemau teigai kedi ziemne maudi de meni? <verse eid="2CH 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 28:11" />Cu iciucai, a kwa kingneilu: Hebaangme, nnui kibaume dade nnui ngngwa gwang kelume de lang caili dilu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE lunghop nnui da la di delu.” <verse eid="2CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 28:12" />Pecai Ephraimme muiteumedung kangge, Jehohanan napei Azariah, Meshillemoth napei Berechiah, Shallum napei Jehizkiah, nah Hadlai napei Amasa, hereu gade cailigwang kelamedung de mlaidi. <verse eid="2CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 28:13" />Penui au penui dage rangdi, “Nnui hebaangme de aika ngngwa gwang so, kedanemene nnui anui maudung nah gikahkedidung gage kaisi kerane, anuide peu RAMPAUBE dage kemau teigai kera cetla, kedanemene anui tei mau kedi au di süt, nah Israel reuga rata sia süt kecu bam dida.” <verse eid="2CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 28:14" />Cine reugwame hebaangme nah hema tuikeludung de muiteume nah mina ngkwa kebamme dwa gage kaibeudi. <verse eid="2CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 28:15" />Muiteu hang mdai kedet pwa kebamme, paini rega keludung kesa keulu delwe hebaangme keu maisia kebamme de pwa peudi. Penui penuide paiheni nah picumdung pwapeu. Penuide ketyeikesak pwapeu. Penui rezam zamdung de rengeibeu nah kemneime de gadadung reu gage kailu. Penuide ngngwa Jericho ga penui kilungme da ngngwa cailigwang beudi, (Laira namdi lie de eh qula). Pecai penui Samaria ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="2CH 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 28:16" />Peting tie kemak ge cai hegwangpei Ahaz Assyria hegwangpeidung de pecu nghalo kie kerane samgwame langgai. <verse eid="2CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 28:17" />Kedanemene Edomme gwang Judah gwadai eh hebaangme de ngngwa tet kedine. <verse eid="2CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 28:18" />Philistinme lamlwatu pi namdidung nah Judah Negev ga hereu gwala. Penui Beth Shemesh, Aijalon, Gederoth, Soko, Timnah, Gimzo nah cidungde twagwa kebam renamdung si eh gwalu, nah penui cipau namdung ga lungh kera miedi. <verse eid="2CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 28:19" />RAMPAUBE Israel gwangpei Ahaz ziemne Judah de tei henadi; kedanemene pa Judah ga heta siasüt kecu teigai, nah RAMPAUBE dage mausüt kecu teigai kedine. <verse eid="2CH 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 28:20" />Assyria gwangpei, Tiglath-Pileser, peda gwang eh pecu tei ngkieng si meliene pecu tei keherei di. <verse eid="2CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 28:21" />Kedanemene Ahaz, Assyria gwangpei de ma pemi kehungdung pwapeu kerane RAMPAUBE kerecaki, hegwangkidung, nah muiteume kidung gade hema tui. Dede aide tei kegai ziemne pa magede kemmi ngaulu ma.<verse eid="2CH 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 28:22" />Hegwangpei Ahaz pa keherei kelu tingdau de RAMPAUBE dage kemau teikiee kidi. <verse eid="2CH 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 28:23" />Kedanemene pecu ngamkedi Damascusme rabedung dage pa ratak tei kegaine. Pa ranggai, “Aram gwangme rabedung penuide ngha kebeune Ih penui dage ratak teigai zie, iciude penui acu nghalu kerane.” Dede cidungde ne pecu nah Israel pelane de kengkap teugwang gaibeu. <verse eid="2CH 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 28:24" />Ahaz Tinggwang ki gade mania keu hekwalu delwe cidungde teipang takcaidi. Pa RAMPAUBE ki kikamdung ngkuidi delwe Jerusalem lule ailam ge pe ziemne ratakbam teilu. <verse eid="2CH 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 28:25" />Hera keda de ratak ru gaibeu kerane pa Judah namdi leune ga nlum kemakme reca nidung teilu. Iciu eh Pa RAMPAUBE, pe paume Tinggwang rata teidi. <verse eid="2CH 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 28:26" />Pa tei kegwang kedadung pelane, nah pa tei kegai leune, raitu gade kamtu kecang, ainie, cidungde Judah nah Israel hegwangme laisiukwak ga raupwala. <verse eid="2CH 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 28:27" />Ahaz pe paume nzwa tsaidi, nah penui pecu Jerusalem namdi gage kungdi, dede penui pecu Israel hegwangpeidung raudung gage kung ma. Pe napei Hezekiah, pebam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2CH 28:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="2CH 29" />
  <para style="s">Hezekiah kerecaki teikemci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 29:1" />Judah gwangpei Hezekiah mmi ngkaiehmengei dige pa hegwang teilu; pa Jerusalem ga mmi ngkaiehekui hegwang tei. Pe pui zi cai Abijah; pa au Zechariah napui. <verse eid="2CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 29:2" />Pa pe pei David tei kegai nzwa, RAMPAUBE dwa gade petaube teilu. <verse eid="2CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 29:3" />Hegwang teikelu raitu bekum, kei raitu bekei, Hezekiah RAMPAUBE ki kikamdung ngkeilu eh cidungde retaklu. <verse eid="2CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 29:4" />Pa cingkume nah Levime de ngngwa gwanglu, delwe penuide naimiak kepetle bie recaki kigu gage qu hekwalu. <verse eid="2CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 29:5" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “A kwa kingneilu, nnui Levimedung! Nnuide teimcilu, nah RAMPAUBE, nnui paume Tinggwang ki teimcilu, delwe kemci ni gade kehera leune keu gidi lu. <verse eid="2CH 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 29:6" />Kedanemene anui paume masang luma nah RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang dwa gade kemau teidi; penui pecu pütdi, nah RAMPAUBE lungh kebam ni gade penui zu nreudi, nah penui cainok di. <verse eid="2CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 29:7" />Penui kigu kikamdung de ngkuidi nah mitaubungdung tei mmütdi; penui kemci ni gade Israel Tinggwang dage marim kehengui rugai ma mede keru recadung teigai ma. <verse eid="2CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 29:8" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE lunghop Judah nah Jerusalem da gwang bam dida, nah pa penuide pwa kengngi, kerehim, nah mi ngau kerau ge tei dida, nnui ngau kebam nzwa. <verse eid="2CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 29:9" />Cine anui peimedung hereu gade tsai dida, nah aide ziemne anui napeime, anui napuime nah anui naume hebaang teila dida. <verse eid="2CH 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 29:10" />Cu au RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang de ngngwa samkak kera a lung ga cetlu, iciu eh peu pe rata anui dade nreu dilu kerane. <verse eid="2CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 29:11" />A napeidung, cu au nnui nghet so, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnuide pe gwa tei, pecu reca, pe kilame tei kera nah kehengui rugai kerane kedetlu delu.”<verse eid="2CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 29:12" />Pecai Levime cuhlu: Kohath pautsa gade; Amasai napei Mahath, nah Azariah napei Joel, nah Merari pautsa gade, Abdi napei Kish, nah Jehallelel napei Azariah; nah Gershon pautsa gade, Zimmah napei Joah, nah Joah napei Eden; <verse eid="2CH 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 29:13" />Elizaphan pautsa gade, Shimri penai Jeuel; nah Asaph pautsa gade, Zechariah penai Mattaniah; <verse eid="2CH 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 29:14" />Heman pautsa gade, Jehuel penai Shimei; nah Jeduthun pautsa gade, Shemaiah penai Uzziel. <verse eid="2CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 29:15" />Penui au penui sinamedung de qu hekwalu, penui renet zai gade penuide teimcilu, nah hegwangpei rang kebeu nzwa, RAMPAUBE sam mzui eh, RAMPAUBE ki teimci kerane penui pelung ga lütlu. <verse eid="2CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 29:16" />Cingkume RAMPAUBE ki teimci kerane kerecaki helungle lütlu; penui RAMPAUBE kerecaki gade mcikemakbe ngaukelu leune penui kerecaki kigu gage pwa mpetlu. Levime cidungde Kidron reuki gage pung mie gaidi. <verse eid="2CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 29:17" />Penui hekei raitube langnaige benai teikemci heta de mdeulu. Hekeizie lang heset ne benai penui RAMPAUBE kerecaki kigu ga teimci pet canglu. Pecai lang heset ne penui RAMPAUBE ki teimci silu. Hekei raitube ziangreieherok benai penui teicanglu. <verse eid="2CH 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 29:18" />Pecai penui hegwangki ga lütlwe hegwangpei Hezekiah da gwang eh rangdi, “Anui RAMPAUBE ki pelane teimci luda, keru recadung recabam, nah tangkubam, nah pe netdung pelane si eh. <verse eid="2CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 29:19" />Cine anui mtei canglu nah anui Hegwangpei Ahaz pe hegwang tingdau samsang mene keugi kedi niadung pelane teimci dai luda. Ainie, cidungde RAMPAUBE recabam dwaga bam.”<verse eid="2CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 29:20" />Ge hegwangpei Hezekiah tingcang cuh zilu nah namdi ga muiteume de qu hekwalu, delwe pa RAMPAUBE ki ga hangdi. <verse eid="2CH 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 29:21" />Penui ketumseu hena, meurünseu hena, meurün hena, nah hemeuseu hena teugwanglu, hegwangram, kemci ni ziemne nah Judahme ziemne kemau reca teigai kerane. Pa cingkume, Aaron leuhme de aja kaigai, RAMPAUBE recabam gage cidungde ratak teigai kerane. <verse eid="2CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 29:22" />Cine penui ketumseudung de gilu, nah cingkume cidungde jai keulwe recabam gage kezingailu. Pecai penui meurünseudung de gilu delwe cidungde jai recabam gage kezingailu; nah penui meuründung de gilu delwe penui jai recabam gage kezingailu. <verse eid="2CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 29:23" />Penui hemeuseudung de hegwangpei nah ngkwa kebammedung dwa ga kemau reca tei kerane teugwanglu; ge penui cidungde reu gage penui ba kaigai. <verse eid="2CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 29:24" />Cingkume ne cidungde gilu, nah Israelme pelane mau keugi dilu kerane penui cipaudung de jai le pwa recabam gage kemau reca tei gailu, kedanemene hegwangpei Hezekiah ne keru reca nah kemau reca Israelme pelane ziemne tei kera aja kaigai.<verse eid="2CH 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 29:25" />Hegwangpei David aja kai kebeu nzwa eh, nah hegwangpei caihakecibe Gad, nah caihakecibe Nathan rang kebeu nzwa eh, Hezekiah Levime de peu RAMPAUBE ki ga bamlu, ntwaidung, leibungdung, nah lyredung pwa eh, kedanemene aja cide RAMPAUBE ne cairasam kecime de rangkebeu sam kecune. <verse eid="2CH 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 29:26" />Levime David leibungdung, nah cingkume telui pwalwe kerecaki sap twagwalu. <verse eid="2CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 29:27" />Hezekiah recabam gage keru reca teigai lo eh cidungde aja kaigai. Keru ratak tei cuh kecudau, RAMPAUBE de ketwalei de tei mdeulu, telui, nah Israel gwangpei David leibungdung de kwa si eh. <verse eid="2CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 29:28" />Maadibe reca cuhdi, leiketeime leitei, nah telui kekwame kwagai; nah aidung de pelane keru reca teicang kemaktane tei jüja bamdi.<verse eid="2CH 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 29:29" />Penui recadung cide cang kedi dau, hegwangpei nah cika kebam pelane pecu ngngwa keumie eh recadi. <verse eid="2CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 29:30" />Cipaureude, hegwangpei Hezekiah, nah muiteumedung Levime de David nah caihakecibe Asaph ne raupwa kebam lei de teu RAMPAUBE de ketwalei tei kera sam kaibeu. Penui suiyi eh ketwa leidung teigai, nah penui keumie eh recadi.<verse eid="2CH 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 29:31" />Pecai Hezekiah rangdi, “Cu nnui RAMPAUBE dage nnuide teimci gai luda. Ratakdung nah ketwa recadung RAMPAUBE ki ga pung gwanglu.” Hemaabe ratak tei nah hetwa peu kerane reca pwa gwanglu, nah lungnei kebamme keru recadung pung gwanglu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:12">Lev. 7:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 29:32" />Keru reca tei kera hemaabe pung gwang kelu pelane ge ketumseu riakhena, meurünseu haige, nah keda meurünseu haina. Aidungde pelane RAMPAUBE dage keru reca teigai kerane. <verse eid="2CH 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 29:33" />Kemci recadung cai ketumseu hai herok, nah meurün cangcum. <verse eid="2CH 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2CH 29:34" />Dede cingkume keru reca ziemne makaune geu gau kera cam sütdi, cine penui siname, Levime, penuide heta cang kemaktane nghabeu, nah cingkume penuikatei de teimcilu kemaktane, kedanemene Levime au penuikatei de teimci kecu cingkume swade mting sütla. <verse eid="2CH 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2CH 29:35" />Cipaureude, keru reca tei kera kekieege bam; cidungde macadung le kekangbau reca teilu, nah keru reca pelane ziemne zau reca bam. Cinzwa eh RAMPAUBE ki ga reca kecu pebang dwa dailu. <verse eid="2CH 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2CH 29:36" />Hegwangpei Hezekiah nah Judahme pelane de penui sui yilu, kedanemene Tinggwang mina ziemne maleune mtei gaibeu eh, hetadung tei mzet süt kelune.<verse eid="2CH 29:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="2CH 30" />
  <para style="s">Kahkegwang ngyi ziemne kerengei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 30:1" />Hezekiah Israel nah Judah pelane ga samgwame langgai, nah Ephraim nah Manasseh dage de Jerusalem ga RAMPAUBE ki ga gwang maisia lie laisiu raugai, RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang de twa eh kahkegwang ngyi hengyi kerane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kahkegwang de au </char></note> <verse eid="2CH 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 30:2" />Kedanemene hegwangpei, pe muiteumedung, nah Jerusalem ga hemaa pelane, keina bekei gage kahkegwangngyi de hengyi kera kesamdau kelune. <verse eid="2CH 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 30:3" />Penui tingdane hengyi kela tingdau hengyi luma, kedanemene cingkume kekieege hengyi de ziemne penuide teimcilu ma nah minadung Jerusalem ga ngkwalu kemakne. <verse eid="2CH 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 30:4" />Riem kelu aide hegwangpei nah hemaa pelane penui suilu. <verse eid="2CH 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 30:5" />Cine penui Israel pelane ga, Beersheba namdi gade Dan namdi kecang, Jerusalem gade RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang de twa eh kahkegwangngyi de hengyi kera ziemne minadung gwang maisia lie kecu sahgai kera samteilu. Kedanemene penui hengyi de hezai laisiukwak gage raupwa kela de nzwa mina kiee süt eh mneilu ta kedine. <verse eid="2CH 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 30:6" />Cine hegwangpei aja gade samgwamedung hegwangpei nah pe muiteumedung dade laisiudung teu eh Israel nah Judah pelane ga miedi. Penui rangdi, “Nnui Israelmedung, RAMPAUBE, Abraham, Isaac nah Israel Tinggwang da nreu cailigwang lulo, iciu lude pa nnui bangh kelumedung Assyria gwangdung ba gade pak kelume da cailigwang dailu zie. <verse eid="2CH 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 30:7" />Nnui paume mede nnui siname RAMPAUBE, penui paume Tinggwang sam gikah kedime nzwa diso, penuide au nnui kengau de nzwa kehing ge tei di. <verse eid="2CH 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 30:8" />Nnui paume nzwa nnui helungtak diso; meliene, nnui katei nnuide RAMPAUBE de peulu nah pe kemci ni ga, pa kelunghta teimci pwa kebam ga gwanglu, nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de recalu, iciulude pe rata de nnui dade mbailu zie. <verse eid="2CH 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 30:9" />Kedanemene nnui RAMPAUBE da cailigwang dai lucai, nnui caireiswacing nah nnui namedung nnuide lang pwa hebaangme ge tei kedime dwa gade ngaugia ngau luzie, nah penui aipau deu ga cailigwang dai luzie. Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang au pezai yi nah ngaunggia la, nah nnui pe da cailigwanglu cai, pa nnui dade nreu tet dilak.”<verse eid="2CH 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 30:10" />Cine samgwame namdi ket cai ket eh Ephraim nah Manasseh cuikui ga, nah Zebulun deu ga kecang kahgwang, dede Ephraim, Manasseh, nah keda tingpeule leuhme Hezekiah samgwame de nuidi. <verse eid="2CH 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 30:11" />Iciuliede, Asher leuhme, naimiak kenlütle Manasseh nah Zebulun leuhme kangge penuide tei henalu eh Jerusalem ga gwanglu. <verse eid="2CH 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 30:12" />Tinggwang Judah gade heta tei gai, peu penuide lung ge tei eh hegwangpei Hezekiah nah muiteume aja de RAMPAUBE sam gade teilu kerane.<verse eid="2CH 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 30:13" />Mina kekieege, hemaa maadi, Cehikaikemak Tangku Ngyi hengyi kerane keina bekei Jerusalem ga ngkwalu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tsehikaikemak tangku ngyi de lang hena ne hengyi la cide cipau kei ziangreiemengei gade zie ngkai-kena kecang hengyi la, 2 Hel. 8:13</char></note> <verse eid="2CH 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 30:14" />Penui cuhlu delwe Jerusalem ga recabamdung kebam de nah perim kehengui keru recabamdung pelane keu gidi; penui cidungde Kidron reuceuna gage kelien gaidi. <verse eid="2CH 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 30:15" />Pecai penui keina bekei ziangreiehmdai benai Kahkegwang ngyi meuründung teitsetlu. Cingkume nah Levime ngngamdi, cine penui penuide teimcilu delwe keru recadung RAMPAUBE kiga pwa gwanglu. <verse eid="2CH 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 30:16" />Penui, Tinggwang minabe Moses zaidung de mzai eh, penui mzi ga penui sap ga saplu. Cingkume Levime ba gade penui ngaukelu hejai de kezingai. <verse eid="2CH 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 30:17" />Kedanemene hemaa ga mina kekieege penuikatei de teimcilu kemakme kebamne. Ciziemne Levime mci kemakme leune nah penui ratakdung RAMPAUBE dage teimci gailu kemakme ziemne Kahkegwang meuründung gilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:55">Jhn. 11:55</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2CH 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 30:18" />Kedanemene mina kekieege, Ephraim, Manasseh, Issachar nah Zebulun leuh gade kekieege, penuide teimci mene bam, dede penui raupwa kebam zai de gikah di eh Kahkegwang taktyei tyeilu. Kedanemene Hezekiah penui ziemne kiebeu eh ranggai, “Peu pezai keyi RAMPAUBE de nnui pelane mau gibeu lo, <verse eid="2CH 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 30:19" />RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, penui paume Tinggwang de helung kai eh peei kelame de, renet zai gade penuide teimcilu meliede.” <verse eid="2CH 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 30:20" />Cine RAMPAUBE Hezekiah sam kingneilu nah minadung de teingkei beu. <verse eid="2CH 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 30:21" />Israelme Jerusalem ga kebammedung Cehikaikemak Tangku Ngyi de penui sui yisüt eh lang henane hengyilu. Levime nah cingkumedung, langnai ge cai langnai ge RAMPAUBE de twa eh leibungdung kwa nah RAMPAUBE dage lei teigai. <verse eid="2CH 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 30:22" />Hezekiah Levime pelane RAMPAUBE de kereca lamlui kecime dage sam rang kecungsüt gai. Cine penui hengyi kecu ting lang henane kecang matyei, kekangbau reca ratakdung teigai, nah RAMPAUBE, penui paume Tinggwang dage penui mau petgai.<verse eid="2CH 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 30:23" />Hemaabe pelane cidau lang henane hengyi sidai kera kesamteilu, nah penui penui sui yisüt eh hengyilu. <verse eid="2CH 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 30:24" />Kedanemene Judah gwangpei Hezekiah ketumseu cang ge nah meurün cang hena hemaabe de pwapeu; nah muiteumedung hemaabe de ketumseu cang ge nah meurün, nah hemeu cangkerei kaibeu. Cingkume kekieege penuide teimcilu. <verse eid="2CH 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 30:25" />Judahme ngkwa kelu pelane, cingkume nah Levime, nah Israel gade gwang kelume pelane, Israelme deu gade sangme gwang kecume nah Judah ga kelunghme de si eh, pelane penui sui yisüt lu. <verse eid="2CH 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 30:26" />Cine Jerusalem ga suiyi le puidi, kedanemene, Israel gwangpei David napei Solomon tingdau gwale Jerusalem ga cikenzwa tei mede kecune. <verse eid="2CH 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 30:27" />Pecai cingkume, nah Levime, cuhlu eh minadung de samlam beu. Penui rang kegai kwa siulu, nah Tinggwang pe kemci ni gade penui kekie luulu.<verse eid="2CH 30:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="2CH 31" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 31:1" />Cu Kahkegwang ngyi pelane cangdi ge, Israel mina cika kebamme pelane Judah namdidung leune kebam ga miedi nah tsusumdung teipang kecaidi nah penui Asherah rabepui tsusum de teipangdi, nah penui Judah nah Benjamin, nah Ephraim nah Manasseh pelane ga nlumkemakme reca nidung nah recabamdung de teipang di, penui cidungde pelane teimsia cangdi kemaktane. Pecai Isrealmedung pelane pe nam nah pe ki riep cailigwangdi.<verse eid="2CH 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kereca ziemne hema kekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 31:2" />Hegwangpei Hezekiah cingkume nah Levime mzidung penuide mzi pwa kebam ria gade heta ketsamtsam nlumbeu, Levime nah cingkume de pe ta riep nlumbeu. Pa penuide keru recadung nah kekangbau recadung, hegwa tei kera, ketwa peu kera, nah RAMPAUBE kerecaki kirie gade hetwa peu kerane mzibeu. <verse eid="2CH 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 31:3" />Hegwangpei pe mabam gade keru ratak ziemne kaigai beula, cide cai, tingcang nah tinghegi keru recadung ziemne, nah Sabbath tingbadung ga keru reca ziemne, keici ngyi, nah hengyi kela ngyidung, RAMPAUBE zai gage rauteu kelade tei kerane. <verse eid="2CH 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 31:4" />Cipaureude, pa Jerusalem ga kelunghmedung de cingkume nah Levime qwa pwapeu kera aja kaibeu, iciu eh penui RAMPAUBE zai de mzai kecu ga laikai teilu kerane. <verse eid="2CH 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 31:5" />Aja cide kaibeu herizi, Israel ga minadung mei raitube, zau keheci, maca, heliadui, nah penui luh gade ngau kelu leune gade teugwang beu. Penui kereizige hema leune gade teugwang beu, cide au kekiee ge. <verse eid="2CH 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 31:6" />Judah namdidung ga kelungh Israelme nah Judahme de kauhau nah meurün kereizige, nah kemci niadung ziemne kereizige penui RAMPAUBE Tinggwang dage kai ntsam kebeu teugwang beu, nah penui cidungde kekiee ge hekwalu. <verse eid="2CH 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 31:7" />Penui kei pekecum bekei gade penui makai de hekwa mdeu lu, nah penui kei pehena bekei ga hekwa canglu. <verse eid="2CH 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 31:8" />Hezekiah nah muiteume gwang eh makai kieesüt kebam de ngaulu ge, penui RAMPAUBE nah pe mina Israel de samlam beu. <verse eid="2CH 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 31:9" />Pecai, Hezekiah cingkume nah Levime de mapeu ha keteugai. <verse eid="2CH 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 31:10" />Azariah, cingku kedibe, Zadok leuhbe, pecu keli eh ranggai, “Minadung RAMPAUBE kiga mapeudung teugwang mdeu kedi gade, anui tyeiset lu nah kekieege banghlu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE pe mina dungde samlam kebeune. Aika kebam kekiee aide bangh kelubedung da.”<verse eid="2CH 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 31:11" />Pecai Hezekiah RAMPAUBE ki gage kehekwa kibung tei kera aja kaigai, nah penui cidungde rengeilu. <verse eid="2CH 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 31:12" />Pecai penui samsang süt eh mapeudung, kereizige pelane nah RAMPAUBE dage tei mcigai kedidung pwa nlütlu. Levime pei Konaniah de cidungde peu kerengeibe teilu, nah pe sinabe Shimei de peu pe kenghabe teilu. <verse eid="2CH 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 31:13" />Jehiel, Azaziah, Nahath, Asahel, Jerimoth, Jozabad, Eliel, Ismakiah, Mahath, nah Benaiah penui Konaniah nah pe sinabe Shimei kangga kenghamedung, Hegwangpei Hezekiah penai Tinggwang kiga kedibe Azariah ne kedet kelumedung. <verse eid="2CH 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 31:14" />Levime pei Imnah napei Kore, kerecaki kepetle rieki ga kekwabe, Tinggwang da kekai suiyi makaidung rengeila, nah RAMPAUBE de reca kebeu mapeudung nah mci tube recadung rengeila. <verse eid="2CH 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 31:15" />Cingkume namdidung ga, pe kangga kebamme cai, Eden, Miniamin, Jeshua, Shemaiah, Amariah, nah Shecaniah. Penui samsang eh taktyei aidungde penui sinamedung de penui mzidung rehi gade kedi keceu de mzi nsam beula. <verse eid="2CH 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 31:16" />Penui mipeina mmi kecum nah pe nreume, penui paume hezi kerau laisiukwak ga hezi kebamme penui ta nah penui mzidung rehi gade hera tingba heta tei kera RAMPAUBE ki ga kelütme de, penui qwa peucio la. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fqa">mipeina mmi kecum nah pe nreume </char> de mene keheci laisiudung kesa ga<char style="fqa">mipeina mmi camrei nah penreume </char> de eh bam </note> <verse eid="2CH 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 31:17" />Penui cingkume de penui pautsa rehi gade, nah Levime mmi ngkai nah pe nreume de penui tadung nah penui mzidung rehi gade penui qwa ramsiak beula. <verse eid="2CH 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 31:18" />Penui penui namedung pelane, penui naudung, penui napeidung, nah penui napuidung de hemaa pelane ga silu, kedanemene penui kemci ga penui samsang kecune. <verse eid="2CH 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 31:19" />Cingkume, Aaron leuhmedung, penui namdidung gu renam luhdung ga lungh kebamme, mede namdi kehei leune ga lungh kebamme ziemne cai, cingkume kakga, midung ge hepüt pung eh, cingkume kelakdung ga mipei pelane nah Levi pautsadung ga pezi kebamme leune de penui qwa mzi beula.<verse eid="2CH 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 31:20" />Judah pelane ga hegwangpei Hezekiah aidungde tei gwanglu. Pa RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang dwa gade keyibe, petaube nah kesamsangbe teicanglu. <verse eid="2CH 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 31:21" />Pa Tinggwang ki ziemne heta ketei leune ga, hezai nah ajadung kemzai ga, pa Tinggwang de peeilu nah pa pe mlung pelane teu eh teilu, nah pa ngkienglu.<verse eid="2CH 31:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="2CH 32" />
  <para style="s">Sennacherib Jerusalem de keheu kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 32:1" />Hezekiah kesamsang nah Kahkegwang ngyi aidungde cang kedi cai, Assyria hegwangpei Sennacherib, Judah ga gwang eh nlütlu. Pa riekelu namdidung de gwa lüt kerane ramzeuki teilu, pa cidungde tuihlu eh pegu tei kerane cet teula. <verse eid="2CH 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 32:2" />Hezekiah Sennacherib gwang bam kecu ngaulu nah pa Jerusalem de regi kera cet teu kela cilu ge, <verse eid="2CH 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 32:3" />pa pe muiteumedung nah pe kengkieng minadung de ngngwa duirwak Jerusalem namdi gwale kebam de kaamdi kera kempau; penui cinzwa tei kera pecu ngha beu. <verse eid="2CH 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 32:4" />Cine mina kekiee ge gwang mbau eh duirwak pelane nah reuceuna namdi sum gade lwa kebamde de kaamdi. Penui rangdi, “Daitei eh Assyria gwangme de peu gwang eh dui kekiee ge ngaulu lai no?” <verse eid="2CH 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 32:5" />Hezekiah kuu eh namdi kirie pelane pang mie kedidung de teicuh dailu. Pa reneidung de kwahu silu, nah herie keda hegwale tei si lu. Pa David namdi ga Millo de de teintip si lu nah pa hereuniadung nah hegeudung kekiee ge teilu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fqa">pa reneidung de kwa hu silu </char> de mene, kehegwa nah keheci laisiudung kesa ga <char style="fqa">pa cipau reu gage reneidung teilu, cide cai kirie </char> de eh bam. </note> <verse eid="2CH 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 32:6" />Pa minadung de reugwa muiteume kangga ge kailu. Namdi rieki heni mza kebam ga pa penuide pe da ngngwa hekwalu delwe penuide kecung süt eh maranggai. Pa penui dage rangdi, <verse eid="2CH 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 32:7" />“Ntiplu nah kuu lu. Assyria gwangpei nah pe da kebam reugwame pelane ziemne ngngi mede nnui lung ceu diso, kedanemene anui da kebambe au peda kebammedung swade ngkiengki lu. <verse eid="2CH 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 32:8" />Pe da au pumteih kengkieng rünne bam, dede anui da au RAMPAUBE, anui Tinggwang, anui de ngha kera, nah anui ziemne hereu regibeu kera bam.” Ciu eh minadung Judahme gwangpei Hezekiah samdung dene penuide tei ngkuu lu.<verse eid="2CH 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 32:9" />Aipau cai, Sennacherib, Assyria gwangpei, pe kilamedung de Jerusalem ga (cu au pa Lachish namceu dwa ga bam, nah pe reugwame pelane pecu ngngwa bam), Judah gwangpei Hezekiah da, nah Jerusalem ga Judahme kelungh leune da langgai. Pa rangdi, <verse eid="2CH 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 32:10" />“Aide Assyriame gwangpei Sennacherib ranggai: Jerusalem de tuih kera twagwa kebam de lialu kerane nnui dai de ngngei pwa bam no? <verse eid="2CH 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 32:11" />Hezekiah, ‘RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang anuide Assyria gwangpei ba gade kelibeu zie’ de eh kerang dau, pa nnuide cwa bam dide meni iciu eh peu nnuide mzeu nah hereu eh tsaidi kerane? <verse eid="2CH 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 32:12" />Hezekiah aipaude ne pe reca nidung nah pe recabamdung keu gidi delwe Judah nah Jerusalem ga minadung de, ‘Recabam ket gade nnui reca maisia nah cikade nnui nnui ratakdung ru maisia’ de eh aja kaigai meni? <verse eid="2CH 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 32:13" />Nnui Ih nah a paume heleuh kedadung pelane dage daipai teigai bi ci meni? Twagwa kebam heleuh keda rabedung penui deu de a kengkieng gade kelilu di ni? <verse eid="2CH 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 32:14" />A paume ne ngkap ciau kedi heleuh cidungde rabedung kak gade, hera gede pe minadung de a ba gade kelilu kera bam ni? Daitei eh nnui Tinggwang a kengkieng gade nnuide keli lulai no? <verse eid="2CH 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 32:15" />Cu peu Hezekiah de nnuide cwa mede ainzwa eh sau mau diso. Pecu nlum so, kedanemene heleuh rabe gede mede hegwangram gede a ba gade pe minadung de kelilu ma, mede a paume ba gade. Nnui Tinggwang nnuide a ba gade keli lubui lie lani?” <verse eid="2CH 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 32:16" />Sennacherib kedime RAMPAUBE Tinggwang nah pe kilabe Hezekiah de rang msia ki di. <verse eid="2CH 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 32:17" />Hegwangpei Sennacherib RAMPAUBE, Israelme Tinggwang de teu henui tei kerane, nah pecu mlai kecu sam rang kerane laisiudung de rau si gai. Pa rangdi, “Heleuh keda rabedung pe minadung de a ba gade keli pwa peu kemak nzwa, cide nzwa Hezekiah Tinggwang de pe minadung de a ba gade keli gailak.” <verse eid="2CH 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 32:18" />Penui aide Jewme let gade kirie reu ga kebam Jerusalem ga minadung dage sahbak gai, penuide tei ngngi nah tei keherei gai kerane, iciu eh penui namdi de tuihlu kerane. <verse eid="2CH 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 32:19" />Penui Jerusalem Tinggwang ha de mi kedame kideu ga kelunghme gu mina ba le tei kelube rabedung ha nzwa eh rangdi.<verse eid="2CH 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 32:20" />Hegwangpei Hezekiah, nah Amoz napei caihakecibe Isaiah, aide ziemne kekie tei nah pa tinggim gage sahbak gai. <verse eid="2CH 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 32:21" />RAMPAUBE tinggimgwame gede langgai eh reugwamedung, reugwamaa muibedung, nah paiki ga Assyrian hegwangpei gu kedimedung de teitsetdi. Cine Sennacherib ngngam eh pe deu ga cailigwangdi. Pa pe rabe kerecaki ga lüt kelu dau, pekatei pe name kangge ne kingtie le pecu cikade teitsetdi. <verse eid="2CH 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 32:22" />Ainzwa eh, RAMPAUBE Hezekiah nah Jerusalem ga kelunghmedung de Assyria gwangpei, Sennacherib ba gade, nah mi kedamedung pelane ba gade kelibeu, nah namdadung pelane de ngngwa yi eh penuide peu lungh ziune eh lunghdi. <verse eid="2CH 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 32:23" />Mina kekiee ge Jerusalem ga RAMPAUBE da makai teugwang bam, nah Judahme gwangpei Hezekiah de pemi kehung mapeudung teugwang beu, ciciu eh cipau ciale de heleuh pelane miakngau gade pa herüt pung sütti.<verse eid="2CH 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekiah kehegie, ngkiengkelu nah ketsai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 32:24" />Cipau tingdau Hezekiah nra süt eh tsai kera nzwa di. Pa RAMPAUBE da kekie teigai, nah RAMPAUBE pecu mpau eh pa yilu kera marehi ge pwa lia. <verse eid="2CH 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 32:25" />Dede Hezekiah RAMPAUBE pecu ngha kebeu de ziemne hetwa pwa peu lu tadi, kedanemene pa ngang kedine. Cine pe da, nah Judah nah Jerusalem da rata gwangdi. <verse eid="2CH 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 32:26" />Ciuliede, kekamle Hezekiah ngang kela gade pecu tei henalu, pa nah Jerusalem ga kelunghmedung de, ciciu eh Hezekiah tingdau, RAMPAUBE rata penui da gwang cang ma.<verse eid="2CH 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 32:27" />Hezekiah mahei süt nah herüt pung süt. Pa pe rangkanggeu, kecak, tangtsu pemi kehung, nah mosala, nah hegeudung ziemne de nah pemi kehungdung ketsamtsam ziemne maniakibung tei lu. <verse eid="2CH 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 32:28" />Pa pe ciu, zau keheci, nah maca luhlüt ziemne mabam kidung, nah makaune leune ziemne taktyei kidung bam. Pe meurün haudung de penui kidung ga bam. <verse eid="2CH 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 32:29" />Aidungde reude, pa pe ziemne namdidung de teilu nah meuründung nah kauhau kekiee gede ngaulu, kedanemene Tinggwang pecu mabam mahei kekieege pwa kepeune. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fqa">namdidung </char> de mene <char style="fqa">gada</char>, de eh keheci laisiudung kesa ga bam, nah keheci laisiudung kesa ga cipau sam de bam la ma. </note> <verse eid="2CH 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 32:30" />Hezekiah aipaude ne Gihon duirwak nreube de kaamdi, delwe pa cide David namdi naimiak kenlütle ge teu nzui hung gailu. Hezekiah pe bata leune tei zeu di mene teilu. <verse eid="2CH 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 32:31" />Ciuliede, Babylon gade hegwangram deudiding keteime hangdeu cika miswakegah bata tei kedi de pecu keteu zie lie pe dage lang kegai dau, Tinggwang pecu pütti, pecu kedakpie kerane, nah pe mlung ga kebam pelane cilu kerane.<verse eid="2CH 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 32:32" />Hezekiah tei kegai kedabedung, pa RAMPAUBE da samting samkakkelu bata tei kegai leune de, Amoz napei caihakecibe Isaiah marengei kengau ga nah Judah nah Israel gwangpeidung ha kwak gage raupwa la. <verse eid="2CH 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 32:33" />Hezekiah pe paumedung de nzwa tsaidi, nah penui pecu David leuhme raudung kideutu gage kungdi. Judah nah Jerusalem ga kelunghmedung pelane pe tsit dau pecu herüt peugai. Pe napei Manasseh ne pebam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2CH 32:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="2CH 33" />
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Manasseh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 33:1" />Manasseh pa hegwangpei tei kelu dau mmi kereiehkena di; pa Jerusalem ga mmi riakngeiehmengei hegwang tei. <verse eid="2CH 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 33:2" />RAMPAUBE miakngau gade pa kemau teidi, RAMPAUBE pe mina Israelmedung dwa gade penuide gwa kelüt dau hangdeube gade gwa mpet kedi leuhdung kemneeu tadung ketei nzwa. <verse eid="2CH 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 33:3" />Kedanemene pa pe pei Hezekiah ne tei msia kedi nidung de retak dailu, nah Baal de reca kera ziemne recabamdung teilu, pa Asherah miedung de teilu, nah pa tinggim ga kebam gidung leune da keumie eh reca di. <verse eid="2CH 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 33:4" />Manasseh RAMPAUBE ki gage nlum kemakme recabamdung teilu, RAMPAUBE, “Jerusalem ga a zi kelunghta bam zie,” de eh aja kaibeu liede. <verse eid="2CH 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 33:5" />Pa RAMPAUBE ki kigu kena gage tinggim ga kebam hegidung pelane ziemne recabamdung tei gai beu. <verse eid="2CH 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 33:6" />Ben Hinnom langkam gade pa pe namedung de teu ratak tei eh keru reca tei gai. Pa reka tadung teila nah pa hebariet piela, nah pa ketsaime de mpau kelame nah herabe de mpau kelame dade ma keteu. Manasseh RAMPAUBE miakngau gade kemau tei sütdi, nah pa pe rata teidi. <verse eid="2CH 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 33:7" />Pa mamie tei kelu de pa Tinggwang ki gage kailu. Tinggwang David nah pe napei Solomon de aipau ki ha de rang kebeu; pa ainzwa eh ranggai, “Aipau ki gade nah Jerusalem gade, Ih a zi kelunghta peu bam kera, Ih Israel leuhdung pelane gade kedet luda. <verse eid="2CH 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 33:8" />Ih Moses dade penuide kai kebeu hezai pelane mzui eh, Ih penui de aja kai kebeu pelane mzui siakte lucai, Ih penui paume de kepeu deu gade Ih Israelme de gwa mpet dai silakta.” <verse eid="2CH 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 33:9" />Manasseh Judah nah Jerusalem ga kelungh minadung de ngngwa ndaa RAMPAUBE ne Israel minadung dwa gade gwalüt eh gwagi kedi leuhdung kemau ketei swade kemau diki kecudung teidi.<verse eid="2CH 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 33:10" />RAMPAUBE Manasseh nah pe minadung de mrai ranggai, dede penui pe samde kingnei meidi. <verse eid="2CH 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 33:11" />Cine RAMPAUBE Assyria hegwangpei reugwamaa muibedung de peu penuide gwalüt, penui Manasseh de tuihlu, pecu hegeuria le kangdi delwe pecu Babylon ga ngngwa miedi. <verse eid="2CH 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 33:12" />Manasseh pe lungrei le pui kedi dau, pa RAMPAUBE, pe Tinggwang dade kengha kiegai, nah pe paume Tinggwang dwade pa henah sütlu. <verse eid="2CH 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 33:13" />Pa pe dage kekie teigai, nah Tinggwang pe kekie luulu, nah Tinggwang pe kekie kingnei lu, nah pecu peu Jerusalem ga cailigwang hegwang tei dailu. Cidau Manasseh RAMPAUBE au Tinggwang lie kecu ci mci lu.<verse eid="2CH 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 33:14" />Aipau cai, Manasseh David namdi gwale kirie ge tei silu, Gihon naimiak kenlütle ga, langkam gade, Heka Rieki ga kecang. Pa Ophel deutu de tei twagwalu nah kirie de tei cehu sütlu. Pa Judah ga tsukwa kwa kelu namdidung leune ga reugwa kekuu muiteubedung de kailu. <verse eid="2CH 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 33:15" />Pa sangme rabedung keu gidi, RAMPAUBE ki gade mamie keu mpetdi, nah RAMPAUBE ki teipwa kebam deutu ga nah Jerusalem ga nlum kemakme recabamdung pa tei pwa kebam leune de, cidungde namdi gwale ge kelien gidi. <verse eid="2CH 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 33:16" />Pa RAMPAUBE de kerecabam de tei dailu nah cikage kekangbau recadung nah ketwa reca ratakdung tei gaibeu; pa Judah de RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang de reca lulo aja kaigai. <verse eid="2CH 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 33:17" />Ciuliede, minadung kereca nidung gage ratak teigai la, dede penui cidungde RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang de rünne teigai beula.<verse eid="2CH 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 33:18" />Manasseh tei kegai leune, pa pe Tinggwang dage kekie tei kegai, nah caihakecime RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang zi teu eh pe dage kerang samdung leune, ainie, cidungde Israel gwangpeidung batadung gage raupwa la. <verse eid="2CH 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 33:19" />Cipau laisiukwak ga pe kekie ha, nah Tinggwang dainzwa pe lung nreulu dibi de kecude la. Pa pecu tei henahlu kemak dwa, pe mau pelane, nah pa hezai gikah kedidung nah pa nlum kemak reca nidung tei kegai bamdung nah herabe pui Asherah miedung tei ncuh kegai nidung nah reca kecu miedung teikegai hadung de bam, cidungde Caihakecime Laisiukwak gage raupwala. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa keheci laisiukwakdung ga </char><char style="fqa">Hozai Laisiukwak</char> de eh bam la, cide ndaa raupwa kebam laisiu ga kebam de. Dede cudau laisiukwak kekiee ge ga <char style="fqa">Caihakecime Laisiukwak</char> de eh peila. Cipau reude, cidau laisiukwak kie kemak ge ga cai<char style="fqa">pe caihakecime Laisiukwak</char> de eh bamla. </note> <verse eid="2CH 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 33:20" />Cine Manasseh pe paume de ngngwa tsaidi, nah penui pecu pe ki gage kungdi, nah pe napei Amon, pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2CH 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 33:21" />Amon pa hegwang tei kelu dau mmi ngkaiehkena di, nah pa Jerusalem ga mmi kena hegwang tei. <verse eid="2CH 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 33:22" />Pa pe pei Manasseh nzwa eh RAMPAUBE miakngau gade kemau teidi. Amon pe pei Manasseh tei kelu mamie leune de ratak tei pwa peu nah pa cidungde de reca di. <verse eid="2CH 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 33:23" />Pe pei Manasseh tei kegai nzwa, pa RAMPAUBE dwa gade henah lu tadi. Meliene, Amon aipaude kemau tei si reureu di. <verse eid="2CH 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 33:24" />Pe kangga kilame kebam heciem tei eh pecu pe ki gade teitset di. <verse eid="2CH 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 33:25" />Dede cika kelungh minadung hegwangpei Amon de tei ketsetme pelane de teitsetdi, nah penui pe napei Josiah de peu pebam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2CH 33:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="2CH 34" />
  <para style="s">Judah ga Josiah zaidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 34:1" />Josiah mmi heset dige pa hegwang teilu; pa Jerusalem ga mmi camreiehket hegwang tei. <verse eid="2CH 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 34:2" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade petaube teilu, nah pe pau David puisau de mzuilu, nah zetle mede hile ge nreugai dima. <verse eid="2CH 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 34:3" />Pa hegwang teikelu mmi pe heset bekum, pa hena bamreu kecudau, pa pe pau David Tinggwang de peei cuhdi. Mmi kereiehkena bekum, pa Judah nah Jerusalem ga nlum kemakme reca nidung, Asherah miedung, nah mamie keda nah hegeu le teikelu miedung pelane teimsia cuhdi. <verse eid="2CH 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 34:4" />Pe minadung pe dwa gade Baal recabamdung tei ngkau di; pa marim kehengui recabam penui peu reu ga kebam de de dang tütdi. Pa Asherah miedung de tei kecaira dedi nah mamie kedadung pelane de nah hegeule tei kelu miedung, cidungde rebui mmi di kemaktane tei kecaira di. Pa cipau rebui de pwa cidungde de ratak tei beu kelame raudung gage kaidi. <verse eid="2CH 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 34:5" />Pa nlum kemakme cingkume radung pwa penui recabamdung gage rugai. Ainzwa eh, pa Judah penai Jerusalem de tei mcilu. <verse eid="2CH 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 34:6" />Pa aide nzwa eh Manasseh, Ephraim, nah Simeon namdidung, nah Naphtali deudung kecang, nah cidungde twagwa kebam sia kedi namdung gade tei gai. <verse eid="2CH 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 34:7" />Pa recabamdung tei ngkau di, nah Asherah miedung tei kecaidi nah mamie dungde rebui teidi, nah Israel deu pelane ga kehengui recabamdung pelane tei pang kecaidi. Pecai pa Jerusalem ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="2CH 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 34:8" />Pa hegwang tei kelu mmi kereieheset bekum, Josiah hangdeu nah Kerecaki tei mci kelucai, pa Azaliah napei Shaphan, namdi deuceudibe Maaseiah, nah Joahaz napei Joah Keraube, de RAMPAUBE ki retak kerane langgai. <verse eid="2CH 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 34:9" />Penui cingku kedibe Hilkiah da mie, nah Tinggwang kerecaki gade rangkang hekwa kelu pwa pe dage balie gaibeu, cide Levime kikam kekwamedung, Manasseh penai Ephraim dade, bangh pwa kebam Israel leuh pelane dade, Judah nah Benjamin pelane dade, nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme dade hekwa kelu. <verse eid="2CH 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 34:10" />Penui rangkang de pwa RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga hetah ketei kerengeime ba gage nlum beudi. Mina aidungde ne kerecaki retak nah keteime de penui ziehi tei pwa peu. <verse eid="2CH 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 34:11" />Penui tsing ta keteime nah mata keteime de peu tangtsudung nah kentok pak ziemne tsingdung luilu kerane, nah Judah gwangpei kangge ne tei msia kedi ki hesumdung de peu retaklu kerane penuide peudi. <verse eid="2CH 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 34:12" />Minadung masang süt eh mata teilu. Penuide pie kerengeime cai Levime, Merari pautsa gade Jahath penai Obadiah, nah Kohath pautsa gade Zechariah penai Meshullam. Levime kedame, penui lei tei kecime ciau, nah mtingsüt eh mata keteime de pierengei la. <verse eid="2CH 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 34:13" />Levime aidungde au kerecaki ketei niadung pung kenggwame nah heta ketsamtsam keteime pelane de pie kerengeime. Levime makeraumedung, kedime, nah kirie kekwamedung de bam.<verse eid="2CH 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezai laisiukwak ngaukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 34:14" />RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga pung gwang kelu mabam gade penui rangkang keu mpet kebam dau, cingkupei Hilkiah RAMPAUBE zai laisiukwak Moses dage kaikebeu de ngaulu. <verse eid="2CH 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 34:15" />Hilkiah Shaphan keraube dage rangdi, “Ih RAMPAUBE kerecaki gade Hezai laisiukwak de ngau luda.” Hilkiah Shaphan de laisiukwak cide keugwang beu. <verse eid="2CH 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 34:16" />Shaphan hegwangpei da laisiukwak de keugwang beudi, nah peda sam pau eh ranggai, “N kilamedung penuide nlum gai kebeu pelane tei luda. <verse eid="2CH 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 34:17" />Penui RAMPAUBE kerecaki gage rangkang kaipwa kebam de keu luda, nah cide pwa penui de kerengeime ba gage nah heta keteime de peu dida.” <verse eid="2CH 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 34:18" />Shaphan keraube hegwangpei de ranglia gai, “Cingkupei Hilkiah ne laisiukwak ge acu pwa peu.” Delwe Shaphan cide hegwangpei dage pei lia. <verse eid="2CH 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 34:19" />Cidau hegwangpei hezai laisiukwak de pei kegai samdung siu kelu dau, pa pe painidung hietti. <verse eid="2CH 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 34:20" />Hegwangpei aja aide Hilkiah, Shaphan napei Ahikam, Micah napei Abdon, hezai keraube Shaphan, nah pe kilabe, Asaiah de peu eh ranggai, <verse eid="2CH 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 34:21" />“Mie delwe RAMPAUBE dade a ziemne nah Israel nah Judah ga lungh kelame ziemne pe lungning be keteu lo, keledeu sam laisiukwak de ngau kelu de ziemne. Kedanemene RAMPAUBE rata anui reu ga gwang kedi de au dizu kedine. Pe rata dizu lie, kedanemene anui paume aipau laisiukwak samdung de mzai luma, nah cide ga rau pwa kebam leune tei mzai luta kedine.”<verse eid="2CH 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 34:22" />Cine Hilkiah, nah kedame hegwangpei aja gade caihakecipui ge pezi Huldah dade ma keteu kera miedi, Shallum nau da, Tokhath napei nah Hasrah tsapei kerecaki painidung kerengeibe (pa au Jerusalem, Deuceu Kenabe ga lungh), nah penui peda aiciu eh rangdi. <verse eid="2CH 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 34:23" />Pa penui da rangdi, “Aide RAMPAUBE Israelme Tinggwang ne ranggai: Nnuide a dage lang kegai be da gwang rang beulo, <verse eid="2CH 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 34:24" />‘Ainzwa RAMPAUBE ranggai: Pielo, laisiukwak ga resetdung raupwa kebam pelane Judah gwangpei dwa gade penui pei kegai de, Ih aipau ni ga nah cika kelunghmedung da kengkap peu lai eh bam dida. <verse eid="2CH 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 34:25" />Cine aipaudung de teicang zie kedanemene penui acu gidi nah penui marim kehengui ru pwa hera kedadung de peu kedine, nah penui ba le tei kegai pelane ziemne a rata tei dida, ciziemne, a rata aipau ni ga rui gai zie nah cide tei mmütti gailak.’ <verse eid="2CH 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 34:26" />Dede Judah gwangpei, RAMPAUBE dade daipai pa tei maisia bi keteu kerane nnui de lang kegaibe da, nnui pe dage ainzwa rang zie, “RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang aide ranggaila: Nang kingnei kelu sam de, <verse eid="2CH 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 34:27" />kedanemene nang n mlung nciep, nah Tinggwang dwa gade nkatei ncu tei henahlu nang aipau ni de ga nah aika kelunghme da pe rata gwang di lai kecu samdung siu kelu dau, nah kedanemene nang a dwa de henah kelune nah n paidung hiet nah a dwa de hap kecune, Ih n kwa kingnei luda, aide RAMPAUBE ne rang ndugai, <verse eid="2CH 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CH 34:28" />pielo, Ih ncu n paume da ngngwa teu gwang beuzie. Ncu peu n lung nciep eh n rau gage pwa gai zie, nah aipau ni dega nah aika kelunghme de Ih kengkap peu lai eh kebam de nang ngau cang lak.’” Minadung sam aide teu eh hegwangpei da cailigwang di.<verse eid="2CH 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CH 34:29" />Pecai hegwangpei pe samgwamedung de langgai eh Judah nah Jerusalem ga hangkiamedung pelane de qu hekwalu. <verse eid="2CH 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CH 34:30" />Delwe hegwangpei RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga nghang, nah Judah minadung nah Jerusalem ga kelunghmedung pelane de, nah cingkume, Levime nah mina pelane, kedi gade keceu pelane de. Pecai pa penui pelane dwa gade samkakkelu laisiukwak samdung pelane RAMPAUBE kerecaki gade ngau kelu de peigai. <verse eid="2CH 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CH 34:31" />Hegwangpei pebam ga saplu delwe RAMPAUBE dwa gade samkaklu, RAMPAUBE lampui mzui eh tet gwang kera, nah pe ajadung mzai kera, nah pa teilo kebeube nah pe zaidung de, pe mlung pelane nah pe keringria pelane teu samkak kelu samdung, aipau laisiukwak ga raupwa kela de mzai kerane. <verse eid="2CH 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CH 34:32" />Pa Jerusalem ga nah Benjamin ga kebamme leune de peu samkakkelu de mneilu kera sampetlu. Jerusalem ga kelunghmedung, Tinggwang, penui paume Tinggwang de penui ngngwa samkakkelu zaidung de mzailu. <verse eid="2CH 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CH 34:33" />Josiah ma kemneeudung pelane Israelme minadung gu hangdeudung gade keu gidi. Pa Israel ga kelungh leune de RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang de reca kera rangbeu. Kedanemene pa lungh kebamtane, penui RAMPAUBE dade tet ndei dima, penui paume Tinggwang dade.<verse eid="2CH 34:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="2CH 35" />
  <para style="s">Josiah Kahkegwang ngyi mnei kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 35:1" />Josiah Jerusalem gade RAMPAUBE de kerüt gade Kahkegwangngyi hengyilu, nah penui hekei raitube kei ziangreiehmdai benai Kahkegwangngyi meurünnadung gilu. <verse eid="2CH 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 35:2" />Pa cingkume de penui ta tei keradung ramsiak beu nah RAMPAUBE ki ga heta tei hemi lulo penuide kecunggai. <verse eid="2CH 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 35:3" />Pa Levime Israel pelane de keledeume nah RAMPAUBE ziemne kedet ntsam kelu medung dage rangdi, “Israel gwangpei, David napei Solomon ne tei kelu ki gage samkakbung kemci de kailu. Nnui hekeutu gage cide pung rwa sila tadi. RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de recalu, nah pe mina Israel gwa teilu. <verse eid="2CH 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 35:4" />Israel gwangpei David nah pe napei Solomon rangkebeu rau kenzeudung de mzuilu eh nnui pautsa nah nnui mzidung rehi gade nnuide mteilu. <verse eid="2CH 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 35:5" />Nnui mzidung, nnui sinamedung pautsa kelak de ngngwa kemci ni ga nnui saplu, nah Levime pautsa kelak kakga nnui mzidung ga ngngwa nnui bam ga bamlu. <verse eid="2CH 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 35:6" />Kahkegwangngyi meurünnadung gilu, nnuikatei nnuide teimcilu, nnui siname ziemne meurünnadung de mteilu, RAMPAUBE sam Moses dage peu kebeude nzwa teilu kerane.”<verse eid="2CH 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 35:7" />Josiah minadung gwang kebam pelane de Kahkegwangngyi reca ziemne pe kauhaudung gade meurünna nah hemeuna cang camrei pwapeu. Pa ketumseu cangcum de si eh pwapeu; aidungde pelane hegwangpei mabam gade pwapeu. <verse eid="2CH 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 35:8" />Pe kangga muiteumedung suiyi mapeu minadung de, cingkume, nah Levime de pwapeu. Tinggwang kerecaki kerengei peuteume Hilkiah, Zechariah, nah Jehiel, penui cingkume de makaune keceubedung 2,600 nah ketumseu haicum kahkegwangngyi recadung ziemne pwapeu. <verse eid="2CH 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 35:9" />Levime muiteu kedime, Konaniah, nah Shemaiah nah Nethanel, pe sinabe kena, nah Hashabiah, Jeiel, nah Jozabad, Levime de makaune keceube cangmengei nah ketumseu haimengei Kahkegwangngyi recadung ziemne peu.<verse eid="2CH 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 35:10" />Iciu eh nzui gwang kera mteilu, nah cingkume penui bam ga bamlu, Levimedung de penuide mzi kebeu ga, hegwangpei ne rang kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="2CH 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 35:11" />Penui Kahkegwangngyi meurünnadung gilu, nah cingkumedung Levime ba gade penui hejai pwa kelude kezingai, nah Levime meurünnadung geu gaudi. <verse eid="2CH 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 35:12" />Penui keru recadung de keu mpetlu, cidungde pautsa kelak mzidung gage mzi gaibeu kerane, Moses Laisiukwak ga rauteu kela nzwa RAMPAUBE de pwapeu kerane. Penui ketumseudung de de aide nzwa siakte teilu. <verse eid="2CH 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 35:13" />Penui Kahkegwangngyi meuründung de hezai de mzui eh rulu. Teimcikelu recadung cai, penui lidung, tegwalidung, nah likiemdung gage swalu, nah penui cidungde minadung pelane dage pungmie kelwabeudi. <verse eid="2CH 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 35:14" />Pecaine penui katei ziemne nah cingkume ziemne penui recadung teleilu, kedanemene cingkume, Aaron leuhme, keru recadung nah maca tingmui nlütcu kecang pwa reca nnang süt kebamne, cine Levime penui ziemne nah cingkume, Aaron leuhme ziemne recadung mteilu. <verse eid="2CH 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 35:15" />David ne nlum kebeu nzwa lei keteime, Asaph leuhme, penuide nlumkebeu niga bamlu, Asaph, Heman, nah hegwangpei gu caihakecibe Jeduthun, nah kekwame kirie leune ga bam. Penui penuide nlumkebeu nide gidi ma, kedanemene penui siname Levime penui ziemne mtei kebeune.<verse eid="2CH 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 35:16" />Cine, cipau tingdau RAMPAUBE de reca gwang kecu teilu Kahkegwangngyi de mnei kera ziemne, nah RAMPAUBE recabam gage keru recadung recagai beu kerane, hegwangpei Josiah ne rang kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="2CH 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 35:17" />Cipau tingdau Israelme cika kebamme Kahkegwangngyi mnei lu, nah pecai Cehikaikemak Tangku Ngyi lang hena ne kecang hengyilu. <verse eid="2CH 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 35:18" />Israel ga aikenzwa Kahkegwangngyi hengyi cu madau de caihakecibe Samuel tingdau gade hengyi ma, mede Israelme hegwangdung keda migede Josiah hengyi kelu nzwa Kahkegwangngyi aikenzwa hengyi ma, cingkume, Levime, nah Judah ga kelunghme pelane, nah cika kebam Israelme, nah Jerusalem ga kelunghme pelane de si eh. <verse eid="2CH 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 35:19" />Josiah hegwang tei kelu mmi kereieheset bekum Kahkegwangngyi aide mneilu.<verse eid="2CH 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josiah tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 35:20" />Aidungde pelane tei kelucai, Josiah kerecaki tei petau tei luge, Egypt gwangpei, Necho, Euphrate Reuki ga Carchemish gade regi kerane hang, nah Josiah pecu ngngwa regi kera mie. <verse eid="2CH 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 35:21" />Dede Necho samgwame pe dage langgai eh ranggai, “Ih ncu ngngwa daipai ge tei kera bamno, Judah gwangpei? Henai Ih ncu renia kera gwangla ma, dede Ih ngngwa hereu tei kebamme kilungme de renia kerane. Tinggwang acu kelwa lulo rangbeu da, cine Tinggwang, acu ngngwa kelabe de renia so, mecai pa ncu ngkap dizie.” <verse eid="2CH 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 35:22" />Iciuliede, Josiah pe dade nreutet raudi. Pa pecu ngngwa regi kerane perehi teitsam lu. Pa Necho sam Tinggwang dade kegwang de kingnei ma; cine pa Megiddo langkam ga regi kera miedi. <verse eid="2CH 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 35:23" />Lakpi kekapme Hegwangpei Josiah de kapdi, nah hegwangpei pe kilame dage rangdi, “Acu ngngwa tetdi kedanemene acu rezam msiasüt dida.” <verse eid="2CH 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CH 35:24" />Cine pe kilame pecu bagi gade ngngwa mpet lu, delwe pe bagi kedabe gage pecu kailu. Penui pecu Jerusalem ga ngngwa gwangdi, cikade pa tsaidi. Pecu pe paume raukie gage kungdi. Judah nah Jerusalem ga mina pelane Josiah ziemne heei eh hapdi. <verse eid="2CH 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CH 35:25" />Jeremiah hegwangpei Josiah ziemne lei mpokgai; mipei nah mipui lei keteime pelane Josiah ziemne henai kecang de teila. Lei cidungde Israel ga hezai gedi; ainie, leidung cidungde kehap leidung gage raupwa bam. <verse eid="2CH 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CH 35:26" />Josiah tei kegwang kedadung, nah RAMPAUBE zai ga raupwa kebamdung de samzai tei eh heta keyi tei kegaidung, <verse eid="2CH 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CH 35:27" />nah pa tei kegaidung, kerai gade penli kecang, Judah nah Israel gwangdung ha laisiukwak gage raupwala.<verse eid="2CH 35:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="2CH 36" />
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Jehoahaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CH 36:1" />Pecai cika kelunghme Josiah napei Jehoahaz de kedetlu, nah pecu peu pe pei bam leu eh Jerusalem ga hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2CH 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CH 36:2" />Jehoahaz<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fqa">Jehoahaz</char> <char style="ft" closed="false">de Hebrew led gade </char><char style="fqa">Joahaz </char> de raupwa bam dede cide mina hangge de rangbam. </note> pa mmi ngkaiehkecum dige pa hegwang teilu, nah pa Jerusalem ga keicum ge hegwang tei. <verse eid="2CH 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CH 36:3" />Egypt gwangpei pecu Jerusalem gade keu mpetdi, nah Judah de peu rangkanggeu talent haige nah kecak talent ge su. <verse eid="2CH 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CH 36:4" />Egypt gwangpei, Jehoahaz sinabe Eliakim de peu Judah nah Jerusalem reu hegwang teilu (nah Eliakim zi msiak ntsampwa Jehoiakim teidi). Pecai Necho Eliakim sinabe Jehoahaz de Egypt ga ngngwa gwangdi.<verse eid="2CH 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CH 36:5" />Jehoiakim mmi ngkaiehmengei dige pa hegwang teilu, nah pa Jerusalem ga mmi kereiehket hegwang tei. Pa RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang miakdwa gade kemau teidi. <verse eid="2CH 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CH 36:6" />Pecai Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar, pecu gwaketang lütlwe pecu tuihlu delwe kanglu, Babylon ga ngngwa gwang kerane. <verse eid="2CH 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CH 36:7" />Nebuchadnezzar RAMPAUBE ki gade hema kesa pwalu delwe Babylon ga pung gwang, nah pe hegwangki Babylon ga teugwang kailu. <verse eid="2CH 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CH 36:8" />Jehoiakim tei kegwang kedadung cai, pa tei kegai kemneeu tadung, nah pe kesia ngau kelu, ainie, cidungde Judah nah Israel gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala. Pecai pe napei, Jehoiachin, pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2CH 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CH 36:9" />Jehoiachin mmi heset dige pa hegwang teilu; pa keicum eh ziangrei ge Jerusalem ga hegwangtei. Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade kemau teidi <verse eid="2CH 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CH 36:10" />Heriakting gwang ge, Hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar minadung de langgai nah pecu Babylon ga ngngwa gwang, RAMPAUBE ki gade mabam pemi kehungdung de si eh, nah pe kibaume pei Zedekiah de peu Judah nah Jerusalem reu hegwang teilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:11">Mat. 1:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CH 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Zedekiah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CH 36:11" />Zedekiah mmi ngkaiehket dige pa hegwang teilu; pa Jerusalem ga mmi kereiehket hegwang tei. <verse eid="2CH 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CH 36:12" />Pa RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang miakdwa gade kemau teidi. Caihakecibe Jeremiah, RAMPAUBE sam rang kelabe dwa de pa pecu tei henah luma. <verse eid="2CH 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CH 36:13" />Zedekiah de Hegwangpei Nebuchadnezzar liede ngngwa reniadi, peu pecu masanglu zie lie Tinggwang zi gade pe dage sampet kegaibe de. Dede Zedekiah RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang da nreu gwang raudi nah pe lung takdi. <verse eid="2CH 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CH 36:14" />Cipaureude, cingkume muiteume leune nah minadung kette samsanglu tadi, delwe penui heleuh kedame kemneeu zaidung nzuidi. Penui RAMPAUBE ki, pa Jerusalem gade teimci kelude tei heradi.<verse eid="2CH 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kaukedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CH 36:15" />RAMPAUBE, penui paume Tinggwang, pe samgwame penui dage langgai daidai gai, kedanemene pa pe minadung nah pa lungh kebam nide de helungnei kecune. <verse eid="2CH 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CH 36:16" />Dede penui Tinggwang samgwame de teu henui tei, pe sam mlai, nah pe caihakecime de teu henui teidi, RAMPAUBE rata pe minadung da cangsiak kemaktane, kengha gah kedi kecang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:41">Bat. 13:41</ref></char></note><verse eid="2CH 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CH 36:17" />Cine Tinggwang Chaldeame gwangpei de penui dage ngngwa gwang, penui rehangmedung de kemci ni gade kingtie le teitsetdi, nah rehangme de mede releime, kecingme mede peu-pukedime dede ngaunggia beu ma. Tinggwang penui pelane de peba gage kai beudi. <verse eid="2CH 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CH 36:18" />Tinggwang ki gu maniadung pelane, keceu kedi, RAMPAUBE ki, hegwangpei nah pe kangga kedime mabamdung pelane pa Babylon ga pung gwangdi. <verse eid="2CH 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CH 36:19" />Penui Tinggwang ki ru ngkaudi, Jerusalem kirie tei ngkaudi, hegwangkidung pelane rudi, nah cika ma ngau keyi leune teimsia di. <verse eid="2CH 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CH 36:20" />Hegwangpei kingtie gade tsailu kemakme de Babylon ga ngngwa gwangdi. Persia gwangram ngkieng cuhlu kemaktane penui pe kila nah pe name kilame teidi. <verse eid="2CH 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CH 36:21" />Aide kegwang au Jeremiah ne rang kebeu RAMPAUBE sam de teicanglu kerane, kideube Sabbath kemtak zie mnei canglu kemaktane. Ainzwa eh kideube mrwa kebamtane pe Sabbath mneilu, mmi riakhena ge ainzwa tet gwanglu kerane.<verse eid="2CH 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CH 36:22" />Cyrus, Persia gwangpei, hegwang tei raitu bekum, RAMPAUBE sam Jeremiah ne kerang de peu teicanglu kerane, RAMPAUBE Persia gwangpei, Cyrus lung teigai, pe hegwangram pelane ga ndu gai lu kerane, nah kerau gage de kailu kera. Pa rangdi, <verse eid="2CH 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CH 36:23" />“Persia gwangpei, Cyrus ainzwa ranggai: RAMPAUBE, tinggim Tinggwang, acu kideureu ga hegwangram pelane pwapeu da. Pa acu Jerusalem ga pe ziemne ki ge tei kera aja kaigai, cide au Judah ga. Pe mina pelane gade caugame nnui kakga bam bi, peu RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de, nnuide ngngwala lu. Peu pecu hangdeu cika miecu,”<verse eid="2CH 36:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CH 36" />
</usx>